#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"`chimera_client` is the Clash-compatible client runtime in the Chimera "
"ecosystem. Its design goal is practical compatibility with existing Clash/"
"Mihomo profiles, while using Rust’s type safety and async ecosystem to build "
"a maintainable codebase."
msgstr ""
"`chimera_client` 是 Chimera 生态中的 Clash 兼容客户端运行时。它的设计目标是在"
"兼容现有 Clash/Mihomo 配置的同时，利用 Rust 的类型安全与异步生态构建一个可维"
"护的代码库。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "For operators, this means:"
msgstr "对运维人员而言，这意味着："

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Preserve familiar configuration and policy mental models."
msgstr "保留熟悉的配置与策略心智模型。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"Improve implementation clarity through explicit schema and module boundaries."
msgstr "通过明确的 schema 与模块边界提升实现清晰度。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"Enable incremental parity: start from stable basics (e.g., SOCKS inbound + "
"rules), then close feature gaps against `clash-rs` and Mihomo."
msgstr ""
"支持渐进式对齐：从稳定的基础能力（如 SOCKS 入站 + rules）开始，再逐步补齐与 "
"`clash-rs` 和 Mihomo 之间的特性差距。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Relationship to Clash-rs and Mihomo"
msgstr "与 Clash-rs 和 Mihomo 的关系"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"`chimera_client` documentation treats `clash-rs` and Mihomo as the two most "
"important references:"
msgstr ""
"`chimera_client` 文档将 `clash-rs` 和 Mihomo 视为两个最重要的参考实现："

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"**clash-rs**: Rust-native reference for parser/runtime behavior and config "
"semantics."
msgstr "**clash-rs**：用于解析器 / 运行时行为和配置语义的 Rust 原生参考实现。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"**Mihomo**: de-facto production reference for broad ecosystem compatibility "
"and advanced operational features."
msgstr "**Mihomo**：广泛生态兼容性和高级运维特性的事实生产参考。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "In this chapter, each module page clearly marks:"
msgstr "在本章中，每个模块页面都会明确标注："

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "what works in `chimera_client` now,"
msgstr "`chimera_client` 当前已可用的内容，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "what is Clash/Mihomo-compatible target behavior,"
msgstr "什么是与 Clash/Mihomo 兼容的目标行为，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "and what migration precautions to apply today."
msgstr "以及当前应采取哪些迁移注意事项。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Architecture Overview"
msgstr "架构概览"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Internally, the client is organized into four layers:"
msgstr "在内部，客户端被组织为四层："

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**Configuration layer**"
msgstr "**配置层**"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Parses Clash-style YAML into typed Rust structures."
msgstr "将 Clash 风格 YAML 解析为类型化的 Rust 结构。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Handles defaults, validation, and hot-reload boundaries."
msgstr "处理默认值、校验与热重载边界。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**Inbound/controller layer**"
msgstr "**入站 / 控制层**"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Owns local listeners (SOCKS/HTTP/mixed/TUN as parity evolves)."
msgstr "负责本地监听器（SOCKS/HTTP/mixed/TUN，随对齐进展逐步完善）。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Exposes management APIs for status, switching, and diagnostics."
msgstr "暴露用于状态查询、切换与诊断的管理 API。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**Policy and DNS layer**"
msgstr "**策略与 DNS 层**"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Evaluates rule chains with first-match semantics."
msgstr "以首条命中语义执行规则链。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"Provides DNS strategy primitives (system resolver today; Clash-style DNS "
"target)."
msgstr "提供 DNS 策略原语（当前为系统解析器，目标是 Clash 风格 DNS）。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "**Outbound transport layer**"
msgstr "**出站传输层**"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Executes protocol handshakes and stream forwarding."
msgstr "执行协议握手与流转发。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"Encapsulates protocol-specific knobs while sharing common TLS/socket "
"utilities."
msgstr "封装协议特定参数，同时复用通用 TLS / socket 工具。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"This split mirrors common Clash-family architecture and reduces coupling "
"between parser, runtime, and protocol engines."
msgstr ""
"这种划分与常见的 Clash 家族架构一致，并降低了解析器、运行时与协议引擎之间的耦"
"合。"

