#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Current recommended pattern for production-like use:"
msgstr "当前推荐的类生产使用模式："

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Start with SOCKS-based local proxying."
msgstr "从基于 SOCKS 的本地代理开始。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"Keep DNS conservative unless you are validating an in-progress DNS branch."
msgstr "除非你正在验证开发中的 DNS 分支，否则应对 DNS 配置保持保守。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "Use explicit rule ordering and small provider sets first, then scale."
msgstr "先使用显式规则顺序和较小的 provider 集，再逐步扩展。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"Add TUN only when parity branch and environment prerequisites are verified."
msgstr "仅在对齐分支和环境前置条件都验证完成后再启用 TUN。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"For CI/testing, keep one minimal profile and one Clash/Mihomo-parity profile "
"to detect parser/runtime divergence early."
msgstr ""
"对于 CI / 测试，建议同时保留一个最小配置和一个 Clash/Mihomo 对齐配置，以尽早"
"发现解析器 / 运行时偏差。"

