msgstr "长期性能策略与 Clash 家族工作负载保持一致："

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "predictable low-overhead rule matching,"
msgstr "可预测、低开销的规则匹配，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "bounded memory behavior in long-lived sessions,"
msgstr "长生命周期会话下受控的内存行为，"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid "and high observability for policy debugging."
msgstr "以及面向策略调试的高可观测性。"

#: src/chimera_client.md
msgid ""
"When introducing parity features (DNS/TUN/listeners), prioritize "
"deterministic behavior and debuggability over implicit \"magic\" defaults."
msgstr ""
