msgstr "为什么 DNS 设计很重要"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"Domain rules require stable mapping between query results and connection "
"flow."
msgstr "域名规则要求查询结果与连接流之间保持稳定映射。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"Fake-IP mode can preserve domain intent even when apps later connect by IP."
msgstr "即使应用后续按 IP 建连，fake-IP 模式仍可保留域名语义。"

#: src/chimera_client/dns.md
msgid ""
"Resolver choice impacts censorship resistance, startup reliability, and "
"privacy leakage."
