msgstr "`bool` 或 `list`"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Enables DNS interception behavior in TUN path."
msgstr "在 TUN 路径中启用 DNS 劫持行为。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Per-Option Behavior (Clash-rs Source of Truth)"
msgstr "按选项说明的行为（以 Clash-rs 为准）"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"This section expands every `tun` field from `TunConfig` in `clash-rs` and "
"explains practical impact."
msgstr ""
"本节会展开说明 `clash-rs` 中 `TunConfig` 的每个 `tun` 字段，并解释其实际影"
"响。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Turns the whole TUN pipeline on/off."
msgstr "控制整个 TUN 流水线的启用 / 关闭。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`false` means all other `tun` fields are ignored at runtime."
msgstr "`false` 表示运行时会忽略其他所有 `tun` 字段。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Interface identifier and creation mode."
msgstr "接口标识符与创建模式。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Accepted forms in clash-rs parser:"
msgstr "clash-rs 解析器接受的形式："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`dev://<name>`: create/use a named TUN device."
msgstr "`dev://<name>`：创建或使用具名 TUN 设备。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "plain `<name>`: treated as `dev://<name>`."
msgstr "纯 `<name>`：按 `dev://<name>` 处理。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"`fd://<n>`: adopt an already-open file descriptor (advanced embedding/"
"systemd style)."
msgstr "`fd://<n>`：接管一个已经打开的文件描述符（高级嵌入 / systemd 风格）。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Alias keys accepted by parser: `device-url`, `device`."
msgstr "解析器接受的别名键：`device-url`、`device`。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "IPv4 CIDR assigned to TUN NIC, e.g. `198.18.0.1/24`."
msgstr "分配给 TUN 网卡的 IPv4 CIDR，例如 `198.18.0.1/24`。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "This defines both local TUN IP and prefix used for routing decisions."
msgstr "它同时定义本地 TUN IP 和用于路由决策的前缀。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Optional IPv6 CIDR for TUN NIC."
msgstr "分配给 TUN 网卡的可选 IPv6 CIDR。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "If omitted, IPv6 handling in TUN path is effectively disabled."
msgstr "若省略，则 TUN 路径中的 IPv6 处理实际上会被禁用。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`true`: full-tunnel, install default-path style routes/rules."
msgstr "`true`：全隧道，安装默认路径风格的路由 / 规则。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`false`: split-tunnel, only prefixes in `routes` are sent to TUN."
msgstr "`false`：分流，仅将 `routes` 中的前缀送入 TUN。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "If `route-all: true`, `routes` list becomes operationally irrelevant."
msgstr "如果 `route-all: true`，则 `routes` 列表在运行时基本失去意义。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "CIDR list used for split-tunnel mode (`route-all: false`)."
msgstr "用于分流模式（`route-all: false`）的 CIDR 列表。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Typical use: route specific public resolvers, target regions, or service "
"networks only."
msgstr "典型用法：仅路由特定公共解析器、目标地区或服务网络。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "TUN interface MTU override."
msgstr "TUN 接口 MTU 覆盖值。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Leave unset for runtime/platform defaults; set explicitly when encountering "
"fragmentation/PMTU issues."
msgstr "不设置时使用运行时 / 平台默认值；遇到分片 / PMTU 问题时再显式设置。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Linux-only fwmark attached to outbound packets."
msgstr "仅 Linux 使用，附加到出站数据包上的 fwmark。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Used with `ip rule`/`iptables`/`nftables` to avoid proxy loops and integrate "
"custom policy routing."
msgstr ""
"与 `ip rule` / `iptables` / `nftables` 配合使用，以避免代理环路并集成自定义策"
"略路由。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Linux-only policy route table index used by clash-rs TUN route installation."
msgstr "仅 Linux 使用的策略路由表索引，由 clash-rs 的 TUN 路由安装逻辑使用。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Default is `2468`; change when your system already uses that table number."
msgstr "默认值为 `2468`；若你的系统已占用该表号，则应修改。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`false`: do not redirect DNS in TUN path."
msgstr "`false`：不在 TUN 路径中重定向 DNS。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`true`: hijack UDP/53 queries to Clash DNS service."
msgstr "`true`：将 UDP/53 查询劫持到 Clash DNS 服务。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"`list`: clash-rs currently treats list mode as enabling hijack behavior "
"(same effect as `true`)."
msgstr ""
"`list`：clash-rs 当前会把列表模式视为启用劫持行为（效果与 `true` 相同）。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Mihomo Gap Notes (Based on Public Tun Docs)"
msgstr "Mihomo 差异说明（基于公开 Tun 文档）"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Compared with the clash-rs schema above, the following items are not "
"documented as first-class tun keys in mihomo (same-name or same-shape):"
msgstr ""
"与上面的 clash-rs 结构相比，以下项目在 mihomo 中未被记录为一等的 tun 键（同名"
"或同形）："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`device-id` with `fd://<n>` file-descriptor form."
msgstr "带 `fd://<n>` 文件描述符形式的 `device-id`。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Mihomo docs expose `device` but do not document fd-based takeover syntax."
msgstr "Mihomo 文档暴露了 `device`，但没有记录基于 fd 的接管语法。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`gateway` / `gateway-v6` explicit interface-address assignment fields."
msgstr "`gateway` / `gateway-v6` 这类显式接口地址分配字段。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Mihomo tun docs focus on route/rule controls and do not expose clash-rs-"
"style gateway CIDR keys."
msgstr ""
"Mihomo 的 tun 文档更关注 route / rule 控制，没有暴露 clash-rs 风格的 gateway "
"CIDR 键。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`route-all` + `routes` exact pair."
msgstr "`route-all` + `routes` 这对精确键。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Mihomo uses `auto-route`, `route-address`, `route-exclude-address` style "
"controls instead of clash-rs key shape."
msgstr ""
"Mihomo 使用 `auto-route`、`route-address`、`route-exclude-address` 这类控制"
"项，而不是 clash-rs 的键形态。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`route-table` exact naming."
msgstr "`route-table` 的准确命名。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Mihomo exposes `iproute2-table-index` / `iproute2-rule-index`; functionally "
"close but not the same key contract."
msgstr ""
"Mihomo 暴露的是 `iproute2-table-index` / `iproute2-rule-index`；功能上接近，"
"但键契约并不相同。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Note: `so-mark` in clash-rs and `routing-mark` in mihomo are conceptually "
"similar (Linux packet mark), so this is a naming/compatibility difference, "
"not a missing capability."
msgstr ""
"注意：clash-rs 中的 `so-mark` 与 mihomo 中的 `routing-mark` 在概念上相近（都"
"是 Linux packet mark），因此这是命名 / 兼容性差异，而不是能力缺失。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Device-ID Formats"
msgstr "Device-ID 格式"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`dev://utun1989` or `utun1989`: create/use named TUN device."
msgstr "`dev://utun1989` 或 `utun1989`：创建/使用具名 TUN 设备。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`dev://tun0`: common Linux style."
msgstr "`dev://tun0`：常见 Linux 写法。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"`fd://3`: use an existing file descriptor, useful when another component "
"owns TUN creation."
msgstr "`fd://3`：使用现有文件描述符，适用于由其他组件创建 TUN 的场景。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "On macOS, the device name must use the `utun` prefix."
msgstr "在 macOS 上，设备名必须使用 `utun` 前缀。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Routing Behavior"
msgstr "路由行为"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`route-all: true`"
msgstr "`route-all: true`"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Linux: uses policy routing rules and a dedicated route table (`route-table`)."
msgstr "Linux：使用策略路由规则和独立路由表（`route-table`）。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "macOS/Windows: installs broad default-route entries through TUN."
msgstr "macOS/Windows：通过 TUN 安装较宽泛的默认路由项。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"DNS hijack integration is tied to this path on Linux (policy rule for "
"destination port `53`)."
msgstr "在 Linux 上，DNS 劫持集成绑定于该路径（目标端口 `53` 的策略规则）。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`route-all: false`"
msgstr "`route-all: false`"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Only CIDRs in `routes` are routed through TUN."
msgstr "仅 `routes` 中的 CIDR 会通过 TUN 路由。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"This is safer for partial rollout and avoids taking over all host traffic."
msgstr "这更适合分阶段上线，并避免接管主机全部流量。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "If both are configured, `route-all` takes precedence operationally."
msgstr "若两者同时配置，运行时以 `route-all` 为准。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "DNS Interaction"
msgstr "DNS 交互"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"`dns-hijack` controls DNS interception in TUN flow, but it does not replace "
"a working DNS module config."
msgstr ""
"`dns-hijack` 控制 TUN 流中的 DNS 劫持，但它不能替代可工作的 DNS 模块配置。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"For predictable domain-based routing, pair TUN with DNS settings (`dns."
"enable`, resolver list, fake-IP strategy where needed)."
msgstr ""
"要获得可预测的基于域名路由效果，应将 TUN 与 DNS 设置（`dns.enable`、解析器列"
"表、按需 fake-IP 策略）配套使用。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"In practice, `dns-hijack: true` is commonly paired with fake-IP mode in "
"Clash-style deployments."
msgstr ""
"在实践中，Clash 风格部署通常将 `dns-hijack: true` 与 fake-IP 模式搭配使用。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Linux Notes (Policy Routing)"
msgstr "Linux 注意事项（策略路由）"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Ensure `iproute2` (`ip` command) is available."
msgstr "确保已安装 `iproute2`（`ip` 命令可用）。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Run with sufficient privileges (CAP_NET_ADMIN or root-equivalent)."
msgstr "以足够权限运行（CAP_NET_ADMIN 或等效 root 权限）。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Prefer setting `so-mark` and keep it consistent with your external policy "
"rules to avoid proxy loops."
msgstr "建议设置 `so-mark`，并与外部策略规则保持一致，以避免代理环路。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Quick checks:"
msgstr "快速检查："

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Example Profiles"
msgstr "示例配置"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Full-tunnel profile"
msgstr "全隧道配置"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Split-route profile"
msgstr "分流配置"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "\"dev://tun0\""
msgstr "\"dev://tun0\""

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "routes"
msgstr "routes"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "1.1.1.1/32"
msgstr "1.1.1.1/32"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "8.8.8.8/32"
msgstr "8.8.8.8/32"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "FD-based profile"
msgstr "基于 FD 的配置"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "\"fd://3\""
msgstr "\"fd://3\""

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Verify process privileges first; TUN creation and route changes fail "
"silently in many restricted environments."
msgstr "先确认进程权限；在许多受限环境中，TUN 创建和路由变更会静默失败。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Confirm the interface exists (`ip addr`, `ifconfig`, or platform equivalent)."
msgstr "确认接口已存在（`ip addr`、`ifconfig` 或平台等效命令）。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Validate route/rule installation after startup."
msgstr "启动后验证路由/规则是否正确安装。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"If DNS appears broken, verify the DNS listener is reachable and the system "
"resolver path actually passes through TUN."
msgstr "若 DNS 异常，请确认 DNS 监听器可达，且系统解析路径确实经过 TUN。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"If traffic loops or stalls, check `so-mark`/policy-rule alignment and "
"existing host firewall rules."
msgstr ""
"若流量出现环路或卡顿，请检查 `so-mark`/策略规则的一致性以及主机现有防火墙规"
"则。"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "References and Alignment Notes"
msgstr "参考与对齐说明"

#: src/chimera_client/tun.md
msgid ""
"Clash-rs config schema: `clash-lib/src/config/def.rs` (`TunConfig`, "
"defaults, `dns-hijack` shape)."
msgstr ""
"Clash-rs 配置结构：`clash-lib/src/config/def.rs`（`TunConfig`、默认值、`dns-"
"hijack` 形态）。"

