#: src/chimera.md
msgid "Design Goals"
msgstr "设计目标"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera` serves as a high-performance ingress layer responsible for "
"terminating client sessions, enforcing policies, and forwarding traffic to "
"the target destination. A single ingress port can simultaneously expose "
"multiple proxy protocols."
msgstr ""
"`Chimera` 作为高性能入口层，负责终止客户端会话、执行策略，并将流量转发到目标"
"地址。单个入口端口可同时暴露多种代理协议。"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "The core design priorities of Chimera are:"
msgstr "Chimera 的核心设计优先级包括："

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "minimizing handshake latency,"
msgstr "最小化握手延迟，"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "providing fine-grained access control,"
msgstr "提供细粒度访问控制，"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "ensuring cross-platform compatibility,"
msgstr "确保跨平台兼容性，"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "enabling horizontal scalability,"
msgstr "支持水平扩展，"

#: src/chimera.md
msgid "offer built-in observability."
msgstr "并提供内建可观测性。"

