#: src/protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Deployment Notes"
msgstr "部署注意事项"

#: src/protocols/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Keep `path` and mode fully aligned between client and server, otherwise "
"handshakes fail."
msgstr "保持客户端与服务端 `path` 和 mode 完全一致，否则握手会失败。"

#: src/protocols/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Prefer realistic but stable headers; frequently changing fingerprints can "
"hurt reliability."
msgstr "优先使用真实且稳定的请求头；频繁变更指纹会降低稳定性。"

#: src/protocols/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"If deploying behind Nginx/Caddy/CDN, ensure request buffering and timeout "
"limits fit long-lived proxy streams."
msgstr ""
"若部署在 Nginx/Caddy/CDN 后方，请确保请求缓冲与超时限制适配长连接代理流。"

#: src/protocols/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Start with conservative `xmux` values, then tune concurrency after observing "
"latency and upstream limits."
msgstr "先使用保守的 `xmux` 参数，待观察延迟与上游限制后再调高并发。"

#: src/protocols/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"`EOF` immediately after connect: verify UUID, TLS server name, and `path` "
"consistency."
msgstr ""
"连接后立即出现 `EOF`：请检查 UUID、TLS server name 以及 `path` 是否一致。"

#: src/protocols/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Frequent reconnects: check reverse proxy idle timeout and HTTP/2 upstream "
"settings."
msgstr "频繁重连：请检查反向代理空闲超时和 HTTP/2 上游设置。"

#: src/protocols/xhttp.md
msgid ""
"Good handshake but poor throughput: reduce header bloat, tune `xmux`, and "
"verify CDN region affinity."
msgstr ""
"握手正常但吞吐差：请减少请求头冗余、调优 `xmux`，并确认 CDN 区域亲和性。"

#: src/protocols/reality.md
msgid ""
"TLS camouflage layer from the Xray ecosystem that imitates a TLS 1.3 "
"handshake without issuing a certificate."
msgstr "来自 Xray 生态的 TLS 伪装层，可在不签发证书的情况下模拟 TLS 1.3 握手。"

#: src/protocols/reality.md
msgid ""
"Uses a server public key and short ID to bind the handshake to a real-"
"looking TLS fingerprint."
msgstr "使用服务端公钥与 short ID，将握手绑定到看似真实的 TLS 指纹。"

#: src/protocols/reality.md
msgid ""
"Commonly paired with VLESS or Trojan to provide authentication and routing "
"on top of the transport."
msgstr "通常与 VLESS 或 Trojan 搭配，在传输层之上提供认证与路由能力。"

#: src/protocols/reality.md
msgid ""
"Client selects a cover domain and configures the server public key + short "
"ID."
msgstr "客户端选择伪装域名，并配置服务端公钥 + short ID。"

#: src/protocols/reality.md
msgid ""
"Client initiates a TLS 1.3-like handshake (uTLS fingerprint) with SNI set to "
"the cover domain."
msgstr "客户端发起类 TLS 1.3 握手（uTLS 指纹），并将 SNI 设为伪装域名。"

#: src/protocols/reality.md
msgid "Server validates the short ID and key exchange to accept the session."
msgstr "服务器校验 short ID 与密钥交换后接受该会话。"

#: src/protocols/reality.md
msgid ""
"On success, the connection upgrades to the chosen proxy protocol (for "
"example VLESS)."
msgstr "成功后，连接升级为选定的代理协议（例如 VLESS）。"

#: src/protocols/reality.md
msgid ""
"Avoids certificate issuance and rotation while keeping TLS-like handshake "
"behavior."
msgstr "在保持类 TLS 握手行为的同时，避免证书签发与轮换。"

#: src/protocols/reality.md
msgid ""
"Harder to fingerprint via passive inspection when the TLS client fingerprint "
"matches common browsers."
msgstr "当 TLS 客户端指纹贴近常见浏览器时，更难被被动探测识别。"

#: src/protocols/reality.md
msgid "Integrates with XTLS flow control for reduced overhead."
msgstr "可与 XTLS 流控集成以降低开销。"

#: src/protocols/reality.md
msgid ""
"Requires compatible client fingerprints; mismatches can break connectivity."
msgstr "需要兼容的客户端指纹；不匹配会导致连接失败。"

#: src/protocols/reality.md
msgid "Mostly confined to the Xray tooling ecosystem."
msgstr "主要局限在 Xray 工具生态内。"

#: src/protocols/reality.md
msgid ""
"Effectiveness depends on the chosen cover domain and correct configuration."
msgstr "效果取决于伪装域名选择与配置正确性。"

#: src\preface.md
msgid ""
"The proxy ecosystem is broad and fragmented. Proxy Wiki exists to document "
"the Chimera projects as one coherent stack and to make their relationships "
"easier to understand."
msgstr "代理生态庞大且较为分散。Proxy Wiki 的目标是将 Chimera 各项目作为一个完整技术栈进行记录，并帮助读者更清晰地理解它们之间的关系。"

#: src\preface.md
msgid ""
"The projects draw inspiration from several established open-source projects:"
msgstr "这些项目借鉴了多个成熟的开源项目："

#: src\preface.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera_Client` builds on ideas from "
"[clash-rs](https://github.com/Watfaq/clash-rs), with broader "
"Clash/Mihomo-style compatibility as a long-term direction."
msgstr "`Chimera_Client` 借鉴了 [clash-rs](https://github.com/Watfaq/clash-rs) 的设计思路，并将更广泛的 Clash/Mihomo 风格兼容性作为长期发展方向。"

#: src\preface.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera` is inspired by "
"[clash-nyanpasu](https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu), while "
"prioritizing first-class support for the `Chimera_Client` engine and related "
"cores."
msgstr "`Chimera` 受到 [clash-nyanpasu](https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu) 启发，同时优先为 `Chimera_Client` 引擎及相关核心提供一等支持。"

#: src\preface.md
msgid ""
"`Chimera_Server` explores a Rust server stack influenced by "
"[xray-core](https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core) and "
"[shoes](https://github.com/cfal/shoes), with xray-core compatibility as a "
"long-term goal."
msgstr "`Chimera_Server` 探索以 Rust 构建服务端技术栈，其设计受到 [xray-core](https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core) 与 [shoes](https://github.com/cfal/shoes) 的影响，并以兼容 xray-core 作为长期目标。"

#: src\preface.md
msgid ""
"These statements describe project direction, not a guarantee that every "
"upstream feature is already implemented. Current gaps and unresolved "
"compatibility questions are tracked in [Open Questions](./open-questions.md)."
msgstr "以上内容描述的是项目的发展方向，并不表示所有上游功能都已经实现。当前缺口以及尚未解决的兼容性问题记录在 [Open Questions](./open-questions.md) 中。"

#: src\introduction.md
msgid "This documentation set introduces the Chimera proxy ecosystem, focusing on the projects that are visible in the local workspace:"
msgstr "本文档集介绍 Chimera 代理生态，重点说明当前本地工作区中可见的几个项目："

#: src\introduction.md
msgid "`Chimera_Client`: a Rust client core based on the `clash-rs` architecture and aimed at Clash/Mihomo-compatible configuration behavior."
msgstr "`Chimera_Client`：基于 `clash-rs` 架构的 Rust 客户端核心，目标是提供与 Clash/Mihomo 兼容的配置行为。"

#: src\introduction.md
msgid "`Chimera`: a Tauri + React desktop application that manages profiles, core binaries, runtime configuration, system proxy integration, service mode, and updates."
msgstr "`Chimera`：基于 Tauri + React 的桌面应用，用于管理配置文件、核心二进制文件、运行时配置、系统代理集成、服务模式以及更新。"

#: src\introduction.md
msgid "`Chimera_Server`: a Rust server core that tracks `xray-core`\\-style inbound configuration and protocol behavior."
msgstr "`Chimera_Server`：Rust 服务端核心，参考 `xray-core` 风格的入站配置与协议行为。"

#: src\introduction.md
msgid "`AChimera`: an adjacent Android-oriented project whose relationship to this documentation set still needs a dedicated page."
msgstr "`AChimera`：一个面向 Android 的相关项目，它与本文档集之间的关系仍需要单独页面进一步说明。"

#: src\introduction.md
msgid "Each module targets a different layer of the overall stack, but they share a common goal: making proxy configuration, operation, and development easier to reason about under diverse network conditions."
msgstr "各模块面向整个技术栈中的不同层级，但目标一致：让代理配置、运行和开发在不同网络环境下都更容易理解、分析和维护。"

#: src\introduction.md
msgid "How to Use This Wiki"
msgstr "如何使用本 Wiki"

#: src\introduction.md
msgid "The documentation is organized around two reading paths:"
msgstr "本文档主要按两条阅读路径组织："

#: src\introduction.md
msgid "**Users and operators** should start with the component overview, then move to configuration-oriented pages such as ports, DNS, TUN, rules, runtime configuration, and service mode."
msgstr "**普通用户与运维人员**建议先阅读组件总览，再进入端口、DNS、TUN、规则、运行时配置和服务模式等偏配置与使用的页面。"

#: src\introduction.md
msgid "**Developers and maintainers** should use the topology and protocol sections together with component-specific implementation notes to understand runtime boundaries, configuration flow, compatibility goals, and extension points."
msgstr "**开发者与维护者**建议结合系统拓扑、协议章节以及各组件的实现说明，理解运行时边界、配置流、兼容目标和扩展点。"

#: src\introduction.md
msgid "The [System Topology](./system-topology.md) page is the best starting point when trying to understand how the desktop application, client core, and server core fit together. The [Protocol Reference](./protocol.md) collects protocol-specific notes and comparisons."
msgstr "如果希望先理解桌面应用、客户端核心和服务端核心之间如何协作，建议从 [System Topology](./system-topology.md) 开始阅读。[Protocol Reference](./protocol.md) 则集中整理各类协议的说明与对比。"

#: src\introduction.md
msgid "Documentation Status"
msgstr "文档状态"

#: src\introduction.md
msgid "This Wiki documents both current behavior and longer-term project direction. Where the implementation boundary is not yet clear, the text should be treated as a working reference rather than a compatibility guarantee. Known gaps, missing matrices, and questions that still require verification are tracked in [Open Questions](./open-questions.md)."
msgstr "本 Wiki 同时记录当前行为和较长期的项目方向。对于实现边界尚未明确的内容，应将其视为工作参考，而不是兼容性保证。已知缺口、尚缺的兼容矩阵以及仍需验证的问题统一记录在 [Open Questions](./open-questions.md) 中。"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "The current workspace is organized around a client GUI, a client core, and a server core. The pieces are related, but they are not one shared runtime:"
msgstr "当前工作区主要由客户端 GUI、客户端核心和服务端核心构成。这些组件彼此相关，但并不运行在同一个共享运行时中："

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"    App[\"Local applications\"] --> Listener[\"HTTP / SOCKS / mixed / TUN listeners\"]\n"
"    Listener --> Client[\"Chimera_Client / clash-rs-compatible core\"]\n"
"    GUI[\"Chimera desktop GUI\"] --> Client\n"
"    GUI --> Service[\"chimera-service / service mode\"]\n"
"    Service --> Client\n"
"    Client --> Remote[\"Remote proxy server\"]\n"
"    Remote --> Server[\"Chimera_Server or compatible xray-core server\"]\n"
"    Server --> Internet[\"Target services / internet\"]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"    App[\"本地应用\"] --> Listener[\"HTTP / SOCKS / mixed / TUN 监听器\"]\n"
"    Listener --> Client[\"Chimera_Client / clash-rs 兼容核心\"]\n"
"    GUI[\"Chimera 桌面 GUI\"] --> Client\n"
"    GUI --> Service[\"chimera-service / 服务模式\"]\n"
"    Service --> Client\n"
"    Client --> Remote[\"远程代理服务器\"]\n"
"    Remote --> Server[\"Chimera_Server 或兼容的 xray-core 服务端\"]\n"
"    Server --> Internet[\"目标服务 / 互联网\"]\n"
"```"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "Component Roles"
msgstr "组件职责"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "The implementation references below point to companion project repositories in the broader Chimera workspace; they are not paths inside this Wiki repository."
msgstr "下方实现参考指向更广泛 Chimera 工作区中的配套项目仓库，并不是本 Wiki 仓库内部的路径。"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "Component"
msgstr "组件"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "Runtime role"
msgstr "运行时职责"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "Implementation references"
msgstr "实现参考"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "`Chimera`"
msgstr "`Chimera`"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "Desktop control surface. It imports profiles, selects and updates proxy cores, generates runtime config, manages system proxy state, and can start the core either as a child process or through service mode."
msgstr "桌面控制层。负责导入配置文件、选择和更新代理核心、生成运行时配置、管理系统代理状态，并可通过子进程模式或服务模式启动核心。"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "`Chimera/README.md`, `backend/tauri/src/lib.rs`, `backend/tauri/src/core/clash/core.rs`"
msgstr "`Chimera/README.md`、`backend/tauri/src/lib.rs`、`backend/tauri/src/core/clash/core.rs`"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "`Chimera_Client`"
msgstr "`Chimera_Client`"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "Clash-family client core. It parses Clash-style YAML, starts inbound listeners, resolves DNS, applies rules, dials outbound proxies, exposes REST APIs, and supports hot reload."
msgstr "Clash 系客户端核心。负责解析 Clash 风格 YAML、启动入站监听器、执行 DNS 解析、应用规则、连接出站代理、提供 REST API，并支持热重载。"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "`Chimera_Client/README.md`, `clash-lib/src/config/def.rs`, `clash-lib/src/app/*`"
msgstr "`Chimera_Client/README.md`、`clash-lib/src/config/def.rs`、`clash-lib/src/app/*`"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "`Chimera_Server`"
msgstr "`Chimera_Server`"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "xray-core-compatible server core, currently centered on inbound parsing and inbound protocol behavior."
msgstr "面向 xray-core 兼容性的服务端核心，目前重点集中在入站配置解析和入站协议行为。"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "`Chimera_Server/README.md`, `chimera_server_app`, `chimera_server_lib`"
msgstr "`Chimera_Server/README.md`、`chimera_server_app`、`chimera_server_lib`"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "Traffic Flow"
msgstr "流量路径"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "Applications enter the client through local HTTP, SOCKS, mixed, TUN, redir, or TProxy listeners, depending on enabled features and platform support."
msgstr "应用流量根据启用的功能和平台支持情况，通过本地 HTTP、SOCKS、mixed、TUN、redir 或 TProxy 监听器进入客户端核心。"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "`Chimera_Client` classifies each flow with its rule engine and DNS resolver."
msgstr "`Chimera_Client` 使用规则引擎和 DNS 解析器对每条连接流进行分类。"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "The selected outbound protocol establishes the remote connection."
msgstr "随后由选定的出站协议建立远程连接。"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "On the server side, `Chimera_Server` can terminate supported inbound protocols and forward traffic according to the configured server behavior."
msgstr "在服务端，`Chimera_Server` 可以终止其支持的入站协议连接，并按照服务端配置继续转发流量。"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "Control Flow"
msgstr "控制流程"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "`Chimera` does not terminate remote proxy protocols itself. It manages the local core lifecycle and runtime files:"
msgstr "`Chimera` 本身并不终止远程代理协议连接，而是负责管理本地核心生命周期与运行时文件："

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "profile files live under the app profile/config directories,"
msgstr "配置文件存放在应用的 profile/config 目录中；"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "`profiles.yaml` tracks profile metadata,"
msgstr "`profiles.yaml` 用于记录配置文件元数据；"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "a generated runtime YAML is passed to the selected core,"
msgstr "生成后的运行时 YAML 会传递给当前选中的核心；"

#: src\system-topology.md
msgid "service mode moves core lifecycle into `chimera-service` while the GUI remains the control surface."
msgstr "服务模式会把核心生命周期管理交给 `chimera-service`，而 GUI 仍作为控制界面。"

