msgstr "SSH"

#: src\chimera_client.md
msgid "Enable incremental parity while keeping the implementation testable across DNS, TUN, REST API, inbound listeners, and outbound protocols."
msgstr "在逐步补齐兼容能力的同时，保持 DNS、TUN、REST API、入站监听器和出站协议等模块具有清晰、可验证的实现边界。"

#: src\chimera_client.md
msgid "Owns local listeners (SOCKS/HTTP/mixed/TUN/redir/TProxy depending on build features and platform support)."
msgstr "负责本地监听器（SOCKS/HTTP/mixed/TUN/redir/TProxy，具体取决于编译特性与平台支持）。"

#: src\chimera_client.md
msgid "Provides system and enhanced DNS resolver paths, DNS listener support, Fake-IP mapping, and DNS rule-dispatch hooks."
msgstr "提供系统解析与增强 DNS 解析路径、DNS 监听支持、Fake-IP 映射以及 DNS 规则分发钩子。"

#: src\chimera_client.md
msgid "SOCKS/HTTP/mixed plus redir/TProxy fields; actual availability depends on Cargo features such as `mixed_port`, `redir`, and `tproxy`"
msgstr "包含 SOCKS/HTTP/mixed 以及 redir/TProxy 配置字段；实际可用性取决于 `mixed_port`、`redir`、`tproxy` 等 Cargo feature"

#: src\chimera_client.md
msgid "DNS block exists; supports disabled/system path, listener, enhanced resolver, Fake-IP, policy/fallback structures, and `respect-rules` hooks"
msgstr "已存在 DNS 配置块，支持禁用/系统解析路径、监听器、增强解析器、Fake-IP、policy/fallback 结构以及 `respect-rules` 钩子"

#: src\chimera_client.md
msgid "`tun` block exists in parser and internal config; runtime is feature/platform dependent"
msgstr "解析器和内部配置中已存在 `tun` 配置块；运行时能力取决于 feature 与平台"

#: src\chimera_client.md
msgid "Recommended rollout pattern for production-like use:"
msgstr "面向接近生产环境的使用场景，建议按以下顺序逐步启用："

#: src\chimera_client.md
msgid "Enable DNS listener and Fake-IP only after you have checked rule behavior and OS resolver routing."
msgstr "确认规则行为和操作系统 DNS 解析路径无误后，再启用 DNS 监听器与 Fake-IP。"

#: src\chimera_client.md
msgid "Add TUN only after verifying build features, privileges, route changes, and DNS hijack behavior on the target OS."
msgstr "只有在目标操作系统上确认编译特性、权限、路由变更和 DNS 劫持行为均符合预期后，再启用 TUN。"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "`Chimera` is the desktop control surface for the Chimera client ecosystem. It is built with Tauri, Rust, and React, and its job is to make daily proxy operation clearer: import profiles, switch nodes, select the proxy core, inspect runtime state, manage system integration, and keep the core/app updated."
msgstr "`Chimera` 是 Chimera 客户端生态的桌面控制界面。它基于 Tauri、Rust 和 React 构建，用于简化日常代理操作，包括导入配置、切换节点、选择代理核心、查看运行状态、管理系统集成，以及更新核心和应用。"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "stable cross-platform desktop behavior,"
msgstr "稳定的跨平台桌面行为；"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "clear profile and subscription management,"
msgstr "清晰的配置文件与订阅管理；"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "first-class support for `chimera-client` while retaining compatibility with `clash-rs` and `mihomo`,"
msgstr "优先为 `chimera-client` 提供一等支持，同时保留与 `clash-rs` 和 `mihomo` 的兼容能力；"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "reliable core lifecycle management through child-process and service-mode paths,"
msgstr "通过子进程模式和服务模式提供可靠的核心生命周期管理；"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "practical diagnostics through logs, connection views, core status, and configuration-directory access."
msgstr "通过日志、连接视图、核心状态和配置目录访问提供实用的诊断能力。"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "Runtime Boundary"
msgstr "运行时边界"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "`Chimera` is a control application, not a proxy protocol engine. Protocol availability, transport behavior, and packet forwarding are provided by the selected core. This distinction is important when comparing features: a feature visible in the GUI is not necessarily implemented by every supported core, and a core capability may require additional UI integration before it is exposed in Chimera."
msgstr "`Chimera` 是控制应用，而不是代理协议引擎。协议可用性、传输行为和数据包转发均由当前选中的核心提供。比较功能时必须注意这一边界：GUI 中可见的功能不一定由所有受支持核心实现，而某个核心已经具备的能力，也可能需要额外的 UI 集成后才会在 Chimera 中暴露。"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "Runtime Responsibilities"
msgstr "运行时职责"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "Chimera manages local state and delegates packet/protocol handling to a selected core. The main responsibilities visible in the companion codebase are:"
msgstr "Chimera 负责管理本地状态，并把数据包与协议处理交给选中的核心。配套代码库中可以看到的主要职责包括："

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "profile import, update, deletion, viewing, editing, and runtime patching,"
msgstr "配置文件的导入、更新、删除、查看、编辑以及运行时补丁处理；"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "Clash-style runtime YAML generation from app settings plus active profile,"
msgstr "根据应用设置与当前活动配置生成 Clash 风格的运行时 YAML；"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "core selection among sidecars such as `mihomo`, `clash-rs`, and `chimera-client`,"
msgstr "在 `mihomo`、`clash-rs`、`chimera-client` 等 sidecar 核心之间进行选择；"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "core start, stop, restart, recovery, version query, and update,"
msgstr "核心的启动、停止、重启、恢复、版本查询与更新；"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "system proxy, deep link, notification, dialog, tray, and single-instance integration,"
msgstr "系统代理、深链接、通知、对话框、托盘以及单实例集成；"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "service-mode install, uninstall, start, stop, restart, and status workflows."
msgstr "服务模式的安装、卸载、启动、停止、重启以及状态管理流程。"

#: src\chimera.md
msgid "NixOS"
msgstr "NixOS"

