#: src\chimera_server.md
msgid "`Chimera_Server` is a Rust server core that aims to stay compatible with `xray-core` configuration shape and inbound protocol behavior. The current local README describes the project as focused on inbound parsing, inbound dispatch, and protocol semantics first; outbound, routing, and policy modules are still being expanded."
msgstr "`Chimera_Server` 是一个 Rust 服务端核心，目标是在配置结构和入站协议行为上保持与 `xray-core` 的兼容性。当前本地 README 表明，项目现阶段优先关注入站解析、入站分发和协议语义；出站、路由与策略模块仍在持续扩展。"

