#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Listeners define how local applications and operating-system traffic enter `chimera_client`. They are the first boundary between an application and the proxy core, so listener selection should be treated separately from outbound protocol selection."
msgstr "监听器决定本地应用和操作系统流量如何进入 `chimera_client`。它们是应用与代理核心之间的第一层边界，因此监听器选择应与出站协议选择分开考虑。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "For most deployments, start with an application-level listener such as SOCKS5 or HTTP before enabling transparent or TUN-based capture."
msgstr "对于大多数部署，建议先从 SOCKS5 或 HTTP 这类应用层监听器开始，再启用透明代理或基于 TUN 的流量捕获。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Listener Overview"
msgstr "监听器概览"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Configuration key"
msgstr "配置键"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "HTTP proxy listener"
msgstr "HTTP 代理监听器"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Browsers, system HTTP proxy"
msgstr "浏览器、系统 HTTP 代理"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Primarily TCP proxy traffic"
msgstr "主要用于 TCP 代理流量"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "General application proxying"
msgstr "通用应用代理"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Good baseline for local testing"
msgstr "适合作为本地测试基线"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "HTTP + SOCKS5 listener"
msgstr "HTTP + SOCKS5 监听器"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "One shared application endpoint"
msgstr "一个共享的应用端点"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Convenient when clients expose only one proxy field"
msgstr "适合客户端只提供一个代理设置项的场景"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Transparent redirect listener"
msgstr "透明重定向监听器"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Linux gateway/router setups"
msgstr "Linux 网关/路由器部署"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Primarily TCP redirect workflows"
msgstr "主要用于 TCP 重定向流程"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Transparent proxy listener"
msgstr "透明代理监听器"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Linux TCP/UDP interception"
msgstr "Linux TCP/UDP 拦截"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Requires firewall and policy-routing integration"
msgstr "需要与防火墙和策略路由集成"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Management API"
msgstr "管理 API"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "GUI, dashboards, automation"
msgstr "GUI、控制面板、自动化"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Bind to loopback unless remote access is intentional"
msgstr "除非明确需要远程访问，否则应绑定到回环地址"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "DNS listener"
msgstr "DNS 监听器"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Local DNS interception/resolution"
msgstr "本地 DNS 拦截/解析"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Usually used with enhanced DNS or TUN"
msgstr "通常与增强 DNS 或 TUN 配合使用"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Availability can depend on build features, platform support, and the exact `chimera_client` revision. A configuration key being accepted does not by itself guarantee that the corresponding runtime path is enabled."
msgstr "具体能力是否可用可能取决于编译 feature、平台支持以及 `chimera_client` 的具体版本。某个配置键能够被解析，并不代表对应的运行时路径一定已经启用。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Listener Selection"
msgstr "监听器选择"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "SOCKS5 is the safest starting point when validating a new profile. It does not require route changes and is supported by a wide range of applications."
msgstr "验证新配置时，SOCKS5 通常是最稳妥的起点。它不需要修改系统路由，而且受到大量应用支持。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Use SOCKS5 first when you want to separate proxy-core behavior from operating system routing and DNS interception issues."
msgstr "如果希望把代理核心本身的问题与操作系统路由、DNS 拦截问题区分开，建议优先使用 SOCKS5。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md src\protocols/http.md
msgid "HTTP Proxy"
msgstr "HTTP 代理"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "An HTTP proxy listener is convenient for browsers and operating-system proxy settings. HTTPS traffic normally enters through HTTP `CONNECT` tunneling."
msgstr "HTTP 代理监听器适合浏览器和操作系统代理设置。HTTPS 流量通常通过 HTTP `CONNECT` 隧道进入代理核心。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Mixed Listener"
msgstr "Mixed 监听器"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "A mixed listener accepts both HTTP-proxy and SOCKS-style clients on one port. It is useful for desktop setups where exposing a single endpoint is simpler than managing separate HTTP and SOCKS ports."
msgstr "Mixed 监听器可以在同一个端口同时接受 HTTP 代理和 SOCKS 风格客户端连接。对于桌面环境，如果暴露单一端点比同时管理 HTTP 与 SOCKS 端口更简单，这种模式会很方便。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Transparent Listeners"
msgstr "透明代理监听器"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "`redir-port` and `tproxy-port` are intended for routing-level interception, primarily on Linux. They should not be treated as drop-in replacements for SOCKS5 or HTTP listeners."
msgstr "`redir-port` 和 `tproxy-port` 面向路由层流量拦截，主要用于 Linux。它们不应被视为 SOCKS5 或 HTTP 监听器的直接替代品。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Transparent proxying normally also requires:"
msgstr "透明代理通常还需要："

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "firewall rules,"
msgstr "防火墙规则；"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "loop-prevention rules,"
msgstr "防止代理环路的规则；"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "policy routing for TProxy deployments,"
msgstr "TProxy 部署所需的策略路由；"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "and a DNS strategy that preserves enough domain information for rule matching."
msgstr "以及能够保留足够域名信息用于规则匹配的 DNS 策略。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "For host-wide interception, also see [Tun Module](./tun.md)."
msgstr "如果需要主机级全局流量拦截，另请参阅 [TUN 模块](./tun.md)。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Controller and DNS Bindings"
msgstr "Controller 与 DNS 绑定"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Management and DNS listeners deserve stricter exposure rules than ordinary local proxy listeners."
msgstr "管理接口和 DNS 监听器应采用比普通本地代理监听器更严格的暴露策略。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "During development, prefer loopback-only bindings:"
msgstr "开发阶段建议只绑定到回环地址："

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Do not expose the controller or DNS listener to a LAN or public interface unless you have intentionally configured access controls and understand the security impact."
msgstr "除非已经明确配置访问控制并理解安全影响，否则不要把 Controller 或 DNS 监听器暴露到局域网或公网接口。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Example Local Profile"
msgstr "本地配置示例"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "The following layout keeps all application-facing services local while making listener roles explicit:"
msgstr "下面的配置让所有面向应用的服务仅在本机提供，同时清楚区分各监听器职责："

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "mixed_port"
msgstr "mixed_port"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "external_controller"
msgstr "external_controller"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "\"127.0.0.1:9090\""
msgstr "\"127.0.0.1:9090\""

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Exact accepted key spelling can vary between compatibility layers. When importing Clash/Mihomo profiles, preserve the original profile where practical and verify the normalized runtime configuration produced by the client."
msgstr "不同兼容层实际接受的配置键写法可能存在差异。导入 Clash/Mihomo 配置时，应尽可能保留原始配置，并核对客户端最终生成的规范化运行时配置。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Platform and Compatibility Notes"
msgstr "平台与兼容性说明"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Application-level HTTP and SOCKS listeners are the easiest paths to validate across platforms."
msgstr "应用层 HTTP 与 SOCKS 监听器通常是最容易跨平台验证的路径。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Transparent redirect and TProxy workflows are platform-specific and require operating-system network configuration outside the YAML file."
msgstr "透明重定向与 TProxy 流程具有明显的平台特性，并且需要在 YAML 之外配置操作系统网络环境。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "TUN support has its own privilege, routing, and DNS requirements; see [Tun Module](./tun.md)."
msgstr "TUN 支持具有独立的权限、路由和 DNS 要求；请参阅 [TUN 模块](./tun.md)。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Listener availability may be gated by Cargo features or runtime build choices."
msgstr "监听器是否可用可能受到 Cargo feature 或运行时构建选项限制。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Controller behavior should be treated as an API surface rather than a proxy protocol endpoint."
msgstr "Controller 应被视为 API 接口，而不是代理协议端点。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md src\chimera_client/dns.md src\chimera_client/tun.md src\chimera_client/rules.md src\protocols/socks5.md src\protocols/http.md src\protocols/trojan.md src\protocols/hysteria2.md src\protocols/tuic.md src\protocols/vless.md src\protocols/xhttp.md src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "When a local application cannot connect through the core, check the listener before debugging outbound protocols:"
msgstr "当本地应用无法通过核心连接时，应先检查监听器，再排查出站协议："

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Confirm the process is running and the expected port is listening."
msgstr "确认进程正在运行，并且预期端口已经处于监听状态。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Verify the application points to the correct listener type and port."
msgstr "确认应用指向正确的监听器类型和端口。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Confirm the listener is bound to the expected address (`127.0.0.1`, LAN IP, or wildcard address)."
msgstr "确认监听器绑定到了预期地址（`127.0.0.1`、局域网 IP 或通配地址）。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Check whether `allow_lan` or equivalent exposure settings block remote clients."
msgstr "检查 `allow_lan` 或同类暴露设置是否阻止了远程客户端。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "Test with a minimal SOCKS5 or HTTP profile before enabling TUN, Redir, or TProxy."
msgstr "启用 TUN、Redir 或 TProxy 前，先使用最小化 SOCKS5 或 HTTP 配置进行测试。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md
msgid "If routing works by IP but domain rules fail, inspect the DNS path as well."
msgstr "如果按 IP 路由正常但域名规则失效，也要检查 DNS 路径。"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md src\chimera_client/dns.md src\chimera_client/tun.md src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Related Pages"
msgstr "相关页面"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md src\chimera_client/tun.md src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "[DNS Module](./dns.md)"
msgstr "[DNS 模块](./dns.md)"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md src\chimera_client/dns.md src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "[Tun Module](./tun.md)"
msgstr "[TUN 模块](./tun.md)"

#: src\chimera_client/ports.md src\chimera_client/dns.md src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "[Rule Types and Their Effects](./rules.md)"
msgstr "[规则类型及其作用](./rules.md)"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "DNS is part of the routing pipeline, not just a name-to-address lookup service. The resolver strategy affects whether domain rules remain usable, whether TUN traffic can be classified correctly, and whether DNS requests bypass the proxy unexpectedly."
msgstr "DNS 是路由链路的一部分，而不只是把域名转换成地址的查询服务。解析策略会影响域名规则是否仍可用、TUN 流量能否被正确分类，以及 DNS 请求是否会意外绕过代理。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "A stable DNS setup should answer three questions clearly:"
msgstr "一套稳定的 DNS 配置应当清楚回答三个问题："

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Which resolver handles a query?"
msgstr "由哪个解析器处理查询？"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Does the client keep the original domain identity for later rule matching?"
msgstr "客户端是否保留原始域名信息，以便后续规则匹配？"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Does DNS traffic itself follow the intended proxy or direct path?"
msgstr "DNS 流量本身是否按照预期走代理或直连路径？"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Operating Modes"
msgstr "工作模式"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Best fit"
msgstr "适用场景"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "System / DNS disabled"
msgstr "系统解析 / 禁用 DNS 模块"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Simple app-level proxying"
msgstr "简单的应用层代理"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Least invasive, easiest to debug"
msgstr "侵入性最低，最容易排查"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Depends on OS resolver behavior"
msgstr "依赖操作系统解析器行为"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Real-IP / `redir-host` style"
msgstr "Real-IP / `redir-host` 风格"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Conservative enhanced DNS"
msgstr "较保守的增强 DNS"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Applications receive real addresses"
msgstr "应用获得真实地址"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Domain identity can be harder to retain in transparent flows"
msgstr "在透明代理流量中较难持续保留域名信息"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Fake-IP"
msgstr "Fake-IP"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "TUN and domain-heavy routing"
msgstr "TUN 与大量依赖域名的路由场景"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Preserves domain intent for later connection matching"
msgstr "保留域名意图，便于后续连接匹配"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Requires exclusions and careful DNS integration"
msgstr "需要合理的排除规则和谨慎的 DNS 集成"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Start with the system resolver or real-IP behavior when validating a new setup. Introduce Fake-IP only when the routing model benefits from it."
msgstr "验证新环境时，建议先使用系统解析器或 Real-IP 行为。只有当路由模型确实能从中受益时，再引入 Fake-IP。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Resolver Pipeline"
msgstr "解析器流程"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "A Clash-style enhanced resolver generally follows this conceptual sequence:"
msgstr "Clash 风格的增强解析器通常遵循以下概念流程："

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "The exact fallback and policy behavior depends on the current `chimera_client` implementation and should not be assumed to match every Mihomo edge case."
msgstr "具体的 fallback 与 policy 行为取决于当前 `chimera_client` 实现，不应默认认为它与 Mihomo 的所有边缘场景完全一致。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Conservative Configuration"
msgstr "保守配置"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "For application-level SOCKS5 or HTTP proxying, keeping enhanced DNS disabled is a useful baseline:"
msgstr "对于应用层 SOCKS5 或 HTTP 代理，先保持增强 DNS 关闭可以作为一个很有用的基线："

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "If this works but an enhanced-DNS profile does not, the failure is probably in the DNS interception/resolver path rather than the outbound proxy itself."
msgstr "如果这种配置能够工作，而启用增强 DNS 后失败，那么问题更可能出在 DNS 拦截/解析路径，而不是出站代理本身。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Local DNS Listener"
msgstr "本地 DNS 监听器"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "A local listener lets the operating system, TUN path, or other applications send queries directly to `chimera_client`:"
msgstr "本地 DNS 监听器可以让操作系统、TUN 路径或其他应用直接把查询发送给 `chimera_client`："

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "During development, keep the listener on loopback. Binding DNS to a LAN or public interface can expose an unintended resolver service."
msgstr "开发阶段应把监听器保持在回环地址。将 DNS 绑定到局域网或公网接口，可能会意外暴露一个可供外部使用的解析服务。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Fake-IP Example"
msgstr "Fake-IP 示例"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Fake-IP exclusions should be kept small and understandable. Large copied filter lists can hide routing mistakes and make failures difficult to reproduce."
msgstr "Fake-IP 排除项应尽量保持精简且易于理解。直接复制大量过滤规则可能掩盖路由错误，并让问题难以复现。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Policy and Fallback Example"
msgstr "Policy 与 Fallback 示例"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "The schema and resolver hooks for policy/fallback behavior exist in the current client documentation, but full behavioral parity with Mihomo should be verified before relying on unusual edge cases."
msgstr "当前客户端文档中已经包含 policy/fallback 行为相关的配置结构与解析钩子，但在依赖少见边缘行为之前，应先验证是否真正与 Mihomo 完全一致。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "DNS and Rules"
msgstr "DNS 与规则"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "DNS mode directly affects the rule engine:"
msgstr "DNS 模式会直接影响规则引擎："

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Domain-based rules need access to the original hostname or equivalent metadata."
msgstr "基于域名的规则需要能够取得原始主机名或等价元数据。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "IP rules depend on the resolved destination address."
msgstr "IP 规则依赖最终解析得到的目标地址。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Fake-IP is most useful when an application resolves first and connects later, because the client can map the synthetic address back to the original domain."
msgstr "当应用先解析域名、之后再建立连接时，Fake-IP 最有价值，因为客户端可以把合成地址重新映射回原始域名。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "A DNS request that bypasses the intended resolver path can cause apparently random rule mismatches."
msgstr "如果 DNS 请求绕过了预期解析路径，可能会造成看似随机的规则匹配错误。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "When debugging rules, inspect DNS before changing rule order blindly."
msgstr "排查规则问题时，应先检查 DNS，不要直接盲目调整规则顺序。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "DNS and TUN"
msgstr "DNS 与 TUN"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "TUN deployments often combine three separate mechanisms:"
msgstr "TUN 部署通常会组合三种彼此独立的机制："

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "host traffic capture,"
msgstr "主机流量捕获；"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "DNS interception or resolver redirection,"
msgstr "DNS 拦截或解析器重定向；"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "enhanced DNS such as Fake-IP."
msgstr "以及 Fake-IP 等增强 DNS。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "`dns-hijack` in the TUN configuration does not replace a valid DNS configuration. It only controls how captured DNS traffic is redirected into the DNS path. See [Tun Module](./tun.md) for the routing side."
msgstr "TUN 配置中的 `dns-hijack` 不能替代有效的 DNS 配置。它只控制被捕获的 DNS 流量如何重定向到 DNS 处理路径。路由侧说明请参阅 [TUN 模块](./tun.md)。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Upstream Resolver Guidance"
msgstr "上游解析器建议"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "When choosing upstreams:"
msgstr "选择上游解析器时："

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "keep at least one simple resolver path available while debugging;"
msgstr "排查期间至少保留一条简单可用的解析路径；"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "verify that encrypted DNS endpoint hostnames can be bootstrapped;"
msgstr "确认加密 DNS 端点的主机名能够完成 bootstrap 解析；"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "avoid mixing many upstreams until the basic path is known to work;"
msgstr "在基本路径确认可用之前，不要混用过多上游解析器；"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "consider whether DNS itself should be proxied or sent directly;"
msgstr "明确 DNS 流量本身应该经过代理还是直接发送；"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "treat resolver latency, failure, and blocking as routing signals, not just DNS errors."
msgstr "把解析器延迟、失败和阻断视为路由信号，而不仅仅是普通 DNS 错误。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md src\chimera_client/tun.md src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Compatibility Notes"
msgstr "兼容性说明"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "The current documentation describes support or runtime hooks for:"
msgstr "当前文档记录了以下支持或运行时钩子："

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "the system resolver path,"
msgstr "系统解析器路径；"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "a local DNS listener,"
msgstr "本地 DNS 监听器；"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "enhanced/Fake-IP resolution,"
msgstr "增强/Fake-IP 解析；"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "nameserver policy and fallback structures,"
msgstr "nameserver policy 与 fallback 配置结构；"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "and `respect-rules`\\-style DNS dialing hooks."
msgstr "以及 `respect-rules` 风格的 DNS 拨号钩子。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "These capabilities are aligned with the Clash family, but this Wiki should not claim blanket Mihomo parity. Configuration syntax can also differ between the external Clash-style form and the client's normalized internal representation."
msgstr "这些能力整体与 Clash 系生态保持一致，但本 Wiki 不应据此声称与 Mihomo 全面等价。外部 Clash 风格配置形式与客户端规范化后的内部表示之间，也可能存在语法差异。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Use this order when DNS-related behavior looks wrong:"
msgstr "当 DNS 行为异常时，建议按以下顺序排查："

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Confirm ordinary network connectivity without enhanced DNS."
msgstr "先确认关闭增强 DNS 时普通网络连接正常。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Confirm the local DNS listener is actually reachable."
msgstr "确认本地 DNS 监听器确实可以访问。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Query the listener directly, for example:"
msgstr "直接向监听器发起查询，例如："

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Check whether the OS or TUN path really sends DNS to that listener."
msgstr "检查操作系统或 TUN 路径是否真的把 DNS 流量发送到了该监听器。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Temporarily use one simple upstream resolver to isolate DoH/DoT problems."
msgstr "临时只使用一个简单的上游解析器，以隔离 DoH/DoT 相关问题。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "Inspect timeout, TLS, bootstrap, and validation errors in logs."
msgstr "检查日志中的超时、TLS、bootstrap 和响应验证错误。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "If Fake-IP is enabled, verify that the affected domain is not unexpectedly included in the filter list."
msgstr "如果启用了 Fake-IP，确认出现问题的域名没有被意外包含在过滤列表中。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md
msgid "If rules are wrong, compare the domain seen by the rule engine with the final resolved IP."
msgstr "如果规则匹配异常，对比规则引擎看到的域名与最终解析得到的 IP。"

#: src\chimera_client/dns.md src\chimera_client/tun.md src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "[Ports and Listeners](./ports.md)"
msgstr "[端口与监听器](./ports.md)"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "TUN mode captures IP traffic at the operating-system network layer and sends it into the proxy pipeline without requiring each application to configure an HTTP or SOCKS proxy."
msgstr "TUN 模式在操作系统网络层捕获 IP 流量并送入代理处理链，因此不需要每个应用单独配置 HTTP 或 SOCKS 代理。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "It is the closest `chimera_client` mode to a host-wide proxy, but it is also the mode with the most external dependencies: interface creation, privileges, routes, loop prevention, DNS handling, and platform-specific behavior all need to work together."
msgstr "这是 `chimera_client` 中最接近主机级全局代理的模式，同时也是外部依赖最多的模式：接口创建、权限、路由、防环路、DNS 处理以及平台特定行为都必须协同正常工作。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "For a new deployment, validate an application-level listener first. Only enable TUN after the core, outbound protocol, and basic rule set are already known to work."
msgstr "对于新部署，应先验证应用层监听器。只有在核心、出站协议和基础规则集均确认正常后，再启用 TUN。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Current Status"
msgstr "当前状态"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "The current client documentation exposes a `tun` configuration block and carries TUN configuration into the internal runtime representation. Actual behavior is still dependent on:"
msgstr "当前客户端文档已经提供 `tun` 配置块，并会把 TUN 配置传入内部运行时表示。实际行为仍取决于："

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "whether the build includes the required TUN feature/runtime code,"
msgstr "构建是否包含所需的 TUN feature/运行时代码；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "the target operating system,"
msgstr "目标操作系统；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "sufficient privileges,"
msgstr "是否具有足够权限；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "route-management support,"
msgstr "路由管理支持；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "and a compatible DNS configuration."
msgstr "以及兼容的 DNS 配置。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "A successfully parsed `tun` block does not by itself prove that the host routing setup is active."
msgstr "`tun` 配置块能够成功解析，并不能单独证明主机路由配置已经真正生效。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Core Configuration"
msgstr "核心配置"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "The exact set of accepted keys follows the current `chimera_client`/clash-rs configuration path rather than being a promise of full Mihomo key compatibility."
msgstr "实际接受的配置键以当前 `chimera_client`/clash-rs 配置路径为准，并不代表承诺与 Mihomo 所有配置键完全兼容。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Key Fields"
msgstr "关键字段"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Operational notes"
msgstr "运行说明"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Enables the TUN path"
msgstr "启用 TUN 路径"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Other TUN fields are irrelevant while disabled"
msgstr "关闭时其他 TUN 字段不会产生实际作用"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Selects or identifies the TUN device"
msgstr "选择或标识 TUN 设备"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "May be platform-specific"
msgstr "可能具有平台差异"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "IPv4 address/prefix for the TUN interface"
msgstr "TUN 接口的 IPv4 地址/前缀"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Commonly uses a dedicated private/benchmark range"
msgstr "通常使用独立的私有/基准测试地址段"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Optional IPv6 address/prefix"
msgstr "可选的 IPv6 地址/前缀"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Needed when IPv6 is intentionally carried through TUN"
msgstr "需要让 IPv6 明确经过 TUN 时使用"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Full-tunnel routing switch"
msgstr "全隧道路由开关"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Broadest and most invasive mode"
msgstr "覆盖范围最广、对系统网络影响最大的模式"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Prefix list for split routing"
msgstr "分流路由的网段前缀列表"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Used when only selected networks should enter TUN"
msgstr "仅希望指定网段进入 TUN 时使用"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Interface MTU"
msgstr "接口 MTU"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Useful when diagnosing fragmentation or PMTU problems"
msgstr "用于排查分片或 PMTU 问题"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Linux packet mark"
msgstr "Linux 数据包标记"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Helps integrate loop prevention and policy routing"
msgstr "用于配合防环路和策略路由"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Linux policy-routing table"
msgstr "Linux 策略路由表"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Avoid conflicts with existing host route tables"
msgstr "应避免与主机现有路由表冲突"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Redirects captured DNS into the client DNS path"
msgstr "将捕获的 DNS 流量重定向到客户端 DNS 路径"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Requires a working DNS module configuration"
msgstr "要求 DNS 模块本身已经正确配置并可用"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Deployment Modes"
msgstr "部署模式"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Full Tunnel"
msgstr "全隧道"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "A full-tunnel profile attempts to route most host traffic through the TUN interface:"
msgstr "全隧道配置会尝试让主机上的大部分流量都经过 TUN 接口："

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Use this only after confirming that the core has a reliable path to its remote proxy server. Otherwise the proxy's own outbound connection can be captured by TUN and form a routing loop."
msgstr "只有在确认核心能够稳定访问远程代理服务器后才应使用该模式，否则代理核心自身的出站连接可能再次被 TUN 捕获，从而形成路由环路。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Split Tunnel"
msgstr "分流隧道"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "A split-tunnel profile limits TUN routing to selected prefixes:"
msgstr "分流隧道配置只让指定网段进入 TUN："

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Split routing is useful for staged rollout because it changes less of the host's network behavior."
msgstr "分流路由适合分阶段启用，因为它对主机整体网络行为的改动更小。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Device Selection"
msgstr "设备选择"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "The inherited configuration path documents device identifiers such as:"
msgstr "继承的配置路径记录了以下设备标识形式："

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`dev://tun0` — named TUN device,"
msgstr "`dev://tun0` — 指定名称的 TUN 设备；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`tun0` — plain device-name form,"
msgstr "`tun0` — 简写设备名形式；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`dev://utun1989` — macOS-style `utun` device,"
msgstr "`dev://utun1989` — macOS 风格的 `utun` 设备；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`fd://3` — advanced file-descriptor handoff where supported by the runtime."
msgstr "`fd://3` — 在运行时支持时使用的高级文件描述符交接方式。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Do not assume every form is meaningful on every operating system. In ordinary desktop use, prefer the simplest platform-native device form supported by the selected build."
msgstr "不要假设所有形式在每个操作系统上都有意义。普通桌面使用场景应优先选择当前构建所支持的、最简单的平台原生设备形式。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Routing Model"
msgstr "路由模型"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "TUN introduces two traffic directions that must stay distinct:"
msgstr "TUN 引入了两类必须明确区分的流量方向："

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "The core's own outbound traffic must reach the physical network without being captured back into the same TUN path. Linux deployments commonly use packet marks and policy routing for this purpose; other platforms use their own route management mechanisms."
msgstr "核心自身的出站流量必须能够到达物理网络，而不能再次被捕获回同一条 TUN 路径。Linux 部署通常通过数据包标记和策略路由实现这一点；其他平台则使用各自的路由管理机制。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "TUN and DNS should be designed together."
msgstr "TUN 与 DNS 应当一起设计。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "A common failure mode is that application traffic enters TUN while DNS still uses an unrelated system path. This can cause:"
msgstr "一种常见故障是应用流量已经进入 TUN，但 DNS 仍然使用无关的系统解析路径。这可能导致："

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "domain rules to stop matching,"
msgstr "域名规则不再命中；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Fake-IP mappings to be bypassed,"
msgstr "Fake-IP 映射被绕过；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "DNS leaks,"
msgstr "DNS 泄漏；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "or traffic to appear to work inconsistently between applications."
msgstr "或者不同应用之间表现出不一致的联网行为。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`dns-hijack` only controls interception of captured DNS traffic. It does not replace a valid `dns:` configuration."
msgstr "`dns-hijack` 只控制对已捕获 DNS 流量的拦截方式，不能替代有效的 `dns:` 配置。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "For domain-heavy rule sets, verify the DNS flow described in [DNS Module](./dns.md) before assuming the TUN route itself is wrong."
msgstr "对于大量依赖域名的规则集，在判断 TUN 路由本身有问题之前，应先验证 [DNS 模块](./dns.md) 中描述的 DNS 流程。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Linux Notes"
msgstr "Linux 注意事项"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Linux TUN deployments may require root-equivalent privileges or capabilities such as `CAP_NET_ADMIN`, depending on how the process creates interfaces and routes."
msgstr "Linux TUN 部署可能需要 root 等效权限或 `CAP_NET_ADMIN` 等 capability，具体取决于进程创建接口和路由的方式。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "When policy routing is involved, useful inspection commands include:"
msgstr "涉及策略路由时，可以使用以下命令进行检查："

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "If `so-mark` or a dedicated route table is configured, make sure the values do not conflict with rules installed by another VPN, container runtime, firewall, or proxy application."
msgstr "如果配置了 `so-mark` 或独立路由表，应确认这些值不会与其他 VPN、容器运行时、防火墙或代理应用安装的规则冲突。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Windows and macOS Notes"
msgstr "Windows 与 macOS 注意事项"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "On Windows and macOS, TUN behavior is still sensitive to privileges, route ownership, interface setup, and other networking software running on the host."
msgstr "在 Windows 和 macOS 上，TUN 行为仍容易受到权限、路由归属、接口配置以及主机上其他网络软件的影响。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "When troubleshooting these platforms:"
msgstr "排查这些平台时："

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "check whether another VPN or proxy tool is already managing default routes;"
msgstr "检查是否已有其他 VPN 或代理工具在管理默认路由；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "verify the TUN interface was created successfully;"
msgstr "确认 TUN 接口已经成功创建；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "inspect route changes before and after enabling TUN;"
msgstr "对比启用 TUN 前后的路由变化；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "disable competing network-filter or VPN software temporarily when isolating a problem;"
msgstr "隔离问题时，可临时停用可能冲突的网络过滤或 VPN 软件；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "and restore application-level SOCKS/HTTP proxying to confirm that the proxy core itself remains healthy."
msgstr "并恢复应用层 SOCKS/HTTP 代理，以确认代理核心本身仍然工作正常。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "MTU"
msgstr "MTU"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "MTU problems often look like partial connectivity: small requests work while larger TLS or QUIC transfers stall."
msgstr "MTU 问题往往表现为部分可连接：小请求正常，而较大的 TLS 或 QUIC 传输发生停滞。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "If that happens:"
msgstr "如果出现这种情况："

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "keep the default MTU first;"
msgstr "首先保持默认 MTU；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "confirm the problem only appears through TUN;"
msgstr "确认问题只在经过 TUN 时出现；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "lower the MTU gradually if the network path requires it;"
msgstr "如果网络路径确实需要，逐步降低 MTU；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "re-test both TCP and UDP-based outbound protocols."
msgstr "重新测试基于 TCP 和 UDP 的出站协议。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Avoid treating an arbitrary low MTU as a permanent fix without identifying the underlying path limitation."
msgstr "在没有确认底层路径限制之前，不要把随意设置的低 MTU 当作永久解决方案。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`chimera_client` inherits several TUN concepts from clash-rs, while Mihomo uses some different key names and routing abstractions. Similar functionality does not always mean configuration is interchangeable."
msgstr "`chimera_client` 从 clash-rs 继承了多个 TUN 概念，而 Mihomo 使用了一些不同的配置键名称和路由抽象。功能相似并不意味着配置可以直接互换。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Examples of potential differences include:"
msgstr "可能存在差异的方面包括："

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "device naming and file-descriptor handoff,"
msgstr "设备命名与文件描述符交接；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "explicit `gateway` / `gateway-v6` fields,"
msgstr "显式的 `gateway` / `gateway-v6` 字段；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "`route-all` and `routes` versus Mihomo-style auto-route controls,"
msgstr "`route-all`、`routes` 与 Mihomo 风格自动路由控制之间的差异；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "route-table naming,"
msgstr "路由表字段命名；"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "and Linux packet-mark configuration."
msgstr "以及 Linux 数据包标记配置。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "When migrating a Mihomo profile, translate TUN settings deliberately instead of copying the entire block and assuming semantic parity."
msgstr "迁移 Mihomo 配置时，应有意识地转换 TUN 设置，而不是直接复制整个配置块并假定语义完全一致。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Recommended Bring-Up Sequence"
msgstr "推荐启用顺序"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Use this sequence to reduce the number of variables being debugged at once:"
msgstr "建议按以下顺序操作，减少同时需要排查的变量数量："

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Start `chimera_client` with TUN disabled."
msgstr "先在禁用 TUN 的情况下启动 `chimera_client`。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Verify SOCKS5 or HTTP proxying works."
msgstr "确认 SOCKS5 或 HTTP 代理工作正常。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Verify the intended outbound proxy and rule group work."
msgstr "确认预期的出站代理与规则组工作正常。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Configure DNS and confirm direct queries to the client resolver succeed."
msgstr "配置 DNS，并确认直接查询客户端解析器可以成功。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Enable TUN without adding unnecessary custom routes or MTU overrides."
msgstr "启用 TUN，暂时不要添加不必要的自定义路由或 MTU 覆盖。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Confirm the interface is created."
msgstr "确认接口已经创建。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Confirm host routes changed as expected."
msgstr "确认主机路由按预期发生变化。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Confirm the core's own outbound traffic is not looping back into TUN."
msgstr "确认核心自身的出站流量没有重新进入 TUN 形成环路。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Enable DNS hijacking/Fake-IP only after ordinary TUN traffic works."
msgstr "普通 TUN 流量工作正常后，再启用 DNS 劫持/Fake-IP。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "Add advanced split routes, packet marks, or custom route tables last."
msgstr "最后再添加高级分流路由、数据包标记或自定义路由表。"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "If TUN is enabled but traffic fails, inspect the layers in order:"
msgstr "如果 TUN 已启用但流量不通，按以下层级依次检查："

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**Interface** — was the TUN device created?"
msgstr "**接口** — TUN 设备是否已创建？"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**Privileges** — did route/interface operations succeed?"
msgstr "**权限** — 路由和接口操作是否成功？"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**Routes** — is traffic actually pointed at TUN?"
msgstr "**路由** — 流量是否真的被导向 TUN？"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**Loop prevention** — can the proxy core still reach its remote server?"
msgstr "**防环路** — 代理核心是否仍能访问远程服务器？"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**DNS** — are queries using the intended resolver path?"
msgstr "**DNS** — 查询是否使用了预期解析路径？"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**Rules** — does the captured flow contain enough metadata for the expected rule?"
msgstr "**规则** — 被捕获的连接流中是否包含足够的元数据供预期规则匹配？"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**MTU** — do only large packets or particular transports fail?"
msgstr "**MTU** — 是否只有大数据包或特定传输方式失败？"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "**Platform conflicts** — is another VPN/proxy/firewall modifying the same routes?"
msgstr "**平台冲突** — 是否有其他 VPN/代理/防火墙正在修改相同路由？"

#: src\chimera_client/tun.md
msgid "If the problem remains unclear, return to SOCKS5/HTTP mode and re-enable TUN one piece at a time."
msgstr "如果问题仍不明确，回到 SOCKS5/HTTP 模式，再逐项重新启用 TUN 相关能力。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Rules decide which outbound policy handles a connection. In the Clash-style model used by `chimera_client`, evaluation is ordered: rules are checked from top to bottom and the first matching rule wins."
msgstr "规则决定一条连接由哪个出站策略处理。在 `chimera_client` 使用的 Clash 风格模型中，规则按顺序求值：从上到下检查，第一条匹配的规则生效。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "That makes rule order just as important as rule syntax. A valid rule placed too late can be effectively unreachable because an earlier rule already captured the flow."
msgstr "因此规则顺序与规则语法同样重要。一条本身正确的规则如果放得太靠后，也可能永远无法生效，因为前面的规则已经提前匹配了该流量。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "A routing decision can use several kinds of metadata:"
msgstr "路由决策可以使用多种元数据："

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "domain name, SNI, or HTTP host,"
msgstr "域名、SNI 或 HTTP Host；"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "source or destination port,"
msgstr "源端口或目标端口；"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "source subnet,"
msgstr "源网段；"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "process identity when supported by the platform,"
msgstr "平台支持时的进程身份信息；"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "The selected target is usually an outbound or policy group such as `DIRECT`, `REJECT`, `Proxy`, or `Auto`."
msgstr "最终目标通常是某个出站或策略组，例如 `DIRECT`、`REJECT`、`Proxy` 或 `Auto`。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Domain Rules"
msgstr "域名规则"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches one exact hostname."
msgstr "精确匹配一个主机名。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Use this for the most precise domain-based exceptions."
msgstr "适合用于最精确的域名例外规则。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches a domain suffix and its subdomains."
msgstr "匹配域名后缀及其子域名。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "This is usually preferable to a broad keyword when an entire domain tree should share the same policy."
msgstr "如果整个域名树都应使用同一策略，通常应优先使用这种规则，而不是宽泛的关键字匹配。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches a substring in the domain name."
msgstr "匹配域名中的子字符串。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Keyword rules are easy to overmatch. Keep them below more precise domain rules unless broad matching is intentional."
msgstr "关键字规则很容易产生过度匹配。除非明确需要宽泛匹配，否则应把它放在更精确的域名规则之后。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches an IPv4 destination prefix."
msgstr "匹配 IPv4 目标网段前缀。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches an IPv6 destination prefix."
msgstr "匹配 IPv6 目标网段前缀。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches the source subnet. This is most useful when the client is acting as a router or gateway for multiple devices."
msgstr "匹配源网段。当客户端作为多台设备的路由器或网关时，这类规则尤其有用。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches an IP against a geographic database."
msgstr "根据地理位置数据库匹配 IP。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "GeoIP results are only as accurate as the installed dataset. Treat database freshness as part of the routing configuration."
msgstr "GeoIP 结果的准确度取决于已安装的数据集。应把数据库是否及时更新视为路由配置的一部分。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches a domain against a maintained category/list dataset."
msgstr "根据维护好的分类/列表数据集匹配域名。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "As with GeoIP, behavior depends on the data files actually available to the runtime."
msgstr "与 GeoIP 一样，实际行为取决于运行时真正可用的数据文件。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches the remote destination port."
msgstr "匹配远程目标端口。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Port-only routing is broad. Place service-specific domain rules above it when possible."
msgstr "只按端口路由覆盖范围较广。条件允许时，应把针对具体服务的域名规则放在它之前。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches the local/source port."
msgstr "匹配本地/源端口。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches the executable name when process inspection is supported."
msgstr "在支持进程识别的平台上匹配可执行文件名。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Matches a full executable path."
msgstr "匹配完整的可执行文件路径。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Process rules are platform-sensitive and can be affected by permissions, application launchers, sandboxing, and executable path changes. Validate them on every target operating system."
msgstr "进程规则具有明显的平台差异，并可能受到权限、应用启动器、沙箱以及可执行文件路径变化的影响。应在每个目标操作系统上分别验证。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Rule Providers"
msgstr "规则提供器"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`RULE-SET` delegates matching to a named rule provider."
msgstr "`RULE-SET` 把匹配工作交给指定名称的规则提供器。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Rule providers make large policy sets easier to maintain, but introduce another runtime dependency. A stale, unavailable, or incompatible provider can make a routing policy behave differently from its source configuration."
msgstr "规则提供器可以让大型策略集更容易维护，但同时引入额外的运行时依赖。过期、不可用或不兼容的 provider 都可能让实际路由行为偏离源配置。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "For important providers, keep the source, update interval, expected behavior, and local cache path explicit."
msgstr "对于重要 provider，应明确记录来源、更新间隔、预期行为以及本地缓存路径。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Final Fallback"
msgstr "最终回退"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "`MATCH` is the catch-all rule and should normally be last."
msgstr "`MATCH` 是兜底规则，通常应放在最后。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Anything after `MATCH` is unreachable."
msgstr "任何位于 `MATCH` 之后的规则都无法被执行。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "A practical rule set usually moves from narrow/high-priority decisions to broad fallbacks:"
msgstr "实用规则集通常从范围窄、优先级高的决策逐步过渡到宽泛的兜底规则："

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "explicit blocks and local/private bypass rules;"
msgstr "明确的阻断规则以及本地/私网直连规则；"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "exact domain or process exceptions;"
msgstr "精确的域名或进程例外；"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "specific IP and port rules;"
msgstr "具体 IP 和端口规则；"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "provider/category rules such as `RULE-SET` and `GEOSITE`;"
msgstr "`RULE-SET`、`GEOSITE` 等 provider/分类规则；"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "broad heuristics such as `DOMAIN-KEYWORD` and `GEOIP`;"
msgstr "`DOMAIN-KEYWORD`、`GEOIP` 等宽泛启发式规则；"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "final `MATCH` fallback."
msgstr "最后的 `MATCH` 兜底。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "This is a guideline rather than a mandatory ordering. The important property is that earlier rules intentionally take priority over later ones."
msgstr "这是一种建议，而不是强制顺序。关键在于前面的规则应当是有意地优先于后面的规则。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Example Policy"
msgstr "策略示例"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Read the example from top to bottom: an exact corporate exception wins before a broader geographic or provider rule can see the same connection."
msgstr "应从上到下阅读该示例：精确的企业网络例外会先命中，因此更宽泛的地理位置或 provider 规则不会再处理同一条连接。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Many apparent rule failures are actually DNS-context failures."
msgstr "许多看起来像规则失效的问题，实际上是 DNS 上下文丢失造成的。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Domain rules require the runtime to know the original hostname."
msgstr "域名规则要求运行时能够知道原始主机名。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "IP rules depend on the address returned by the resolver."
msgstr "IP 规则依赖解析器返回的地址。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Fake-IP can help preserve domain intent through a later connection attempt."
msgstr "Fake-IP 可以在后续连接阶段帮助保留原始域名意图。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Transparent and TUN traffic can lose domain context if DNS bypasses the client's intended resolver path."
msgstr "如果 DNS 绕过客户端预期的解析路径，透明代理和 TUN 流量可能失去域名上下文。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "When a domain rule works through SOCKS5 but fails through TUN, compare the DNS path before changing the rule itself. See [DNS Module](./dns.md)."
msgstr "如果域名规则通过 SOCKS5 时正常、通过 TUN 时却失效，应先比较 DNS 路径，再修改规则本身。参阅 [DNS 模块](./dns.md)。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "The core first-match model and common Clash rule syntax are intended to remain portable across `chimera_client`, clash-rs, and Mihomo. Exact support still varies by runtime feature and platform."
msgstr "核心的首条匹配模型以及常见 Clash 规则语法，目标是在 `chimera_client`、clash-rs 与 Mihomo 之间保持较好的可移植性。具体支持范围仍会随运行时 feature 和平台而变化。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "In particular:"
msgstr "尤其需要注意："

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "process matching is platform-dependent;"
msgstr "进程匹配依赖平台；"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "GeoIP/GeoSite behavior depends on local datasets;"
msgstr "GeoIP/GeoSite 行为取决于本地数据集；"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "provider behavior depends on provider format and refresh success;"
msgstr "provider 行为取决于 provider 格式以及刷新是否成功；"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "DNS mode and inbound type can change the metadata available to a rule;"
msgstr "DNS 模式和入站类型会改变规则可获取的元数据；"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "newer Mihomo-only rule types should not be assumed to work unless they are explicitly implemented by the selected client core."
msgstr "对于较新的 Mihomo 专有规则类型，除非当前客户端核心明确实现，否则不应假定其可用。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "When a connection selects the wrong outbound, debug the decision in this order:"
msgstr "当连接选择了错误的出站时，建议按以下顺序排查决策过程："

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Identify the first rule that actually matched, not the rule you expected to match."
msgstr "先找出真正第一个命中的规则，而不是你原本预期会命中的规则。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Check whether an earlier broad rule shadows the intended one."
msgstr "检查前面是否有范围更宽的规则遮蔽了目标规则。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Confirm the policy/group named by the rule exists."
msgstr "确认规则指定的策略/组确实存在。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "For domain rules, verify that the runtime still knows the hostname."
msgstr "对于域名规则，确认运行时仍然掌握主机名信息。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "For IP/GeoIP rules, verify the resolved address and database state."
msgstr "对于 IP/GeoIP 规则，确认解析地址以及数据库状态。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "For process rules, confirm the observed executable name/path on that OS."
msgstr "对于进程规则，确认该操作系统上实际观察到的可执行文件名/路径。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "For `RULE-SET`, confirm the provider loaded and refreshed successfully."
msgstr "对于 `RULE-SET`，确认 provider 已成功加载并刷新。"

#: src\chimera_client/rules.md
msgid "Temporarily reduce the rules to a few explicit entries plus `MATCH` to isolate the problem."
msgstr "可以临时把规则缩减为少量明确条目加一个 `MATCH`，以便隔离问题。"

