msgstr "`VER/NMETHODS/METHODS`，随后进入选定认证方法的子协商"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "HTTP/3 `POST /auth` with `Hysteria-Auth`"
msgstr "带 `Hysteria-Auth` 的 HTTP/3 `POST /auth`"

