msgstr "HTTP 状态 `233`"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "`CMD=CONNECT`"
msgstr "`CMD=CONNECT`"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Open bidi stream and send varint `0x401` TCPRequest"
msgstr "打开双向流并发送 varint `0x401` TCPRequest"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Destination"
msgstr "目标地址"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "`ATYP + binary/domain address + uint16 port`"
msgstr "`ATYP + 二进制/域名地址 + uint16 端口`"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "length-prefixed textual `host:port`"
msgstr "带长度前缀的文本 `host:port`"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "TCP result"
msgstr "TCP 请求结果"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "SOCKS `REP` plus bound address"
msgstr "SOCKS `REP` 加绑定地址"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "`status + message + padding` TCPResponse"
msgstr "`status + message + padding` 的 TCPResponse"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "TCP data"
msgstr "TCP 数据"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Raw bytes on the SOCKS TCP connection"
msgstr "SOCKS TCP 连接上的原始字节"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Raw bytes on that QUIC stream"
msgstr "对应 QUIC 流上的原始字节"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Concurrency"
msgstr "并发模型"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Normally another SOCKS TCP connection per independent CONNECT"
msgstr "通常每个独立 CONNECT 都需要另一个 SOCKS TCP 连接"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Many independent QUIC streams share one QUIC connection"
msgstr "多个独立 QUIC 流共享同一个 QUIC 连接"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "UDP setup"
msgstr "UDP 建立方式"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "`UDP ASSOCIATE` command and returned relay endpoint"
msgstr "`UDP ASSOCIATE` 命令以及返回的中继端点"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "No separate command; auth response advertises UDP capability"
msgstr "没有单独命令；认证响应直接声明 UDP 能力"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Native UDP to SOCKS relay with SOCKS UDP header"
msgstr "通过原生 UDP 向 SOCKS 中继发送带 SOCKS UDP 头的数据报"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "QUIC DATAGRAM with Hysteria UDPMessage"
msgstr "承载 Hysteria UDPMessage 的 QUIC DATAGRAM"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "UDP session lifetime"
msgstr "UDP 会话生命周期"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Bound to TCP control connection"
msgstr "绑定到 TCP 控制连接"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Session ID plus server inactivity policy; no explicit close"
msgstr "由 Session ID 与服务端空闲策略管理；没有显式关闭命令"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "SOCKS UDP `FRAG` field; RFC recommends dropping if unsupported"
msgstr "SOCKS UDP 使用 `FRAG` 字段；若实现不支持分片，RFC 建议直接丢弃"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Explicit Packet ID + Fragment ID + Fragment Count reassembly"
msgstr "通过显式 Packet ID + Fragment ID + Fragment Count 完成重组"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Congestion control"
msgstr "拥塞控制"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Inherited independently from TCP/UDP transports"
msgstr "分别继承自底层 TCP/UDP 传输"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "QUIC congestion control plus optional receive-rate signaling"
msgstr "QUIC 拥塞控制，加可选的接收速率信号"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "The conceptual correspondence is still recognizable: authentication precedes proxy use, a TCP request names a destination and receives success/failure, and UDP needs per-datagram destination metadata. Hysteria replaces SOCKS5's small binary control protocol with HTTP/3 authentication plus QUIC-native streams and datagrams, and adds connection-level multiplexing, encryption, congestion control, and explicit UDP fragment identity."
msgstr "两者在概念上的对应关系仍然清晰可见：使用代理前都要先完成认证；TCP 请求都会指定目标并得到成功/失败结果；UDP 都需要逐数据报的目标元数据。Hysteria 用 HTTP/3 认证、QUIC 原生流和 DATAGRAM 替代了 SOCKS5 的小型二进制控制协议，并额外加入连接级多路复用、加密、拥塞控制以及显式 UDP 分片身份。"

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "Without QUIC decryption keys, a normal packet capture sees UDP packets carrying QUIC rather than the `/auth`, TCPRequest, destination, or UDPMessage fields. Useful observable phases are therefore:"
msgstr "如果没有 QUIC 解密密钥，普通抓包只能看到承载 QUIC 的 UDP 数据包，而看不到 `/auth`、TCPRequest、目标地址或 UDPMessage 字段。因此可观察的有效阶段主要是："

#: src\protocols/hysteria2.md
msgid "With endpoint-side QUIC/TLS secrets and suitable tooling, the investigator can separate HTTP/3 authentication, individual stream IDs, and DATAGRAM traffic. Even then, remember that QUIC packet boundaries are not TCPRequest message boundaries: STREAM frames can split or coalesce application bytes."
msgstr "如果能获得端点侧 QUIC/TLS 密钥并使用合适工具，分析者可以区分 HTTP/3 认证、各个 stream ID 与 DATAGRAM 流量。即便如此也必须记住：QUIC 数据包边界并不等于 TCPRequest 消息边界，STREAM frame 仍可能拆分或合并应用层字节。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC is a standardized proxy protocol for relaying TCP and UDP traffic over a multiplexed secure transport. The current protocol specification is version `0x05` and is designed primarily around QUIC, although the protocol model itself is expressed in terms of a multiplexable TLS-encrypted stream rather than being hard-wired to one implementation."
msgstr "TUIC 是一种标准化代理协议，用于通过可多路复用的安全传输转发 TCP 和 UDP 流量。当前协议规范版本为 `0x05`，主要围绕 QUIC 设计；不过协议模型本身以可多路复用的 TLS 加密流来描述，而不是强制绑定某一种具体实现。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC focuses on low-latency task startup, TCP/UDP multiplexing, connection-bound authentication, and flexible UDP relay behavior."
msgstr "TUIC 重点关注低延迟任务启动、TCP/UDP 多路复用、与连接绑定的认证以及灵活的 UDP 转发行为。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A typical QUIC deployment looks like:"
msgstr "典型 QUIC 部署可以理解为："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The current upstream specification also defines an `Authenticate` command used to authenticate the multiplexed connection."
msgstr "当前上游规范还定义了 `Authenticate` 命令，用于对这条多路复用连接进行认证。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC v5 authentication is connection-bound. The client identifies itself with a UUID and derives an authentication token from the current TLS session using the TLS Keying Material Exporter and the configured password."
msgstr "TUIC v5 的认证与连接绑定。客户端使用 UUID 标识自身，并结合当前 TLS 会话的 TLS Keying Material Exporter 与已配置密码派生认证 token。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "This matters operationally because authentication is tied to the secure session rather than being a reusable clear-text token sent independently of TLS."
msgstr "这一点在运维上很重要，因为认证绑定在安全会话本身，而不是独立于 TLS 发送一个可复用的明文 token。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The protocol allows authentication and relay-task setup to overlap. An implementation can receive task headers before authentication completes, but it should not process those tasks until the connection has been authenticated."
msgstr "协议允许认证过程与转发任务建立过程重叠。实现可以在认证完成前接收任务头，但在连接通过认证之前不应真正处理这些任务。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TCP Relay"
msgstr "TCP 转发"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TCP relaying uses a `Connect` command on a bidirectional stream:"
msgstr "TCP 转发在双向 Stream 上使用 `Connect` 命令："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The client opens a bidirectional stream."
msgstr "客户端打开一条双向 Stream。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The client sends the target address in a `Connect` command."
msgstr "客户端通过 `Connect` 命令发送目标地址。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The client can begin sending stream data without waiting for a separate application-level success response."
msgstr "客户端无需等待额外的应用层成功响应，就可以开始发送 Stream 数据。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The server opens the requested TCP connection."
msgstr "服务端建立所请求的 TCP 连接。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Once available, the server relays data between the destination socket and the QUIC stream."
msgstr "连接可用后，服务端在目标 socket 与 QUIC Stream 之间转发数据。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "This design contributes to TUIC's low-startup-latency behavior."
msgstr "这种设计有助于实现 TUIC 较低的任务启动延迟。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "UDP Relay"
msgstr "UDP 转发"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC uses an association identifier to keep UDP traffic for a logical session on a corresponding server-side UDP socket."
msgstr "TUIC 使用 association identifier，把一个逻辑会话中的 UDP 流量关联到服务端对应的 UDP socket。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A UDP packet can be carried using:"
msgstr "UDP 数据包可以通过以下方式承载："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "a QUIC unidirectional stream for reliable delivery,"
msgstr "使用 QUIC 单向 Stream 进行可靠传输；"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "or a QUIC datagram for native unreliable delivery."
msgstr "或使用 QUIC Datagram 进行原生不可靠传输。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The first packet for an association determines the reply mode for that association in the reference protocol flow."
msgstr "在参考协议流程中，一个 association 的第一个数据包会决定该 association 的响应模式。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC also defines packet identifiers and fragment fields so oversized UDP packets can be split and reassembled."
msgstr "TUIC 还定义了数据包标识与分片字段，使过大的 UDP 数据包可以拆分并重新组装。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "When the client no longer needs a UDP association, it can send a `Dissociate` command so the server releases the corresponding UDP socket."
msgstr "当客户端不再需要某个 UDP association 时，可以发送 `Dissociate` 命令，让服务端释放对应 UDP socket。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "0-RTT Considerations"
msgstr "0-RTT 注意事项"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC is designed to support very early relay-task setup and markets 0-RTT TCP and UDP proxying as a core goal."
msgstr "TUIC 设计上支持非常早地建立转发任务，并将 0-RTT TCP 与 UDP 代理作为核心目标之一。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "0-RTT should be understood as a latency optimization, not a reason to ignore replay and session-security considerations. Actual behavior depends on the QUIC and TLS implementation, resumption state, server policy, and the commands being processed."
msgstr "0-RTT 应被理解为延迟优化，而不是忽略重放风险和会话安全问题的理由。实际行为取决于 QUIC/TLS 实现、会话恢复状态、服务端策略以及正在处理的命令。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Heartbeats"
msgstr "心跳"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "When relay tasks are active, the protocol defines a heartbeat command carried through QUIC datagrams to keep the connection alive."
msgstr "当存在活动转发任务时，协议定义了通过 QUIC Datagram 承载的 heartbeat 命令，用于维持连接。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Long-lived mobile or NATed deployments should still account for operating-system power management, NAT timeouts, and network transitions; application heartbeats cannot guarantee that an external network preserves state indefinitely."
msgstr "长期运行的移动网络或 NAT 部署仍需考虑操作系统省电机制、NAT 超时和网络切换；应用层心跳不能保证外部网络无限期保留状态。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Conceptual Configuration"
msgstr "概念性配置"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A Clash-family TUIC node commonly contains information similar to:"
msgstr "Clash 系 TUIC 节点通常包含类似下面的信息："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "tuic-example"
msgstr "tuic-example"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "tuic"
msgstr "tuic"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Additional fields may select congestion control, UDP relay mode, ALPN, and heartbeat/timeout behavior. Use the schema of the selected core rather than copying options blindly between Mihomo, ClashRS, sing-box, or another implementation."
msgstr "其他字段可能用于选择拥塞控制、UDP 转发模式、ALPN 以及 heartbeat/timeout 行为。应以当前所选核心的 schema 为准，不要在 Mihomo、ClashRS、sing-box 或其他实现之间盲目复制选项。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TCP and UDP relay in one multiplexed secure connection."
msgstr "在一条多路复用安全连接中同时转发 TCP 与 UDP。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Designed for low relay-task startup latency."
msgstr "面向低转发任务启动延迟设计。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Native QUIC advantages such as multiplexing and connection migration."
msgstr "具备 QUIC 原生优势，例如多路复用和连接迁移。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "UDP can use unreliable QUIC datagrams or reliable stream-based delivery."
msgstr "UDP 可以使用不可靠 QUIC Datagram，也可以使用可靠的 Stream 传输。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Connection-bound authentication using TLS exporter material."
msgstr "使用 TLS exporter material 实现与连接绑定的认证。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Explicit UDP association lifecycle and fragmentation support."
msgstr "提供明确的 UDP association 生命周期与分片支持。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Requires a network path that handles QUIC/UDP reliably for the common deployment model."
msgstr "常见部署模式要求网络路径能够可靠承载 QUIC/UDP。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Different TUIC protocol versions are not guaranteed to interoperate."
msgstr "不同 TUIC 协议版本之间不保证能够互操作。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Configuration names and optional behavior differ between implementations."
msgstr "不同实现之间的配置名称和可选行为存在差异。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "QUIC fingerprinting, UDP throttling, and MTU issues can still affect real deployments."
msgstr "QUIC 指纹识别、UDP 限速以及 MTU 问题仍可能影响实际部署。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Very aggressive congestion-control tuning can hurt fairness and stability."
msgstr "过于激进的拥塞控制调优可能损害公平性和稳定性。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Keep certificate verification enabled unless a controlled development setup explicitly requires otherwise."
msgstr "除非受控开发环境明确需要，否则应保持证书验证开启。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Use unique UUID/password credentials per user or deployment where practical."
msgstr "条件允许时，应为不同用户或部署使用独立 UUID/密码凭据。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Treat 0-RTT as an optimization with security trade-offs, not as a universal fast path."
msgstr "应把 0-RTT 视为带有安全权衡的优化，而不是通用快速路径。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Protect server configuration files because the raw password participates in authentication-token derivation."
msgstr "应妥善保护服务端配置文件，因为原始密码会参与认证 token 的派生。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Keep server and client on compatible protocol versions."
msgstr "确保客户端与服务端使用兼容的协议版本。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC is currently listed in this Wiki under **planned client support**, not in the current client capability list. Do not present a TUIC profile as supported by `chimera_client` until the relevant implementation is enabled and validated in the client repository."
msgstr "当前 Wiki 将 TUIC 列在 **计划中的客户端支持** 下，而不是当前客户端能力列表中。在客户端仓库中的相关实现真正启用并通过验证之前，不应把 TUIC 配置描述为 `chimera_client` 已支持。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The GUI can only expose TUIC if the selected proxy core supports it. A profile accepted by Mihomo or another core does not automatically imply support by `chimera_client`."
msgstr "只有当前选中的代理核心支持 TUIC 时，GUI 才能暴露相应能力。Mihomo 或其他核心能接受某个配置，并不自动意味着 `chimera_client` 也支持。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The server capability map includes TUIC-related inbound parsing/handling work. That should be treated as implementation scope rather than a blanket guarantee of TUIC v5 interoperability, UDP modes, 0-RTT behavior, or every client option."
msgstr "服务端能力地图包含 TUIC 相关入站解析/处理实现。这里应被视为实现范围，而不是对 TUIC v5 互操作性、UDP 模式、0-RTT 行为或所有客户端选项的全面保证。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Cannot connect"
msgstr "无法连接"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Verify UDP reachability to the server."
msgstr "确认到服务端的 UDP 可达性。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Confirm server/client TUIC protocol versions are compatible."
msgstr "确认客户端与服务端 TUIC 协议版本兼容。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Validate SNI and certificate trust."
msgstr "检查 SNI 和证书信任。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Check UUID and password independently."
msgstr "分别检查 UUID 和密码。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Compare ALPN and other QUIC/TLS settings."
msgstr "对比 ALPN 以及其他 QUIC/TLS 设置。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Verify the selected UDP relay mode is supported on both ends."
msgstr "确认所选 UDP 转发模式在两端都受支持。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Test small datagrams first."
msgstr "先测试较小的数据报。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Inspect MTU and packet fragmentation."
msgstr "检查 MTU 与数据包分片。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Check association timeout behavior."
msgstr "检查 association 超时行为。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Confirm NAT/firewall policy allows return UDP traffic."
msgstr "确认 NAT/防火墙策略允许返回方向的 UDP 流量。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Intermittent mobile failures"
msgstr "移动网络间歇性故障"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Check whether the client's network changed between Wi-Fi and cellular."
msgstr "检查客户端网络是否在 Wi-Fi 与蜂窝网络之间发生切换。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Compare with a fresh connection rather than only relying on migration."
msgstr "使用新建连接进行对比，不要只依赖连接迁移。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Inspect NAT and idle timeouts."
msgstr "检查 NAT 与空闲超时。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Reduce optional tuning to defaults."
msgstr "将可选调优参数恢复到默认值。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Compare against another QUIC-based protocol to isolate path-level blocking."
msgstr "与另一种基于 QUIC 的协议对比，以隔离链路层阻断问题。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC protocol repository: <https://github.com/tuic-protocol/tuic>"
msgstr "TUIC 协议仓库：<https://github.com/tuic-protocol/tuic>"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC v5 specification: <https://github.com/tuic-protocol/tuic/blob/master/SPEC.md>"
msgstr "TUIC v5 规范：<https://github.com/tuic-protocol/tuic/blob/master/SPEC.md>"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TLS Exported Authenticators / exporter background, RFC 5705: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5705>"
msgstr "TLS exporter 背景，RFC 5705：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5705>"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "VLESS is a lightweight, stateless proxy protocol from the Xray ecosystem. It is designed to carry destination metadata and user identity while leaving most transport security to a separate layer such as TLS or REALITY."
msgstr "VLESS 是 Xray 生态中的轻量、无状态代理协议。它主要承载目标元数据和用户身份，而把大部分传输安全职责交给 TLS 或 REALITY 等独立层。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "A useful way to read an Xray-style configuration is to separate three layers:"
msgstr "理解 Xray 风格配置时，可以把它拆成三个层级："

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Those layers can be combined only when the selected core supports the combination."
msgstr "只有当前选中的核心支持相应组合时，这些层才能共同工作。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Identity and Authentication"
msgstr "身份与认证"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "VLESS users are identified by an `id`. A UUID is the common representation, and current Xray versions can also map supported custom strings to a stable UUID identity."
msgstr "VLESS 用户通过 `id` 标识。UUID 是最常见的表示形式，当前 Xray 版本还可以把受支持的自定义字符串映射为稳定的 UUID 身份。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Unlike VMess, VLESS does not rely on synchronized system time for its basic user identity model."
msgstr "与 VMess 不同，VLESS 的基础用户身份模型不依赖系统时间同步。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "The user identity is not a substitute for transport encryption. Traditional VLESS deployments therefore pair the protocol with TLS or REALITY."
msgstr "用户身份并不能替代传输加密。因此传统 VLESS 部署通常会把协议与 TLS 或 REALITY 配合使用。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "At a high level:"
msgstr "从高层来看："

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "The client establishes the configured transport and transport-security layer."
msgstr "客户端先建立已配置的传输层和传输安全层。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "The client sends the VLESS request containing user identity, command, and destination information."
msgstr "客户端发送包含用户身份、命令和目标信息的 VLESS 请求。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "The server validates the user and requested mode."
msgstr "服务端验证用户身份和请求模式。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "The server opens or dispatches the destination connection."
msgstr "服务端建立或分发目标连接。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Application traffic is relayed through the established transport."
msgstr "应用流量通过已经建立的传输层进行转发。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "The exact byte-level framing and optional encryption/flow behavior are defined by the Xray implementation and can evolve independently from the outer transport."
msgstr "具体字节级封装以及可选的加密/flow 行为由 Xray 实现定义，并可能独立于外层传输继续演进。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Transport Security"
msgstr "传输安全"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "TLS"
msgstr "TLS"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "TLS gives VLESS ordinary certificate-based transport security. The server name, certificate chain, and client verification settings must be configured correctly."
msgstr "TLS 为 VLESS 提供常规的基于证书的传输安全。服务端名称、证书链和客户端验证设置必须正确配置。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "REALITY modifies the TLS-facing security layer and is commonly combined with VLESS. See [Reality](./reality.md) for its key, short-ID, target, and fallback model."
msgstr "REALITY 修改面向 TLS 的安全层，并经常与 VLESS 配合使用。其密钥、short ID、target 与 fallback 模型请参阅 [Reality](./reality.md)。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "No transport security"
msgstr "无传输安全"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Current Xray documentation warns against using VLESS with no outer transport security for ordinary public-internet proxying unless the peer is on a trusted private path or VLESS Encryption is explicitly enabled and appropriate for the deployment."
msgstr "当前 Xray 文档不建议在普通公网代理场景中使用没有外层传输安全的 VLESS，除非对端位于可信私有链路上，或已经明确启用且正确配置适合该部署的 VLESS Encryption。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "For this Wiki, the conservative rule is simple: **do not deploy bare VLESS over an untrusted public path unless you understand and intentionally configure the security model of the selected implementation.**"
msgstr "在本 Wiki 中采用一个保守原则：**除非你清楚理解并有意配置当前实现的安全模型，否则不要在不可信公网链路上裸跑 VLESS。**"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Flow Control / XTLS Vision"
msgstr "Flow Control / XTLS Vision"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Xray exposes `flow` options such as `xtls-rprx-vision` for compatible VLESS combinations. Flow control is not merely a cosmetic config flag: client, server, transport security, and underlying transport need to agree on the supported combination."
msgstr "Xray 为兼容的 VLESS 组合提供 `xtls-rprx-vision` 等 `flow` 选项。Flow control 并不只是一个表面配置开关：客户端、服务端、传输安全层和底层传输都必须对所支持的组合保持一致。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "When documenting Chimera compatibility, treat Vision support separately from basic VLESS request parsing."
msgstr "记录 Chimera 兼容性时，应把 Vision 支持与基础 VLESS 请求解析分开评估。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md src\protocols/xhttp.md src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Minimal Xray-Style Server Example"
msgstr "最小 Xray 风格服务端示例"

#: src\protocols/vless.md src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "\"/api/sync\""
msgstr "\"/api/sync\""

#: src\protocols/vless.md src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "\"target\""
msgstr "\"target\""

#: src\protocols/vless.md src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "\"SERVER-PRIVATE-KEY\""
msgstr "\"SERVER-PRIVATE-KEY\""

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "This example demonstrates layer composition. It is not intended to be copied unchanged: the target, keys, identifiers, path, and supported option names must match the actual core version."
msgstr "这个示例用于展示各层如何组合，并不建议原样复制。target、密钥、标识符、path 以及受支持选项名称都必须与实际核心版本匹配。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Conceptual Client Example"
msgstr "概念性客户端示例"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "vless-example"
msgstr "vless-example"

#: src\protocols/vless.md src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "example.com"
msgstr "example.com"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Clash-family field names are implementation-specific. A profile valid in Mihomo is not automatically valid in `chimera_client`."
msgstr "Clash 系配置字段名称具有实现差异。在 Mihomo 中有效的配置，并不自动意味着在 `chimera_client` 中也有效。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Small and relatively simple proxy-protocol layer."
msgstr "代理协议层较小且相对简单。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "User identities scale beyond one shared global password."
msgstr "用户身份模型比单一全局共享密码更容易扩展。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Can be combined with multiple Xray transport methods."
msgstr "可以与多种 Xray 传输方式组合。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Works with TLS and REALITY security layers in supported combinations."
msgstr "在受支持的组合中可以配合 TLS 和 REALITY 安全层使用。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "XTLS/Vision modes can optimize compatible traffic paths."
msgstr "XTLS/Vision 模式可以优化兼容的流量路径。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "VLESS alone should not be treated as complete public-internet transport security."
msgstr "不能把 VLESS 本身视为完整的公网传输安全方案。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Many useful deployments depend on Xray-specific transport/security behavior."
msgstr "许多实用部署依赖 Xray 特定的传输/安全行为。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Flow and transport compatibility can be confusing across different clients."
msgstr "不同客户端之间的 flow 与传输兼容性可能比较复杂。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Configuration schemas differ between Xray, Mihomo, Clash-family clients, and other implementations."
msgstr "Xray、Mihomo、Clash 系客户端和其他实现之间的配置 schema 并不相同。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "A successful parser import does not prove transport interoperability."
msgstr "配置能够被解析器成功导入，并不能证明传输层能够互操作。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Prefer TLS or REALITY for public deployments unless using a deliberately configured alternative security mechanism."
msgstr "公网部署应优先使用 TLS 或 REALITY，除非明确选择并正确配置了其他安全机制。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Keep certificate verification enabled for TLS."
msgstr "使用 TLS 时保持证书验证开启。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Protect VLESS user IDs and server configuration even though an ID should not be treated like a human-memorable password."
msgstr "即使 VLESS 用户 ID 不应被当作人类可记忆密码，也应妥善保护用户 ID 和服务端配置。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Rotate or disable identities for retired clients."
msgstr "客户端停用后，应轮换或禁用对应身份。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Do not copy `flow` settings between unrelated transports without confirming support."
msgstr "在没有确认支持情况前，不要在无关传输方式之间直接复制 `flow` 设置。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "The current `Chimera_Client` overview does **not** list standalone VLESS as a separate current capability, even though related capabilities such as Reality + TCP and XHTTP are documented. Until the client repository is used to establish the exact supported combination, treat VLESS client support as combination/branch-specific rather than claiming full parity."
msgstr "当前 `Chimera_Client` 总览并**没有**把独立 VLESS 列为单独的当前能力，虽然已经记录了 Reality + TCP、XHTTP 等相关能力。在通过客户端仓库确认确切支持组合之前，应把 VLESS 客户端支持视为依赖组合/分支的能力，而不是声称已经全面兼容。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "The GUI can store or generate VLESS-style profiles only to the extent that the selected core understands them. Selecting Mihomo, clash-rs, or `chimera_client` can therefore change the effective feature set."
msgstr "GUI 只能在当前所选核心能够理解的范围内保存或生成 VLESS 风格配置。因此选择 Mihomo、clash-rs 或 `chimera_client` 时，实际可用功能集可能不同。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "VLESS is explicitly included in the current server capability map, with example server configurations documented in the server repository. This still does not mean every transport, `flow`, fallback, encryption option, or Xray version is fully compatible."
msgstr "VLESS 已明确包含在当前服务端能力地图中，服务端仓库也记录了示例配置。但这仍不意味着所有传输方式、`flow`、fallback、加密选项或 Xray 版本都完全兼容。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Authentication / immediate disconnect"
msgstr "认证失败 / 立即断开"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Verify the user `id` on both ends."
msgstr "检查两端的用户 `id`。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Confirm the client and server are using compatible VLESS configuration shapes."
msgstr "确认客户端与服务端使用兼容的 VLESS 配置结构。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Check `flow` independently; remove optional flow tuning while isolating the base connection."
msgstr "单独检查 `flow`；隔离基础连接问题时先移除可选 flow 调优。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "TLS/REALITY succeeds but VLESS fails"
msgstr "TLS/REALITY 成功但 VLESS 失败"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Confirm the server inbound protocol is actually VLESS."
msgstr "确认服务端入站协议确实是 VLESS。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Check the user identity and decryption/encryption settings."
msgstr "检查用户身份以及解密/加密设置。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Verify the transport method (`raw`, XHTTP, gRPC, etc.) matches both ends."
msgstr "确认两端的传输方式（`raw`、XHTTP、gRPC 等）一致。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Inspect server logs for request-version or user-validation errors."
msgstr "检查服务端日志中的请求版本或用户验证错误。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Works in one core but not another"
msgstr "在一个核心中可用、另一个核心中不可用"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Compare accepted field names rather than only values."
msgstr "除了比较字段值，也要比较实际接受的字段名称。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Compare transport/security combinations."
msgstr "比较传输方式/安全机制组合。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Check whether one core silently ignores unsupported fields."
msgstr "检查某个核心是否静默忽略了不支持的字段。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Reduce the profile to one user, one transport, and no optional flow settings."
msgstr "把配置缩减为一个用户、一种传输方式，并移除所有可选 flow 设置。"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Xray VLESS inbound: <https://xtls.github.io/en/config/inbounds/vless.html>"
msgstr "Xray VLESS 入站：<https://xtls.github.io/en/config/inbounds/vless.html>"

#: src\protocols/vless.md
msgid "Xray VLESS outbound: <https://xtls.github.io/en/config/outbounds/vless.html>"
msgstr "Xray VLESS 出站：<https://xtls.github.io/en/config/outbounds/vless.html>"

#: src\protocols/vless.md src\protocols/xhttp.md src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Xray transport compatibility: <https://xtls.github.io/en/config/transport.html>"
msgstr "Xray 传输兼容性：<https://xtls.github.io/en/config/transport.html>"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "REALITY is an Xray transport-security mechanism. It is not a standalone proxy protocol: it protects and camouflages a supported transport while the actual proxy protocol can be VLESS, Trojan, or another compatible Xray inbound/outbound combination."
msgstr "REALITY 是 Xray 的传输安全机制，而不是独立代理协议。它负责保护和伪装受支持的传输层，实际代理协议可以是 VLESS、Trojan 或其他兼容的 Xray 入站/出站组合。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Current Xray documentation describes REALITY as a modified TLS design that borrows the appearance and handshake characteristics of a target site. In the current Xray transport matrix, REALITY is used with `RAW`, XHTTP, or gRPC."
msgstr "当前 Xray 文档把 REALITY 描述为一种经过修改的 TLS 设计，会借用目标站点的外观和握手特征。在当前 Xray 传输兼容矩阵中，REALITY 可与 `RAW`、XHTTP 或 gRPC 配合使用。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Main Configuration Concepts"
msgstr "主要配置概念"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "A REALITY deployment commonly includes:"
msgstr "REALITY 部署通常包含："

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "a server-side private key,"
msgstr "服务端私钥；"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "the corresponding client-side public key,"
msgstr "对应的客户端公钥；"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "one or more short IDs,"
msgstr "一个或多个 short ID；"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "one or more permitted server names,"
msgstr "一个或多个允许的 server name；"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "a target site/address used for handshake appearance and fallback behavior,"
msgstr "用于握手外观和 fallback 行为的 target 站点/地址；"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "and a client TLS fingerprint setting in implementations that expose uTLS-like fingerprint controls."
msgstr "以及在支持类似 uTLS 指纹控制的实现中配置客户端 TLS fingerprint。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "These pieces belong to the same security configuration and must be kept consistent."
msgstr "这些项目属于同一套安全配置，必须保持一致。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "The client connects to the REALITY-enabled endpoint."
msgstr "客户端连接到启用了 REALITY 的端点。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "The client begins a TLS-like handshake using the configured server name and client fingerprint behavior."
msgstr "客户端使用已配置的 server name 和客户端 fingerprint 行为开始类 TLS 握手。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "The REALITY endpoint validates the handshake using its key material and the supplied short ID/security parameters."
msgstr "REALITY 端点使用自身密钥材料以及客户端提供的 short ID/安全参数验证握手。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "If validation succeeds, the underlying proxy transport proceeds."
msgstr "验证成功后，底层代理传输继续进行。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "If traffic is not accepted as a valid REALITY session, Xray can forward it toward the configured target instead of returning a proxy-specific response."
msgstr "如果流量没有被接受为有效 REALITY 会话，Xray 可以把它转发到已配置 target，而不是返回代理专用响应。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "The target therefore participates in both camouflage and fallback behavior and must be chosen deliberately."
msgstr "因此 target 同时参与伪装与 fallback 行为，必须谨慎选择。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Key Material"
msgstr "密钥材料"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "REALITY commonly uses X25519-style key material in existing deployments. The server stores the private key while clients receive the corresponding public key."
msgstr "现有 REALITY 部署通常使用 X25519 风格密钥材料。服务端保存私钥，客户端获得对应公钥。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Do not place a server private key in client profiles, screenshots, issue reports, or public documentation examples."
msgstr "不要把服务端私钥放入客户端配置、截图、Issue 报告或公开文档示例中。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "For Chimera_Server, the current Wiki documents an `x25519` helper in `chimera_cli` for generating compatible key material."
msgstr "对于 Chimera_Server，当前 Wiki 记录了 `chimera_cli` 中的 `x25519` 辅助命令，可用于生成兼容密钥材料。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Short IDs"
msgstr "Short ID"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Short IDs add another server-validated value to REALITY sessions. A server can accept one or more values, while a client selects a matching value."
msgstr "Short ID 为 REALITY 会话增加了一个由服务端验证的值。服务端可以接受一个或多个值，客户端选择其中匹配的一项。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Treat short IDs as configuration/security material rather than decorative labels. Client and server must use compatible values and formatting."
msgstr "应把 short ID 视为配置/安全材料，而不是装饰性标签。客户端和服务端必须使用兼容的值和格式。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Target and Server Names"
msgstr "Target 与 Server Name"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "The server-side `target` identifies the service whose TLS-facing behavior is used as part of the REALITY design and also receives traffic that does not pass REALITY authentication in the current Xray model."
msgstr "服务端 `target` 指定一个服务，其面向 TLS 的行为会被 REALITY 设计利用；在当前 Xray 模型中，未通过 REALITY 认证的流量也会被发送到该 target。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "`serverNames` restrict which client server-name values are accepted."
msgstr "`serverNames` 限制客户端可以使用哪些 server-name 值。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "A practical target should:"
msgstr "实际使用的 target 应当："

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "be reachable reliably from the server,"
msgstr "能够被服务端稳定访问；"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "provide a TLS behavior compatible with the intended setup,"
msgstr "提供与预期部署兼容的 TLS 行为；"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "not expose sensitive internal infrastructure,"
msgstr "不能暴露敏感内部基础设施；"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "and not create an undesirable open-forwarding path."
msgstr "并且不能形成不希望出现的开放转发路径。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Current Xray documentation explicitly warns that a poorly chosen target can turn the REALITY server into an unintended forwarder for traffic that fails authentication."
msgstr "当前 Xray 文档明确警告：不恰当的 target 选择可能让 REALITY 服务端意外变成针对认证失败流量的转发器。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "\"raw\""
msgstr "\"raw\""

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "The example is intentionally minimal. Use real generated key material and a server/target combination appropriate for the deployment."
msgstr "该示例有意保持最小化。实际部署应使用真实生成的密钥材料，以及适合当前环境的 server/target 组合。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "reality-example"
msgstr "reality-example"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "tcp"
msgstr "tcp"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "reality-opts"
msgstr "reality-opts"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "public-key"
msgstr "public-key"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "CLIENT-PUBLIC-KEY"
msgstr "CLIENT-PUBLIC-KEY"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "short-id"
msgstr "short-id"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "0123456789abcdef"
msgstr "0123456789abcdef"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Clash-family names are not the same as native Xray JSON field names. The selected core's schema is authoritative."
msgstr "Clash 系字段名称与原生 Xray JSON 字段名称并不相同。应以当前所选核心的 schema 为准。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "REALITY vs TLS"
msgstr "REALITY 与 TLS"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Both REALITY and ordinary TLS occupy the transport-security layer, but their operational models differ."
msgstr "REALITY 和普通 TLS 都位于传输安全层，但两者的运行模型不同。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Ordinary TLS"
msgstr "普通 TLS"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Uses a certificate chain presented by the server."
msgstr "使用服务端提供的证书链。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Normally requires certificate issuance/renewal."
msgstr "通常需要证书签发与续期。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Client trust follows normal TLS certificate verification."
msgstr "客户端信任关系遵循普通 TLS 证书验证。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Uses REALITY key material and target-site handshake behavior."
msgstr "使用 REALITY 密钥材料和目标站点握手行为。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Does not use the deployment's own conventional public certificate in the same way as a normal TLS server."
msgstr "不像普通 TLS 服务端那样直接使用部署自身的常规公有证书。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Relies on client/server REALITY compatibility and correct fingerprint/target behavior."
msgstr "依赖客户端/服务端 REALITY 兼容性以及正确的 fingerprint/target 行为。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Do not describe REALITY simply as \"TLS without a certificate\"; that hides the key validation, target forwarding, and implementation-specific handshake logic that actually define the deployment."
msgstr "不要简单把 REALITY 描述成“没有证书的 TLS”；这种说法会掩盖真正决定部署行为的密钥验证、target 转发以及实现特定握手逻辑。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Avoids operating a conventional certificate for the REALITY endpoint itself."
msgstr "REALITY 端点本身无需按普通方式维护常规证书。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Integrates with Xray's supported proxy and transport combinations."
msgstr "可以与 Xray 支持的代理协议和传输组合集成。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Unauthenticated traffic can follow a normal target-service path instead of a bespoke proxy response."
msgstr "未认证流量可以进入普通 target 服务路径，而不是得到专用代理响应。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Commonly paired with VLESS and XTLS Vision in modern Xray deployments."
msgstr "现代 Xray 部署中经常与 VLESS 和 XTLS Vision 配合使用。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Primarily an Xray-ecosystem mechanism rather than a general Internet standard."
msgstr "它主要是 Xray 生态机制，而不是通用 Internet 标准。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Client fingerprint and server target behavior must be compatible."
msgstr "客户端 fingerprint 与服务端 target 行为必须兼容。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "A bad target choice can create reliability or abuse problems."
msgstr "错误的 target 选择可能造成可靠性或滥用问题。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Configuration has more moving parts than normal certificate-based TLS."
msgstr "相比普通基于证书的 TLS，配置涉及更多相互关联的部分。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Transport support is constrained by the selected Xray/core version."
msgstr "可用传输方式受所选 Xray/核心版本限制。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Never expose the REALITY server private key."
msgstr "绝不要暴露 REALITY 服务端私钥。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Keep public/private key pairs synchronized during rotation."
msgstr "轮换密钥时保持公私钥对同步。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Use controlled short IDs and remove values no longer needed."
msgstr "使用受控的 short ID，并删除已经不再需要的值。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Do not set a sensitive private endpoint as the fallback target."
msgstr "不要把敏感私有端点设为 fallback target。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Treat `allowInsecure`/certificate-style bypass options in surrounding transports as debugging tools, not production defaults."
msgstr "周边传输中的 `allowInsecure`/证书绕过类选项应被视为调试工具，而不是生产默认配置。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Keep client fingerprint selection realistic and supported by the actual core."
msgstr "客户端 fingerprint 应选择真实合理、且由实际核心支持的值。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "The current client overview lists **Reality + TCP** as a supported combination. In current upstream Xray terminology, the corresponding base transport is often called `RAW`; Clash-family configurations may still expose it as `tcp`. This is a naming difference that should be accounted for when translating profiles."
msgstr "当前客户端总览把 **Reality + TCP** 列为受支持组合。在当前上游 Xray 术语中，对应基础传输通常称为 `RAW`；Clash 系配置仍可能把它暴露为 `tcp`。转换配置时需要考虑这种命名差异。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "The exact supported proxy protocol underneath REALITY should be verified in the current `Chimera_Client` implementation instead of assuming complete Xray compatibility from the transport alone."
msgstr "REALITY 下层实际支持哪些代理协议，应以当前 `Chimera_Client` 实现为准，而不能仅凭传输层就假定完全兼容 Xray。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Chimera manages the profile and selected core. REALITY key/fingerprint fields must be emitted in the schema expected by that core."
msgstr "Chimera 负责管理配置文件和所选核心。REALITY 密钥/fingerprint 字段必须按该核心所期望的 schema 生成。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "The server documentation includes a VLESS + REALITY example and an X25519 key helper. This makes REALITY an important server target, but transport combinations and Xray-version compatibility should still be tested explicitly."
msgstr "服务端文档包含 VLESS + REALITY 示例和 X25519 密钥辅助工具，说明 REALITY 是重要服务端目标；但传输组合与 Xray 版本兼容性仍应显式测试。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Immediate handshake failure"
msgstr "握手立即失败"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Verify server public/private key pairing."
msgstr "检查服务端公私钥是否正确配对。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Check the short ID."
msgstr "检查 short ID。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Verify the client server name is permitted by `serverNames`."
msgstr "确认客户端 server name 被 `serverNames` 允许。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Confirm the target is reachable from the server."
msgstr "确认服务端能够访问 target。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Check client fingerprint support."
msgstr "检查客户端 fingerprint 支持情况。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Target site works but proxy does not"
msgstr "Target 站点正常但代理不可用"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "This often means the public listener and fallback path are reachable while the REALITY authentication path is failing. Re-check keys, short ID, server name, proxy user identity, and transport method."
msgstr "这通常表示公网监听器和 fallback 路径可达，但 REALITY 认证路径失败。应重新检查密钥、short ID、server name、代理用户身份以及传输方式。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Works in Xray but not another core"
msgstr "在 Xray 中可用但其他核心不可用"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Compare accepted field names."
msgstr "比较实际接受的字段名称。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Confirm the core supports the same proxy + transport + REALITY combination."
msgstr "确认核心支持相同的代理协议 + 传输方式 + REALITY 组合。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Check whether `tcp` and `raw` are translated correctly."
msgstr "检查 `tcp` 与 `raw` 是否被正确转换。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Remove optional Vision/XMUX/XHTTP tuning until the base handshake works."
msgstr "在基础握手正常前，先移除可选 Vision/XMUX/XHTTP 调优。"

#: src\protocols/reality.md
msgid "Xray REALITY configuration: <https://xtls.github.io/en/config/transports/reality.html>"
msgstr "Xray REALITY 配置：<https://xtls.github.io/en/config/transports/reality.html>"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "XHTTP is an Xray transport method used to carry proxy traffic through HTTP-shaped request/response flows. It belongs to the transport layer, not the proxy-protocol layer."
msgstr "XHTTP 是 Xray 的一种传输方式，用于通过 HTTP 形态的请求/响应流承载代理流量。它属于传输层，而不是代理协议层。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "A typical deployment combines:"
msgstr "典型部署会组合："

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Current Xray transport documentation allows XHTTP to be combined with ordinary TLS or REALITY. The exact HTTP behavior and tuning options have evolved over time, so the selected core version should be treated as the source of truth."
msgstr "当前 Xray 传输文档允许 XHTTP 与普通 TLS 或 REALITY 组合使用。具体 HTTP 行为和调优选项会随版本演进，因此应以当前所选核心版本作为权威来源。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Why XHTTP Exists"
msgstr "为什么需要 XHTTP"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Long-lived raw TCP, WebSocket, and gRPC connections have different network signatures and operational constraints. XHTTP provides another way to express uplink and downlink traffic using HTTP-like exchanges and connection reuse."
msgstr "长连接 raw TCP、WebSocket 和 gRPC 具有不同的网络特征与运行约束。XHTTP 提供了另一种方式，使用类似 HTTP 的交换和连接复用来组织上行与下行流量。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Typical reasons to evaluate XHTTP include:"
msgstr "通常会考虑 XHTTP 的原因包括："

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "deployment behind HTTP-aware infrastructure,"
msgstr "需要部署在支持 HTTP 的基础设施之后；"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "environments where WebSocket/gRPC behavior is unreliable,"
msgstr "WebSocket/gRPC 行为不稳定的环境；"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "separate control over upload/download request patterns,"
msgstr "需要分别控制上传/下载请求模式；"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "and compatibility with Xray's TLS/REALITY transport-security layer."
msgstr "以及需要与 Xray 的 TLS/REALITY 传输安全层组合。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "It should not be described simply as \"HTTP proxying\". A local HTTP proxy and an XHTTP transport solve different problems."
msgstr "不能简单把它描述为“HTTP 代理”。本地 HTTP 代理与 XHTTP 传输解决的是不同问题。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Layer Model"
msgstr "分层模型"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Both endpoints must agree on the XHTTP transport settings that affect request routing and stream interpretation."
msgstr "两端必须对影响请求路由和数据流解释方式的 XHTTP 传输设置保持一致。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Core Fields"
msgstr "核心字段"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "The current Xray implementation exposes a broad XHTTP configuration surface. For documentation and initial deployment, focus on the small set of fields that are essential to establish a connection:"
msgstr "当前 Xray 实现提供了较多 XHTTP 配置项。对于文档和初始部署，应先关注建立连接所必需的少数字段："

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "HTTP request path used by the XHTTP endpoint"
msgstr "XHTTP 端点使用的 HTTP 请求路径"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Optional HTTP Host value / virtual-host selection"
msgstr "可选 HTTP Host 值 / 虚拟主机选择"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "XHTTP upload/download behavior; `auto` is a common starting point"
msgstr "XHTTP 上行/下行行为；`auto` 是常见起点"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "`headers` / extra headers"
msgstr "`headers` / 额外请求头"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Optional HTTP metadata depending on implementation/version"
msgstr "随实现/版本变化的可选 HTTP 元数据"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Connection/request reuse and concurrency tuning"
msgstr "连接/请求复用与并发调优"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "`downloadSettings`"
msgstr "`downloadSettings`"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Advanced split upload/download routing in newer Xray versions"
msgstr "较新 Xray 版本中的高级上下行分离路由"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Advanced fields controlling padding, request chunking, session placement, and connection reuse exist in current Xray code. Avoid copying large tuning blocks from random examples before the minimal path works."
msgstr "当前 Xray 代码中还存在用于控制 padding、请求分块、会话放置和连接复用的高级字段。在最小连接路径尚未工作前，不要从随机示例中直接复制大型调优配置块。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "\"proxy.example.com\""
msgstr "\"proxy.example.com\""

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "For REALITY, replace the TLS security block with a compatible REALITY block and ensure the selected Xray/core version supports that transport/security combination."
msgstr "如果使用 REALITY，应把 TLS 安全配置块替换为兼容的 REALITY 配置，并确认当前 Xray/核心版本支持对应传输/安全组合。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Conceptual Clash-Family Client Example"
msgstr "概念性 Clash 系客户端示例"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "/api/sync"
msgstr "/api/sync"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Field names such as `xhttp-opts` are frontend/core specific. Native Xray JSON, Mihomo, ClashRS, and `chimera_client` may expose different schemas."
msgstr "`xhttp-opts` 等字段名称取决于前端/核心。原生 Xray JSON、Mihomo、ClashRS 和 `chimera_client` 可能使用不同 schema。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "The path is one of the most important interoperability fields."
msgstr "path 是最重要的互操作字段之一。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Client and server need compatible path handling. If a reverse proxy is present, it must route that path to the XHTTP backend without accidentally serving a normal website response instead."
msgstr "客户端与服务端需要兼容的 path 处理方式。如果链路中有反向代理，它必须把该 path 正确路由到 XHTTP 后端，而不能误返回普通网站内容。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Use a deliberate path and document it. Do not reuse a sensitive application endpoint merely to make the traffic appear more realistic."
msgstr "应明确选择并记录 path。不要仅为了让流量看起来更真实，就复用敏感应用端点。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "`host` can participate in virtual-host routing through Nginx, Caddy, a CDN, or another HTTP-aware frontend."
msgstr "`host` 可以参与 Nginx、Caddy、CDN 或其他支持 HTTP 的前端的虚拟主机路由。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "When a reverse proxy chooses an upstream based on `Host`, a missing or mismatched value can produce a perfectly valid HTTP response from the wrong virtual host, which may look like a proxy protocol failure."
msgstr "当反向代理根据 `Host` 选择上游时，缺失或不匹配的值可能让错误虚拟主机返回一个完全有效的 HTTP 响应，看起来就像代理协议失败。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "XHTTP has multiple transport modes in current Xray implementations. `auto` is a reasonable baseline because it allows the core to choose compatible behavior without forcing a specialized upload strategy."
msgstr "当前 Xray 实现中的 XHTTP 有多种传输模式。`auto` 是合理的基线，因为它允许核心选择兼容行为，而无需强制指定特殊上传策略。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Only force a specific mode when:"
msgstr "只有在以下条件满足时才建议强制指定模式："

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "both client and server versions support it,"
msgstr "客户端和服务端版本都支持；"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "the HTTP version/path is understood,"
msgstr "已经明确理解 HTTP 版本/path 行为；"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "and you have a concrete reason such as CDN behavior or upstream limitations."
msgstr "并且存在 CDN 行为或上游限制等明确理由。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Mode tuning should come after basic connectivity."
msgstr "Mode 调优应放在基础连通性验证之后。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "XMUX and Connection Reuse"
msgstr "XMUX 与连接复用"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "XHTTP can maintain pools of HTTP connections and reuse them for multiple proxy requests. Current Xray code exposes settings such as maximum concurrency, connection counts, request reuse limits, and connection lifetime controls."
msgstr "XHTTP 可以维护 HTTP 连接池，并为多个代理请求复用连接。当前 Xray 代码提供最大并发数、连接数量、请求复用限制和连接生命周期等设置。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Tuning these values changes server load and traffic shape. More concurrency is not always faster: it can increase connection churn, memory usage, and pressure on reverse proxies or CDNs."
msgstr "调整这些值会改变服务端负载和流量形态。更高并发并不总是更快，它可能增加连接频繁创建/销毁、内存使用以及反向代理或 CDN 压力。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Start with implementation defaults, collect latency/throughput data, and tune one dimension at a time."
msgstr "应从实现默认值开始，收集延迟/吞吐数据，再一次只调整一个维度。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Reverse Proxy and CDN Considerations"
msgstr "反向代理与 CDN 注意事项"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "When placing XHTTP behind Nginx, Caddy, or a CDN, check:"
msgstr "把 XHTTP 放在 Nginx、Caddy 或 CDN 后面时，应检查："

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "TLS termination location,"
msgstr "TLS 终止位置；"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "HTTP/2 or HTTP/3 support,"
msgstr "HTTP/2 或 HTTP/3 支持；"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "request and response buffering,"
msgstr "请求与响应缓冲；"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "maximum request body sizes,"
msgstr "最大请求体大小；"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "idle and upstream timeouts,"
msgstr "空闲与上游超时；"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "path rewriting,"
msgstr "path 重写；"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Host/SNI routing,"
msgstr "Host/SNI 路由；"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "and whether the provider permits the connection pattern."
msgstr "以及服务提供方是否允许这种连接模式。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "A connection that works directly against Xray but fails behind a reverse proxy usually indicates an HTTP routing or timeout mismatch rather than a VLESS user problem."
msgstr "如果直连 Xray 时正常、放到反向代理后失败，通常说明 HTTP 路由或超时配置不匹配，而不是 VLESS 用户身份问题。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "XHTTP + REALITY"
msgstr "XHTTP + REALITY"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Current Xray transport documentation supports XHTTP with REALITY."
msgstr "当前 Xray 传输文档支持 XHTTP 与 REALITY 组合。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Keep the layers separate during diagnosis:"
msgstr "排障时应保持各层分开检查："

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Is the TCP/QUIC path reachable?"
msgstr "TCP/QUIC 路径是否可达？"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Does REALITY authenticate correctly?"
msgstr "REALITY 是否正确完成认证？"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Does the XHTTP path/mode match?"
msgstr "XHTTP 的 path/mode 是否匹配？"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Does the proxy protocol user identity match?"
msgstr "代理协议用户身份是否匹配？"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Does the reverse proxy/CDN route the request correctly?"
msgstr "反向代理/CDN 是否正确路由请求？"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Changing all of these at once makes failures difficult to localize."
msgstr "同时修改这些层会让故障难以定位。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "HTTP-oriented transport behavior suitable for HTTP-aware infrastructure."
msgstr "面向 HTTP 的传输行为，适合支持 HTTP 的基础设施。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Can be combined with TLS or REALITY in current Xray versions."
msgstr "在当前 Xray 版本中可以与 TLS 或 REALITY 组合。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Supports connection reuse and multiplex-oriented tuning."
msgstr "支持连接复用和面向多路复用的调优。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Can be deployed directly or behind reverse-proxy/CDN layers when configured correctly."
msgstr "配置正确时既可直接部署，也可放在反向代理/CDN 之后。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Gives operators more control over upload/download transport behavior than a single raw stream."
msgstr "相比单一 raw stream，可以让运维人员更细致地控制上下行传输行为。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "More configuration surface than raw TCP."
msgstr "配置项比 raw TCP 更多。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Path, Host, mode, reverse-proxy, and security settings must align."
msgstr "Path、Host、mode、反向代理和安全设置必须相互一致。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Advanced tuning changes between Xray versions and implementations."
msgstr "高级调优项会随 Xray 版本和实现变化。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "CDN/reverse-proxy policies can break otherwise valid direct connections."
msgstr "CDN/反向代理策略可能破坏原本可以直连工作的配置。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Incorrect multiplex tuning can reduce rather than improve performance."
msgstr "错误的多路复用调优可能降低而不是提升性能。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Use TLS or REALITY on untrusted networks unless the selected architecture has another deliberate security layer."
msgstr "在不可信网络中应使用 TLS 或 REALITY，除非当前架构明确配置了其他安全层。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Keep TLS certificate verification enabled."
msgstr "保持 TLS 证书验证开启。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Do not place authentication secrets in custom HTTP headers unless the protocol explicitly requires it and the operational implications are understood."
msgstr "除非协议明确要求并且已经理解其运维影响，否则不要把认证秘密放入自定义 HTTP 请求头。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Treat reverse-proxy access logs as potentially sensitive because paths, headers, and connection metadata may be recorded."
msgstr "应把反向代理访问日志视为潜在敏感数据，因为其中可能记录 path、header 和连接元数据。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Keep Xray/core versions patched; XHTTP evolves actively and old examples can become misleading."
msgstr "应及时更新 Xray/核心版本；XHTTP 仍在积极演进，旧示例可能逐渐失去参考价值。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "XHTTP is listed as a current client-core capability. The important compatibility question is not only \"does XHTTP exist?\" but which proxy protocol, mode, security layer, and option names are currently implemented. Validate the exact combination before copying a Mihomo/Xray profile unchanged."
msgstr "XHTTP 当前被列为客户端核心能力。兼容性问题不只是“有没有 XHTTP”，还包括当前究竟实现了哪些代理协议、mode、安全层和配置字段。不要直接原样复制 Mihomo/Xray 配置，应先验证确切组合。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Chimera can manage an XHTTP profile only through the schema accepted by the selected core. A GUI field being present does not prove that every XHTTP mode or XMUX option is supported by that core."
msgstr "Chimera 只能按照当前所选核心接受的 schema 管理 XHTTP 配置。GUI 中存在某个字段，并不能证明该核心支持所有 XHTTP mode 或 XMUX 选项。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "The server capability map includes XHTTP-related parsing/transport work. Treat basic XHTTP connectivity, TLS, REALITY, reverse-proxy behavior, and advanced XMUX/download settings as separate compatibility dimensions."
msgstr "服务端能力地图包含 XHTTP 相关解析/传输实现。应把基础 XHTTP 连通性、TLS、REALITY、反向代理行为和高级 XMUX/download 设置视为彼此独立的兼容性维度。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Immediate EOF / disconnect"
msgstr "立即 EOF / 断开"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Verify proxy user identity first."
msgstr "先检查代理用户身份。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Check transport security (TLS/REALITY)."
msgstr "检查传输安全（TLS/REALITY）。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Verify `path` on both ends."
msgstr "检查两端的 `path`。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Check `mode` compatibility."
msgstr "检查 `mode` 兼容性。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Remove custom headers and XMUX tuning."
msgstr "移除自定义 headers 和 XMUX 调优。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Works directly but not through Nginx/CDN"
msgstr "直连正常但经过 Nginx/CDN 后失败"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Check path rewriting."
msgstr "检查 path 重写。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Verify Host and SNI routing."
msgstr "检查 Host 与 SNI 路由。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Increase/inspect upstream and idle timeouts."
msgstr "调整并检查上游与空闲超时。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Check request buffering/body-size limits."
msgstr "检查请求缓冲/请求体大小限制。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Confirm HTTP/2 or HTTP/3 support on every hop."
msgstr "确认链路每一跳都支持所需的 HTTP/2 或 HTTP/3。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Handshake works but throughput is poor"
msgstr "握手正常但吞吐较差"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Return XMUX/tuning to defaults."
msgstr "把 XMUX/调优参数恢复为默认值。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Compare direct and reverse-proxied paths."
msgstr "对比直连与反向代理路径。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Measure RTT/loss to the actual CDN edge or server."
msgstr "测量到实际 CDN 边缘节点或服务端的 RTT/丢包。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Check connection churn and upstream limits."
msgstr "检查连接频繁重建以及上游限制。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Tune only after identifying whether the bottleneck is transport, server, or provider policy."
msgstr "只有在确认瓶颈来自传输层、服务端还是服务提供方策略之后，再进行调优。"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Xray XHTTP transport page: <https://xtls.github.io/en/config/transports/xhttp.html>"
msgstr "Xray XHTTP 传输页面：<https://xtls.github.io/en/config/transports/xhttp.html>"

#: src\protocols/xhttp.md
msgid "Xray current XHTTP configuration implementation: <https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/main/infra/conf/transport_method.go>"
msgstr "Xray 当前 XHTTP 配置实现：<https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/main/infra/conf/transport_method.go>"

#: src\SUMMARY.md src\open-questions.md
msgid "Open Questions"
msgstr "待确认问题"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "This page tracks documentation and implementation gaps that need explicit follow-up before the wiki can be treated as a complete project reference."
msgstr "本页记录文档和实现中仍需明确跟进的缺口。在这些问题得到处理之前，本 Wiki 不应被视为完整的项目参考资料。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Project Scope"
msgstr "项目范围"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Add a dedicated `AChimera` page or remove it from the introduction until its role is defined."
msgstr "为 `AChimera` 增加独立页面；如果其定位尚未明确，则暂时从 Introduction 中移除。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Clarify which repository is the source of truth for each component: `Chimera_Client`, `Chimera`, `Chimera_Server`, and Android-related work."
msgstr "明确 `Chimera_Client`、`Chimera`、`Chimera_Server` 以及 Android 相关工作的各自权威仓库。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Add a compatibility matrix for supported operating systems, core binaries, and protocol combinations."
msgstr "增加受支持操作系统、核心二进制文件和协议组合的兼容性矩阵。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Document the exact differences between child-process mode and service mode."
msgstr "记录子进程模式与服务模式之间的准确差异。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Record which runtime settings require a core restart and which can be hot-reloaded."
msgstr "记录哪些运行时设置需要重启核心，哪些可以热重载。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Document failure handling for core download, core startup, profile update, and runtime configuration validation."
msgstr "记录核心下载、核心启动、配置更新以及运行时配置验证失败时的处理方式。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Confirm whether `patch_clash_config` is still unused or should be implemented."
msgstr "确认 `patch_clash_config` 是否仍未使用，或者是否应该正式实现。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Runtime Configuration"
msgstr "运行时配置"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Define the intended behavior of profile chain scripts. The current notes show the chain-processing hook as a placeholder."
msgstr "明确配置链脚本的预期行为。当前说明中，链式处理钩子仍只是占位实现。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Decide how multiple profiles should be merged beyond appending `proxies`."
msgstr "明确多个配置文件除了追加 `proxies` 之外还应如何合并。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Document how generated Clash-compatible YAML differs across `mihomo`, `clash-rs`, and `chimera-client`."
msgstr "记录为 `mihomo`、`clash-rs` 和 `chimera-client` 生成的 Clash 兼容 YAML 之间有哪些差异。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Add a feature matrix for inbound listeners, DNS modes, TUN behavior, rule types, and platform-specific limitations."
msgstr "增加入站监听器、DNS 模式、TUN 行为、规则类型以及平台特有限制的功能矩阵。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Document migration differences from Clash/Mihomo behavior where compatibility is intentionally incomplete."
msgstr "对于有意未完全兼容 Clash/Mihomo 的行为，记录迁移时需要注意的差异。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Split the current capability map into implemented, partial, and planned sections."
msgstr "把当前能力地图拆分为已实现、部分实现和计划实现三个部分。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Add tested configuration examples for each advertised inbound protocol."
msgstr "为每个已声明支持的入站协议增加经过测试的配置示例。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Document how closely each inbound follows xray-core behavior, including known deviations."
msgstr "记录每种入站实现与 xray-core 行为的一致程度，包括已知差异。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Add source references for protocol wire-format claims."
msgstr "为协议报文格式相关结论补充来源引用。"

#: src\open-questions.md
msgid "Add interoperability notes for common client/server combinations."
