#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Stage"
msgstr "阶段"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "TCP command"
msgstr "TCP 命令"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Destination port"
msgstr "目标端口"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Layer-by-Layer Exchange"
msgstr "逐层交互过程"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The easiest way to understand Trojan is to separate the ordinary network layers from the Trojan control message itself:"
msgstr "理解 Trojan 最直接的方法，是把普通网络层与 Trojan 自身的控制消息分开来看："

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "This sequence is important when reading a packet capture. Before TLS is decrypted, a passive capture shows the TCP and TLS handshakes but not the Trojan password digest, destination address, command, or proxied application data. Those fields are TLS application data."
msgstr "这个顺序对分析抓包非常重要。在 TLS 未解密时，被动抓包只能看到 TCP 与 TLS 握手，看不到 Trojan 的密码摘要、目标地址、命令或被代理的应用数据；这些字段都属于 TLS Application Data。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Initial Trojan Request Wire Format"
msgstr "Trojan 初始请求线格式"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "After TLS has been established, the client sends one logical request:"
msgstr "TLS 建立后，客户端发送一个逻辑上的完整请求："

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The first field is 56 ASCII hexadecimal characters because SHA-224 produces 28 bytes and hexadecimal encoding uses two characters per byte. It is followed by the two bytes `0x0d 0x0a`."
msgstr "第一个字段固定为 56 个 ASCII 十六进制字符，因为 SHA-224 输出 28 字节，而十六进制编码每字节需要两个字符；其后紧跟两个字节 `0x0d 0x0a`。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The Trojan request itself is:"
msgstr "Trojan Request 本身的格式为："

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Unlike a SOCKS5 request, there is no leading `VER` byte and no reserved `RSV` byte. Authentication is also not negotiated with a method-selection exchange; it has already been supplied as the password hash immediately before the request."
msgstr "与 SOCKS5 请求不同，Trojan 没有前置 `VER` 字节，也没有保留的 `RSV` 字节；认证也不通过方法协商完成，而是在请求之前直接提供密码哈希。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The baseline Trojan protocol defines:"
msgstr "基础 Trojan 协议定义了："

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Command"
msgstr "命令"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Open a TCP connection to the destination."
msgstr "向目标建立 TCP 连接。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Enter Trojan's framed UDP relay mode."
msgstr "进入 Trojan 的分帧 UDP 转发模式。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "There is no Trojan equivalent of SOCKS5 `BIND` in the baseline protocol."
msgstr "基础 Trojan 协议没有与 SOCKS5 `BIND` 对应的命令。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "`ATYP` and Destination Encoding"
msgstr "`ATYP` 与目标地址编码"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Trojan deliberately reuses the SOCKS5 address-type values:"
msgstr "Trojan 有意复用了 SOCKS5 的地址类型取值："

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Encoding"
msgstr "编码方式"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Exactly 4 address bytes."
msgstr "固定 4 个地址字节。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "One length byte, followed by that many domain-name bytes."
msgstr "先是 1 字节长度，随后是对应数量的域名字节。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Exactly 16 address bytes."
msgstr "固定 16 个地址字节。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "`DST.PORT` is two bytes in network byte order, the same convention used by SOCKS5."
msgstr "`DST.PORT` 固定为 2 字节网络字节序，与 SOCKS5 使用相同约定。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "For example, a domain target conceptually becomes:"
msgstr "例如，一个域名目标在逻辑上会编码为："

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "```text\n03                     ATYP = DOMAIN\n0b                     domain length = 11\n65 78 61 6d 70 6c 65   \"example\"\n2e 63 6f 6d            \".com\"\n01 bb                  port 443\n```"
msgstr "```text\n03                     ATYP = DOMAIN\n0b                     域名长度 = 11\n65 78 61 6d 70 6c 65   \"example\"\n2e 63 6f 6d            \".com\"\n01 bb                  端口 443\n```"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The example is shown as logical bytes only; on the wire these bytes are inside TLS application records."
msgstr "上例只展示逻辑字节；实际在线路上传输时，这些字节位于 TLS Application Data 记录内部。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Authentication: Trojan versus SOCKS5"
msgstr "认证：Trojan 与 SOCKS5 对比"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "SOCKS5 separates method negotiation, optional authentication, and proxy command selection. Trojan collapses those phases behind TLS:"
msgstr "SOCKS5 将认证方法协商、可选认证和代理命令选择拆成不同阶段；Trojan 则把这些阶段压缩到 TLS 之后："

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The consequences are significant:"
msgstr "这会带来几个重要差异："

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Trojan has no authentication-method negotiation byte sequence."
msgstr "Trojan 不存在认证方法协商的字节序列。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Trojan has no username/password sub-negotiation equivalent to RFC 1929."
msgstr "Trojan 没有与 RFC 1929 等价的用户名/密码子协商阶段。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Trojan authentication is protected by TLS before it is transmitted."
msgstr "Trojan 的认证数据在发送前已经受到 TLS 保护。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The destination request can be coalesced with initial application payload."
msgstr "目标请求可以与首段应用层负载合并发送。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The baseline protocol does not define a SOCKS5-style `REP` response frame for a successful `CONNECT`."
msgstr "基础协议没有为成功的 `CONNECT` 定义类似 SOCKS5 `REP` 的响应帧。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The last point changes the client state machine: after sending a valid Trojan request, the client normally proceeds by observing the resulting relay behavior rather than waiting for a fixed `VER/REP/ATYP/BND.ADDR/BND.PORT` success frame."
msgstr "最后一点会直接改变客户端状态机：发送有效 Trojan 请求后，客户端通常根据后续转发行为继续，而不是等待固定的 `VER/REP/ATYP/BND.ADDR/BND.PORT` 成功帧。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "TCP `CONNECT` State Machine"
msgstr "TCP `CONNECT` 状态机"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "A useful client-side state machine is:"
msgstr "客户端可以建模为如下状态机："

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The server side can be modeled as:"
msgstr "服务端可以建模为："

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "A robust implementation must not assume that one TLS read returns the complete 56-byte digest, both CRLF delimiters, the full variable-length address, and the first payload. TLS records and the underlying TCP stream may split or coalesce those bytes arbitrarily."
msgstr "健壮的实现不能假设一次 TLS read 就会返回完整的 56 字节摘要、两个 CRLF 分隔符、完整变长地址和首段负载。TLS Record 与底层 TCP 流都可能任意拆分或合并这些字节。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "First Payload and Read-Ahead"
msgstr "首段负载与预读"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Trojan allows application payload to immediately follow the second CRLF. This reduces an avoidable application-level round trip:"
msgstr "Trojan 允许应用层负载紧跟第二个 CRLF，从而减少一个可以避免的应用层往返："

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "A server parser therefore has an important boundary condition: bytes already read beyond the end of the Trojan header are not parser garbage. They are the first bytes destined for the requested upstream connection and must be retained and forwarded in order."
msgstr "因此服务端解析器有一个重要边界条件：如果一次读取已经越过 Trojan 头部末尾，那些多读出来的字节不是解析垃圾，而是应发往目标上游的第一段数据，必须保留并按顺序转发。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "This is analogous to the boundary after a successful SOCKS5 `CONNECT`, except SOCKS5 normally has an explicit server reply before ordinary application data begins."
msgstr "这与 SOCKS5 成功 `CONNECT` 后的边界概念类似，只是 SOCKS5 通常会先发送一个明确的服务端响应，然后才进入普通应用数据阶段。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "Trojan UDP Framing"
msgstr "Trojan UDP 分帧"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "For `CMD = 0x03`, the TLS connection becomes a stream carrying a sequence of framed UDP datagrams:"
msgstr "当 `CMD = 0x03` 时，TLS 连接会变成承载一系列带边界 UDP 数据报帧的字节流："

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "`Length` is an unsigned two-byte payload length in network byte order. The address fields identify the destination associated with that individual UDP datagram."
msgstr "`Length` 是一个无符号 2 字节网络字节序负载长度；地址字段标识该单个 UDP 数据报的目标。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "The receiver must therefore parse the stream as repeated length-delimited messages:"
msgstr "因此接收端必须把字节流解析成连续的、由长度字段定界的消息："

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "TCP/TLS does not preserve UDP packet boundaries. The `Length` field is what reconstructs each datagram boundary."
msgstr "TCP/TLS 不保留 UDP 数据报边界，真正用于重建每个数据报边界的是 `Length` 字段。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "UDP Fragmentation Difference from SOCKS5"
msgstr "与 SOCKS5 的 UDP 分片差异"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "SOCKS5's UDP request header includes `RSV` and a `FRAG` byte. Trojan's baseline UDP framing does **not** carry the SOCKS5 `FRAG` field; instead it adds a 2-byte payload length plus CRLF because multiple datagrams are serialized into one reliable TLS byte stream."
msgstr "SOCKS5 的 UDP 请求头包含 `RSV` 和 `FRAG` 字节；基础 Trojan UDP 帧**没有** SOCKS5 的 `FRAG` 字段，而是增加 2 字节负载长度和 CRLF，因为多个数据报被串行化到同一个可靠 TLS 字节流中。"

#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "That gives a useful design comparison:"
msgstr "由此可以得到一个很有价值的设计对比："

