#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "This table is the baseline for comparing later protocols. Hysteria 2 and TUIC retain the general ideas of authentication, destination metadata, TCP-like streams, and UDP associations, but replace the SOCKS/Trojan TCP stream substrate with QUIC streams and datagrams. VLESS similarly keeps destination dispatch as a separate proxy-protocol concern while REALITY and XHTTP occupy different layers."
msgstr "这张表将作为后续协议比较的基线。Hysteria 2 与 TUIC 保留了认证、目标元数据、类 TCP 流和 UDP association 等总体概念，但用 QUIC Stream 与 Datagram 取代 SOCKS/Trojan 的 TCP 流基底。VLESS 同样保留目标分发这一代理协议职责，而 REALITY 与 XHTTP 则位于不同层。"

