#: src\protocols/trojan.md
msgid "With TLS key logging in a controlled development environment, the decrypted logical sequence should line up with the request format above. Such key logging must be treated as sensitive because it defeats the confidentiality being tested."
msgstr "在受控开发环境中，如果启用 TLS key log，解密后的逻辑字节序列应与上面的请求格式一致。此类密钥日志必须按敏感信息处理，因为它会直接绕过正在验证的机密性。"

