msgstr "`CONNECT` 成功后，状态机会从**控制协议阶段**切换到**透明字节转发阶段**："

#: src\protocols/socks5.md
msgid "The SOCKS server does not parse HTTP, TLS, SSH, or application protocols after this transition."
msgstr "完成这一转换后，SOCKS 服务端不会继续解析 HTTP、TLS、SSH 或其他应用层协议。"

