msgstr "HTTP 非 2xx 状态，通常还带头部/响应体"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "Post-success data"
msgstr "成功后的数据"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "Raw TCP byte stream"
msgstr "裸 TCP 字节流"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "Tunnel bytes after response headers / stream response"
msgstr "响应头结束后的隧道字节 / stream response"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "General UDP relay"
msgstr "通用 UDP 转发"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "`UDP ASSOCIATE` is standardized"
msgstr "`UDP ASSOCIATE` 已标准化"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "Basic CONNECT does not provide SOCKS-style UDP relay"
msgstr "基础 CONNECT 不提供 SOCKS 风格 UDP relay"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "Control encoding"
msgstr "控制编码"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "Compact binary"
msgstr "紧凑二进制"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "HTTP semantics; HTTP/1.1 is textual, HTTP/2/3 framed"
msgstr "HTTP 语义；HTTP/1.1 为文本格式，HTTP/2/3 为分帧格式"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "The most important conceptual correspondence is:"
msgstr "最重要的概念对应关系是："

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "The important differences are authentication timing and representation. SOCKS5 negotiates an authentication method before its proxy command. HTTP authentication is integrated into HTTP request/response semantics and can require replaying the CONNECT request after a challenge."
msgstr "关键差异在于认证时机与表示方式。SOCKS5 在代理命令之前协商认证方法；HTTP 认证则整合进 HTTP 请求/响应语义，收到 challenge 后可能需要重新发送 CONNECT。"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "Edge Cases and Security Boundaries"
msgstr "边界情况与安全边界"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "A proxy must validate the CONNECT target before dialing it. RFC 9110 warns specifically about unrestricted tunneling to arbitrary services; allowing destinations such as SMTP ports can turn a web proxy into an abuse relay."
msgstr "代理在拨号前必须校验 CONNECT 目标。RFC 9110 特别警告不要允许任意服务的无限制隧道；例如允许连接 SMTP 端口可能把 Web 代理变成滥用中继。"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "An empty or invalid CONNECT port is invalid. Policy should also restrict destination ports where appropriate."
msgstr "CONNECT 端口为空或无效时，请求本身无效；策略也应在适当场景限制目标端口。"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "Do not parse tunneled bytes as another HTTP request merely because they arrive on the same client connection after a successful CONNECT. The connection has changed semantic state."
msgstr "不要仅因为隧道字节仍从同一客户端连接到达，就把它们解析成另一个 HTTP 请求。CONNECT 成功后，连接语义状态已经改变。"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "Preserve bytes that arrive immediately after the CONNECT header boundary. Implementations that over-read while parsing must pass those bytes into the tunnel rather than discard them."
msgstr "必须保留紧跟 CONNECT 头部边界到达的字节。解析过程中发生 over-read 的实现，应把这些字节送入隧道，而不是丢弃。"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "Handle TCP half-close deliberately. When one side closes its sending direction, already-received bytes still need a chance to drain to the peer."
msgstr "应显式处理 TCP half-close。当一端关闭发送方向时，已经接收的数据仍应有机会完整排空到另一端。"

#: src\protocols/http.md
msgid "Authentication headers are hop-specific. `Proxy-Authorization` authenticates to the relevant proxy, not to the final origin server."
msgstr "认证头是逐跳（hop-specific）的。`Proxy-Authorization` 用于向当前代理认证，而不是向最终源站认证。"

#: src\protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`0x00` � no authentication."
msgstr "`0x00` —— 无需认证。"

#: src\protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`0x02` � username/password authentication defined by RFC 1929."
msgstr "`0x02` —— RFC 1929 定义的用户名/密码认证。"

#: src\protocols/socks5.md
msgid "`0xff` � no acceptable method."
msgstr "`0xff` —— 没有双方都接受的认证方法。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Common Command Wire Format"
msgstr "通用命令线格式"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC v5 uses one common envelope for all application commands. All fixed-width multi-byte fields are encoded in big-endian order unless the specification says otherwise:"
msgstr "TUIC v5 为所有应用层命令使用统一封装。除非规范另有说明，所有定长多字节字段都使用大端序编码："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`VER` is `0x05` for the current protocol version. `TYPE` selects the command:"
msgstr "当前协议版本的 `VER` 为 `0x05`，`TYPE` 用来选择命令类型："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Authenticate the multiplexed connection"
msgstr "认证整个多路复用连接"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Start one TCP relay task"
msgstr "启动一个 TCP 中继任务"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Carry one UDP packet or fragment"
msgstr "承载一个 UDP 数据包或其分片"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Destroy one UDP association"
msgstr "销毁一个 UDP association"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Keep the QUIC connection active"
msgstr "保持 QUIC 连接活跃"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`OPT` is not a TLV block with its own generic length. Its layout is determined entirely by `TYPE`, so a parser must know the command type before it can know how many bytes belong to the command header."
msgstr "`OPT` 不是一个带通用长度字段的 TLV 区块；它的布局完全由 `TYPE` 决定，因此解析器必须先知道命令类型，才能确定命令头还需要读取多少字节。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "This differs from SOCKS5 in an important way. SOCKS5 has several distinct message layouts (`METHOD`, authentication sub-negotiation, request, reply, UDP header), while TUIC starts each application command with the same two-byte `VER | TYPE` discriminator and then switches to a command-specific structure."
msgstr "这与 SOCKS5 有一个重要区别：SOCKS5 拥有多种彼此独立的消息布局（`METHOD`、认证子协商、request、reply、UDP header），而 TUIC 的每个应用命令都先以统一的两字节 `VER | TYPE` 判别头开始，再切换到对应命令自己的结构。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Exact `Authenticate` Frame"
msgstr "精确的 `Authenticate` 帧"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The `Authenticate` command-specific data is fixed length:"
msgstr "`Authenticate` 命令的专用数据是固定长度："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Including the common command bytes, the logical command is therefore:"
msgstr "把通用命令头也算进去后，逻辑上的完整命令为："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The client opens a QUIC unidirectional stream and sends this command. The UUID is the client's 128-bit identity. The 256-bit token is derived from the current TLS session using the TLS exporter interface, with the client UUID as the exporter label and the raw password as exporter context."
msgstr "客户端打开一个 QUIC 单向流并发送该命令。UUID 是客户端的 128 位身份标识；256 位 TOKEN 通过当前 TLS 会话的 TLS exporter 接口派生，其中客户端 UUID 作为 exporter label，原始密码作为 exporter context。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The important property is session binding: knowledge of a previously observed token is not equivalent to knowledge of the raw password because a newly established TLS session produces a new exporter context. TLS 1.3 keeps the exporter interface while deriving exporter values through its HKDF-based key schedule."
msgstr "关键属性是会话绑定：知道之前观察到的 TOKEN 并不等价于知道原始密码，因为新建立的 TLS 会话会产生新的 exporter 上下文。TLS 1.3 保留了 exporter 接口，但 exporter 值通过其基于 HKDF 的密钥调度派生。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "There is no TUIC application-level `AUTH OK` frame. Successful authentication changes server-side connection state. Authentication failure is handled by the implementation, commonly by ignoring work or closing the connection."
msgstr "TUIC 没有应用层的 `AUTH OK` 帧。认证成功只是改变服务端连接状态；认证失败如何处理由实现决定，常见方式包括忽略任务或关闭连接。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Authentication State Machine"
msgstr "认证状态机"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC explicitly permits authentication and relay setup to overlap. A server that sees `Connect` or `Packet` before `Authenticate` should accept enough of the task to pause it, but should not process the relay until authentication has completed."
msgstr "TUIC 明确允许认证与中继任务建立过程重叠。服务端若在 `Authenticate` 之前先看到 `Connect` 或 `Packet`，应读取足够的任务头并暂停处理，但在认证完成前不能真正执行中继。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Address Encoding"
msgstr "地址编码"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC uses a SOCKS-like variable-length address structure, but its type values are different from RFC 1928:"
msgstr "TUIC 使用一种与 SOCKS 类似的变长地址结构，但地址类型取值与 RFC 1928 不同："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "No address; used by later UDP fragments"
msgstr "无地址；用于后续 UDP 分片"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Domain/FQDN"
msgstr "域名/FQDN"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "1-byte length followed by domain bytes"
msgstr "1 字节长度，后跟域名字节"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`PORT` is a 16-bit big-endian integer."
msgstr "`PORT` 是一个 16 位大端序整数。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "For example, `example.com:443` is conceptually:"
msgstr "例如，`example.com:443` 在概念上的编码如下："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "SOCKS5 uses almost the same structural idea but different ATYP values:"
msgstr "SOCKS5 使用几乎相同的结构思想，但 ATYP 取值不同："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The TUIC-only `0xff None` value exists because a fragmented UDP packet does not need to repeat the target address in every fragment."
msgstr "TUIC 特有的 `0xff None` 用于 UDP 分片场景，因为同一个 UDP 数据包的后续分片不需要重复携带目标地址。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Exact `Connect` Command"
msgstr "精确的 `Connect` 命令"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The command-specific part of `Connect` contains only the encoded target address:"
msgstr "`Connect` 的命令专用部分只包含编码后的目标地址："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "On a QUIC bidirectional stream the byte sequence is therefore logically:"
msgstr "因此，在 QUIC 双向流中，逻辑字节序列为："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "There is no TUIC equivalent of SOCKS5's explicit success reply:"
msgstr "TUIC 没有与 SOCKS5 显式成功响应对应的帧："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The TUIC server opens the requested TCP connection after parsing the `Connect` header. The client is allowed to send application payload immediately after the header without waiting for target-dial completion. A server implementation must therefore be prepared to buffer or naturally backpressure that QUIC stream while the outbound TCP dial is pending."
msgstr "TUIC 服务端解析 `Connect` 头后才去建立目标 TCP 连接。客户端允许在命令头之后立即发送应用数据，而无需等待目标拨号完成，因此服务端在出站 TCP 仍处于连接阶段时，必须能够缓存这些数据，或通过 QUIC 流的自然背压限制发送。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "If the target cannot be reached, TUIC v5 defines no universal error reply. An implementation may reset/close the QUIC bidirectional stream, close the whole QUIC connection, or otherwise apply implementation-defined behavior."
msgstr "如果目标不可达，TUIC v5 没有定义统一错误响应。实现可以 reset/关闭该 QUIC 双向流、关闭整个 QUIC 连接，或者采用其他实现自定义行为。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TCP Relay State Machine"
msgstr "TCP 中继状态机"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Each proxied TCP flow gets its own QUIC bidirectional stream. Loss affecting one stream does not force the application data of unrelated TUIC streams into one single ordered byte sequence, although all streams still share the QUIC connection's congestion-control and path state."
msgstr "每个被代理的 TCP 流都拥有独立的 QUIC 双向流。某一个流上的丢包不会把其他无关 TUIC 流的应用数据强行串入同一个全局有序字节序列，但所有流仍共享同一 QUIC 连接的拥塞控制和路径状态。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Exact `Packet` Header"
msgstr "精确的 `Packet` 头"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A TUIC UDP packet or fragment uses:"
msgstr "TUIC 的 UDP 数据包或分片使用以下格式："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Prepending the common command header gives:"
msgstr "在前面加上通用命令头后得到："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Fields mean:"
msgstr "各字段含义如下："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`ASSOC_ID`: 16-bit UDP association identifier generated by the client."
msgstr "`ASSOC_ID`：由客户端生成的 16 位 UDP association 标识。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`PKT_ID`: 16-bit identifier shared by all fragments of one original UDP datagram."
msgstr "`PKT_ID`：同一个原始 UDP 数据报的所有分片共享的 16 位标识。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`FRAG_TOTAL`: number of fragments in that original UDP datagram."
msgstr "`FRAG_TOTAL`：该原始 UDP 数据报的分片总数。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`FRAG_ID`: index identifying this fragment."
msgstr "`FRAG_ID`：当前分片的索引。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`SIZE`: byte length of this fragment's UDP payload."
msgstr "`SIZE`：当前分片 UDP payload 的字节长度。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`ADDR`: destination address for client-to-server traffic, or source address for server-to-client traffic."
msgstr "`ADDR`：客户端到服务端方向表示目标地址；服务端到客户端方向表示源地址。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`PAYLOAD`: exactly `SIZE` bytes belonging to this packet fragment."
msgstr "`PAYLOAD`：恰好 `SIZE` 字节，属于当前数据包分片。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Later fragments can encode `ADDR.TYPE = 0xff` (`None`) rather than repeating the same address. This makes the first fragment important to reassembly metadata."
msgstr "后续分片可以把 `ADDR.TYPE` 编码为 `0xff`（`None`），从而无需重复相同地址。这也意味着首个分片对重组元数据尤其重要。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Association Semantics"
msgstr "Association 语义"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Both peers maintain an association table scoped to one QUIC connection:"
msgstr "通信双方都需要为每条 QUIC 连接维护一张 association 表："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "When the server receives the first `Packet` for a new `ASSOC_ID`, it allocates a UDP socket and stores the mapping. Reusing that association ID causes later client packets to leave through the same server-side UDP socket. That property is what gives the protocol its Full Cone-style UDP behavior in the reference flow."
msgstr "服务端第一次收到某个新 `ASSOC_ID` 的 `Packet` 时，会分配一个 UDP socket 并保存映射。之后继续使用相同 association ID 的客户端数据包，会从同一个服务端 UDP socket 发出；这正是参考流程中 TUIC 实现 Full Cone 风格 UDP 行为的基础。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Unlike SOCKS5, there is no separate `UDP ASSOCIATE` request/reply transaction before the first UDP payload. The first TUIC `Packet` can implicitly create the association."
msgstr "与 SOCKS5 不同，TUIC 不要求在第一个 UDP payload 之前先完成独立的 `UDP ASSOCIATE` 请求/响应事务；首个 TUIC `Packet` 本身就可以隐式创建 association。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Native vs Reliable UDP Modes"
msgstr "Native 与可靠 UDP 模式"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC defines two carriage choices for `Packet` commands:"
msgstr "TUIC 为 `Packet` 命令定义了两种承载方式："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The server uses the same mode for return traffic that the client used for the first packet of that association."
msgstr "服务端对返回流量使用与该 association 首个客户端数据包相同的模式。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "This is a major difference from Hysteria 2. Hysteria 2's UDP data path is specified around QUIC DATAGRAM, whereas TUIC explicitly permits either a reliable QUIC stream or an unreliable QUIC datagram for UDP packet carriage. QUIC DATAGRAM frames themselves are not retransmitted by QUIC."
msgstr "这是 TUIC 与 Hysteria 2 的重要差异。Hysteria 2 的 UDP 数据路径围绕 QUIC DATAGRAM 定义，而 TUIC 明确允许 UDP 数据包既可以使用可靠 QUIC stream，也可以使用不可靠 QUIC datagram。QUIC DATAGRAM 帧本身不会由 QUIC 重传。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Fragmentation and Reassembly"
msgstr "分片与重组"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "If one UDP datagram is too large for the chosen transport unit, TUIC can split it into several `Packet` commands. Every fragment of one original datagram uses the same `PKT_ID`; `FRAG_TOTAL` and `FRAG_ID` identify the reassembly set and position."
msgstr "如果一个 UDP 数据报超过所选承载单元允许的大小，TUIC 可以把它拆成多个 `Packet` 命令。同一原始数据报的所有分片使用相同 `PKT_ID`，而 `FRAG_TOTAL` 与 `FRAG_ID` 用来标识重组集合和分片位置。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A receiver needs reassembly state conceptually keyed by at least:"
msgstr "接收端至少需要按以下维度维护重组状态："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "and should enforce bounds for:"
msgstr "并且应对以下资源设置上限："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "maximum fragment count,"
msgstr "最大分片数量，"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "maximum aggregate packet size,"
msgstr "重组后的最大数据包大小，"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "duplicate fragment handling,"
msgstr "重复分片处理，"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "reassembly timeout,"
msgstr "重组超时，"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "number of simultaneously incomplete packets."
msgstr "同时处于未完成状态的数据包数量。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Those limits are important because the base specification defines the wire fields but does not define a universal resource-management policy."
msgstr "这些限制很重要，因为基础规范只定义了线上的字段，并没有规定统一的资源管理策略。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The close command for a UDP association is compact:"
msgstr "用于关闭 UDP association 的命令非常紧凑："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The client sends it on a QUIC unidirectional stream. The server removes that association from its table and releases the corresponding UDP socket."
msgstr "客户端通过 QUIC 单向流发送该命令；服务端随后从 association 表中删除对应记录，并释放关联的 UDP socket。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "This is more explicit than Hysteria 2, whose protocol does not provide an explicit UDP-session close message, and structurally different from SOCKS5, where the UDP association lifetime is tied to the accompanying TCP control connection."
msgstr "这比 Hysteria 2 更显式：Hysteria 2 没有协议层的 UDP 会话关闭消息；同时它也不同于 SOCKS5，后者的 UDP association 生命周期绑定在配套 TCP 控制连接上。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The logical heartbeat is simply:"
msgstr "逻辑上的 Heartbeat 很简单："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "with no command-specific body. In the reference QUIC flow it is periodically sent through a QUIC DATAGRAM while relay tasks are active."
msgstr "它没有命令专用 body。在参考 QUIC 流程中，只要仍有中继任务存在，客户端就会周期性通过 QUIC DATAGRAM 发送该命令。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Error and Close Semantics"
msgstr "错误与关闭语义"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC v5 deliberately does not define a response for every command. The specification states that invalid commands, authentication failure, and target connection errors have implementation-defined handling."
msgstr "TUIC v5 有意没有为每种命令定义响应。规范明确指出，无效命令、认证失败和目标连接错误的处理方式由实现自行决定。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "That has several consequences for client implementations:"
msgstr "这会给客户端实现带来几个直接后果："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Absence of a reply is normal for `Authenticate`, `Connect`, `Packet`, `Dissociate`, and `Heartbeat`; a client must not wait for a SOCKS-style success frame that will never arrive."
msgstr "对 `Authenticate`、`Connect`、`Packet`、`Dissociate` 和 `Heartbeat` 来说，没有响应是正常现象；客户端不能等待一个永远不会出现的 SOCKS 风格成功帧。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A reset/close of one bidirectional stream can be used by an implementation to signal failure of one TCP relay without necessarily closing the whole QUIC connection."
msgstr "实现可以通过 reset/关闭某一个双向流来表示单个 TCP 中继失败，而不必关闭整个 QUIC 连接。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Authentication failure can cause connection close or silent rejection, depending on the implementation."
msgstr "认证失败可能导致连接关闭，也可能被静默拒绝，具体取决于实现。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "UDP `Packet` commands do not have per-packet acknowledgements at the TUIC layer. Reliable-stream mode relies on QUIC stream reliability; native mode deliberately accepts datagram loss."
msgstr "TUIC 层不会为 UDP `Packet` 提供逐包确认。可靠 stream 模式依赖 QUIC stream 的可靠性；native 模式则有意接受数据报丢失。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`Dissociate` is advisory protocol state transition rather than a request that receives a standardized acknowledgement."
msgstr "`Dissociate` 表示协议状态迁移，而不是一个会收到标准化确认响应的请求。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A robust implementation therefore needs to distinguish QUIC transport errors, stream reset, application timeout, UDP loss, and explicit association teardown rather than mapping every failure to one generic \"proxy rejected\" error."
msgstr "因此，一个健壮实现必须区分 QUIC 传输错误、stream reset、应用超时、UDP 丢包和显式 association teardown，而不能把所有失败都粗暴映射为统一的“proxy rejected”。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Without QUIC session keys, a normal packet capture sees approximately:"
msgstr "在没有 QUIC 会话密钥时，普通抓包大致只能看到："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The TUIC command bytes are encrypted inside QUIC application data. With QUIC keys available to a dissector, the mapping becomes easier to reason about:"
msgstr "TUIC 命令字节被加密在 QUIC 应用数据中。如果分析器能够获得 QUIC 密钥，就可以更清楚地建立协议映射："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A QUIC STREAM frame boundary is not a TUIC command boundary. Stream data can be split across QUIC frames or delivered from multiple frames to one application read. Parsers must accumulate exactly the fixed and variable fields required by the command before treating subsequent bytes as payload."
msgstr "QUIC STREAM 帧边界并不是 TUIC 命令边界。流数据可以被拆到多个 QUIC frame 中，也可能由多个 frame 合并成一次应用层读取。解析器必须先完整累积命令所需的定长和变长字段，才能把后续字节视为 payload。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "For `Connect`, parser read-ahead is especially important: bytes obtained in the same read after the variable-length `ADDR` are already proxied application data and must not be discarded as command padding."
msgstr "对 `Connect` 来说，parser read-ahead 尤其重要：在同一次读取中、位于变长 `ADDR` 之后的字节已经属于被代理的应用数据，不能被当作命令 padding 丢弃。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "Client and Server Connection State"
msgstr "客户端与服务端连接状态"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "A useful implementation-oriented connection state machine is:"
msgstr "一个面向实现的连接状态机可以表示为："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The server additionally needs per-stream and per-association state, because one QUIC connection can contain many simultaneous TCP tasks and UDP associations."
msgstr "服务端还需要维护逐 stream 和逐 association 状态，因为一条 QUIC 连接里可能同时存在多个 TCP 任务和多个 UDP association。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "SOCKS5 vs Hysteria 2 vs TUIC"
msgstr "SOCKS5、Hysteria 2 与 TUIC 对比"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The three protocols expose similar proxy concepts through very different wire models:"
msgstr "这三种协议表达的是相似的代理概念，但采用了非常不同的线格式模型："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "What TUIC Reuses from the SOCKS5 Mental Model"
msgstr "TUIC 从 SOCKS5 思维模型中复用了什么"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "The same basic proxy operations are still present:"
msgstr "最基本的代理操作仍然存在："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC also retains the familiar variable-length `address type + address + port` idea. This makes its `Connect` target structurally closer to SOCKS5 than Hysteria 2's textual `host:port` field."
msgstr "TUIC 还保留了熟悉的变长 `address type + address + port` 思路，因此它的 `Connect` 目标在结构上比 Hysteria 2 的文本 `host:port` 字段更接近 SOCKS5。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "What TUIC Replaces"
msgstr "TUIC 替换了什么"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC replaces several SOCKS5 control transactions:"
msgstr "TUIC 替换了 SOCKS5 中的若干控制事务："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "METHOD negotiation becomes connection-bound TLS-exporter authentication."
msgstr "METHOD 协商被替换为与连接绑定的 TLS-exporter 认证。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "SOCKS5 `CONNECT request -> REP success` becomes a one-way `Connect` header followed immediately by payload."
msgstr "SOCKS5 的 `CONNECT request -> REP success` 被替换为单向 `Connect` 头，后面可以立即跟 payload。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "`UDP ASSOCIATE request -> relay endpoint reply` becomes an implicitly created `ASSOC_ID` mapping."
msgstr "`UDP ASSOCIATE request -> relay endpoint reply` 被替换为隐式创建的 `ASSOC_ID` 映射。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "one TCP control connection no longer represents one proxy task; QUIC streams multiplex many tasks inside one secure connection."
msgstr "一条 TCP 控制连接不再代表一个代理任务；QUIC streams 会在一条安全连接中多路复用多个任务。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "What TUIC Adds"
msgstr "TUIC 新增了什么"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TUIC adds concepts with no direct SOCKS5 equivalent:"
msgstr "TUIC 新增了许多 SOCKS5 中没有直接对应物的概念："

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "TLS-exporter-bound authentication token,"
msgstr "与 TLS exporter 绑定的认证 token，"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "QUIC stream multiplexing,"
msgstr "QUIC stream 多路复用，"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "QUIC connection migration and shared connection-level congestion state,"
msgstr "QUIC 连接迁移以及共享的连接级拥塞状态，"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "selectable reliable/unreliable UDP carriage,"
msgstr "可选择可靠或不可靠的 UDP 承载方式，"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "explicit UDP association IDs,"
msgstr "显式 UDP association ID，"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "packet IDs and protocol-level UDP fragmentation,"
msgstr "packet ID 与协议级 UDP 分片，"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "application heartbeat over QUIC DATAGRAM,"
msgstr "通过 QUIC DATAGRAM 承载的应用层 heartbeat，"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "possible overlap between authentication and relay-task creation."
msgstr "认证与中继任务创建可以重叠。"

#: src\protocols/tuic.md
msgid "These are the main reasons TUIC should be understood as a complete secure, multiplexed proxy transport rather than simply \"SOCKS5 over QUIC\"."
msgstr "正因为这些新增机制，TUIC 更应该被理解为一套完整的、安全的、多路复用代理传输协议，而不是简单的“SOCKS5 over QUIC”。"

msgid "UDP transport"
msgstr "UDP 传输"

msgid "Stage / concept"
msgstr "阶段 / 概念"

msgid "User identity"
msgstr "用户身份"

msgid "The byte-level framing below follows the current Xray-core `main` VLESS encoder/decoder. Because VLESS is an implementation-defined Xray protocol rather than an IETF standard, verify these details again when targeting a materially different core version."
msgstr "下面的字节级格式依据当前 Xray-core `main` 分支中的 VLESS 编码器/解码器。VLESS 是由 Xray 实现定义的协议，而不是 IETF 标准，因此面向差异较大的 core 版本时应重新核对这些细节。"

msgid "Baseline Wire Format"
msgstr "基础线格式"

msgid "Request header"
msgstr "请求头"

msgid "For a normal TCP or UDP request, current Xray-core serializes the VLESS request header in this order:"
msgstr "对于普通 TCP 或 UDP 请求，当前 Xray-core 按以下顺序序列化 VLESS 请求头："

msgid "The important point is that **VLESS writes the destination port before the address**, unlike SOCKS5 and Trojan, which put the address before the port."
msgstr "需要特别注意：**VLESS 先写目标端口，再写地址**；这与 SOCKS5 和 Trojan 先地址、后端口的顺序不同。"

msgid "Current Xray-core uses request version `0x00`. The next 16 bytes are the binary user ID. A UUID string such as:"
msgstr "当前 Xray-core 使用请求版本 `0x00`。之后的 16 字节是二进制用户 ID。例如以下 UUID 字符串："

msgid "is therefore not sent as 36 ASCII characters; the corresponding 128-bit value is sent as 16 raw bytes."
msgstr "在线路上不会以 36 个 ASCII 字符发送，而是把对应的 128 位值作为 16 个原始字节发送。"

msgid "Addons field"
msgstr "Addons 字段"

msgid "Immediately after the user ID comes one byte containing the length of the serialized VLESS addons block:"
msgstr "用户 ID 之后紧接一个字节，用于表示序列化后的 VLESS addons 块长度："

msgid "For the ordinary no-flow case, `AddonsLength` is `0x00` and no addon bytes follow. For supported flow modes such as `xtls-rprx-vision`, current Xray-core serializes the addons structure as protobuf and prefixes it with a single-byte length."
msgstr "普通的无 flow 情况下，`AddonsLength` 为 `0x00`，后面没有 addon 数据。对于 `xtls-rprx-vision` 等受支持的 flow，当前 Xray-core 会把 addons 结构序列化为 protobuf，并在前面放一个单字节长度。"

msgid "This is not analogous to SOCKS5 METHOD negotiation. The addons field is part of the already-selected VLESS request format and carries optional VLESS/Xray behavior for that request."
msgstr "这与 SOCKS5 的 METHOD 协商不同。addons 字段属于已经确定的 VLESS 请求格式，用于携带该请求可选的 VLESS/Xray 行为。"

msgid "Command byte"
msgstr "命令字节"

msgid "Current Xray-core defines these request command values:"
msgstr "当前 Xray-core 定义了以下请求命令值："

msgid "Transfer model"
msgstr "传输模型"

msgid "stream"
msgstr "流"

msgid "packet"
msgstr "数据包"

msgid "Mux"
msgstr "Mux"

msgid "Reverse (`Rvs`)"
msgstr "反向（`Rvs`）"

msgid "For TCP and UDP, a destination address follows the command. `Mux` and `Rvs` are special internal stream commands; the encoder does not append an ordinary network destination for those commands."
msgstr "TCP 和 UDP 命令之后会跟目标地址。`Mux` 和 `Rvs` 是特殊的内部流命令；编码器不会为这两个命令附加普通网络目标地址。"

msgid "Destination address encoding"
msgstr "目标地址编码"

msgid "For ordinary TCP/UDP requests, the on-wire order is:"
msgstr "普通 TCP/UDP 请求在线路上的顺序为："

msgid "`Port` is a 16-bit network-order integer. Current Xray address-family values are:"
msgstr "`Port` 是 16 位网络字节序整数。当前 Xray 的地址族取值为："

msgid "The address body is:"
msgstr "地址主体格式为："

msgid "A domain is therefore length-prefixed in the same general style as SOCKS5, but VLESS uses a different type value for domains (`0x02` versus SOCKS5 `0x03`) and places the two-byte port before `ATYP`."
msgstr "因此域名同样采用类似 SOCKS5 的长度前缀形式，但 VLESS 的域名类型值不同（`0x02`，而 SOCKS5 为 `0x03`），并且把两字节端口放在 `ATYP` 前面。"

msgid "Example request header"
msgstr "请求头示例"

msgid "Ignoring transport security and using no addons, a TCP request to `example.com:443` has the logical layout:"
msgstr "忽略传输安全层且不使用 addons 时，到 `example.com:443` 的 TCP 请求逻辑布局如下："

msgid "Read as:"
msgstr "可解读为："

msgid "```text\n00        Version 0\nUUID      16-byte identity\n00        zero-length addons\n01        TCP command\n01 bb     port 443, big endian\n02        domain address type\n0b        domain length 11\n...       \"example.com\"\n```"
msgstr "```text\n00        版本 0\nUUID      16 字节身份 ID\n00        addons 长度为 0\n01        TCP 命令\n01 bb     端口 443，大端序\n02        域名地址类型\n0b        域名长度 11\n...       \"example.com\"\n```"

msgid "Application bytes can follow the header on the same underlying byte stream. A server parser must therefore stop exactly at the end of the address and retain any already-read application bytes."
msgstr "应用数据可以在同一底层字节流中紧跟请求头。因此服务端解析器必须准确停在地址字段末尾，并保留任何已经提前读取到的应用数据。"

msgid "Server-Side Request Parsing State Machine"
msgstr "服务端请求解析状态机"

msgid "A minimal inbound parser can be modeled as:"
msgstr "最小入站解析器可以建模为："

msgid "An invalid request version, unknown user ID, malformed addons block, unsupported command, invalid address type, truncated port, or truncated address must abort normal VLESS request processing. Whether the outer connection is simply closed, reset, or handled by another transport/fallback path depends on the surrounding Xray transport and security configuration."
msgstr "请求版本无效、用户 ID 未知、addons 块损坏、命令不受支持、地址类型无效、端口不完整或地址不完整，都必须终止正常的 VLESS 请求处理。外层连接究竟直接关闭、重置，还是交给其他传输/fallback 路径处理，取决于外围的 Xray 传输和安全配置。"

msgid "The parser must use exact-length reads for fixed-size fields. TCP, TLS, XHTTP, and other stream transports do not preserve VLESS header boundaries."
msgstr "解析器对固定长度字段必须执行精确长度读取。TCP、TLS、XHTTP 等流式传输都不会保留 VLESS 请求头边界。"

msgid "Response Header"
msgstr "响应头"

msgid "VLESS has a small server-to-client response header before downlink application data. Current Xray-core writes:"
msgstr "VLESS 在下行应用数据之前有一个很小的服务端到客户端响应头。当前 Xray-core 写入："

msgid "The response version must equal the request version. In the common no-addon case, the response begins:"
msgstr "响应版本必须与请求版本一致。在常见的无 addon 情况下，响应开头为："

msgid "This is an important difference from SOCKS5. SOCKS5 returns a `REP` status plus `BND.ADDR/BND.PORT`; baseline VLESS does **not** return an equivalent fixed per-destination status code or bound-address tuple in this response header."
msgstr "这是 VLESS 与 SOCKS5 的重要差异。SOCKS5 会返回 `REP` 状态以及 `BND.ADDR/BND.PORT`；基础 VLESS 的响应头中**没有**等价的固定目标状态码或绑定地址元组。"

msgid "Consequently, a VLESS implementation normally learns about many destination or transport failures through stream termination/reset and implementation error handling rather than by parsing a SOCKS5-style `REP` byte."
msgstr "因此，VLESS 实现通常通过流终止/重置以及实现自身的错误处理来获知很多目标或传输失败，而不是解析 SOCKS5 风格的 `REP` 字节。"

msgid "TCP Data Path"
msgstr "TCP 数据路径"

msgid "For `Command=0x01`, once the server has accepted the request and dispatched the destination, the remaining body is a byte stream:"
msgstr "对于 `Command=0x01`，服务端接受请求并分发目标后，剩余 body 就是字节流："

msgid "There is no per-record VLESS framing for ordinary TCP payload in the no-flow case. The outer transport may of course add its own framing: TLS records, XHTTP requests, WebSocket frames, HTTP/2 frames, and so on are separate layers."
msgstr "无 flow 的普通 TCP payload 没有逐记录 VLESS framing。外层传输当然可能增加自己的 framing，例如 TLS record、XHTTP request、WebSocket frame、HTTP/2 frame 等，但它们属于不同层。"

msgid "This separation is useful when debugging. A packet boundary from the outer transport is not a VLESS application-message boundary."
msgstr "调试时必须保持这种分层意识：外层传输的数据包边界并不是 VLESS 应用消息边界。"

msgid "UDP Body Framing"
msgstr "UDP Body 分帧"

msgid "Current Xray-core handles `Command=0x02` differently from TCP. Each UDP packet is serialized onto the VLESS body stream as:"
msgstr "当前 Xray-core 对 `Command=0x02` 的处理不同于 TCP。每个 UDP 数据包都会按以下格式序列化到 VLESS body 流中："

msgid "The two-byte length is big endian. The destination is supplied by the VLESS request header; ordinary packets in that VLESS request therefore do not repeat `ATYP + address + port` for every datagram."
msgstr "两字节长度采用大端序。目标地址已经由 VLESS 请求头提供，因此同一 VLESS 请求中的普通 UDP 数据包不需要为每个 datagram 重复 `ATYP + address + port`。"

msgid "This design is markedly different from SOCKS5 UDP relay:"
msgstr "这种设计与 SOCKS5 UDP relay 有明显区别："

msgid "SOCKS5 sends each datagram over a real UDP socket and repeats the destination in every SOCKS UDP header."
msgstr "SOCKS5 通过真实 UDP socket 发送每个 datagram，并在每个 SOCKS UDP header 中重复目标地址。"

msgid "VLESS can carry UDP packet semantics over a stream transport by restoring packet boundaries with a two-byte length."
msgstr "VLESS 可以在流式传输上用两字节长度重新建立数据包边界，从而承载 UDP packet 语义。"

msgid "Baseline VLESS body framing has no SOCKS5 `FRAG` byte. Fragmentation, MTU, or packetization behavior introduced by the outer transport is a separate concern."
msgstr "基础 VLESS body framing 没有 SOCKS5 的 `FRAG` 字节。由外层传输引入的分片、MTU 或 packetization 行为属于另一层问题。"

msgid "A receiver must first read exactly two bytes, decode the length, and then read exactly that many payload bytes. Treating a single socket read as one UDP packet will fail as soon as the underlying stream splits or combines writes."
msgstr "接收端必须先精确读取两个字节并解码长度，然后再精确读取指定数量的 payload 字节。如果把一次 socket read 当作一个 UDP packet，只要底层流发生拆分或合并写入就会出错。"

msgid "Multiplexing Boundaries"
msgstr "多路复用边界"

msgid "A normal VLESS TCP request represents one logical destination stream. VLESS itself does not magically make every `Command=TCP` request multiplexed just because the outer connection is HTTP/2, XHTTP, or another multiplex-capable transport."
msgstr "普通 VLESS TCP 请求表示一个逻辑目标流。即使外层连接使用 HTTP/2、XHTTP 或其他支持多路复用的传输，VLESS 本身也不会自动让每个 `Command=TCP` 请求都变成多路复用。"

msgid "There are two distinct places where multiplexing may appear:"
msgstr "多路复用可能出现在两个不同位置："

msgid "the VLESS `Mux` command / Xray multiplexing layer; and"
msgstr "VLESS `Mux` 命令 / Xray 多路复用层；以及"

msgid "the outer transport, which may itself provide multiple logical streams or request flows."
msgstr "外层传输，它自身可能提供多个逻辑流或请求流。"

msgid "Do not collapse these into one concept in implementation documentation. The SOCKS5 baseline has neither feature: one SOCKS5 TCP control connection becomes one CONNECT relay stream."
msgstr "实现文档中不要把这两者混成一个概念。标准 SOCKS5 两者都没有：一个 SOCKS5 TCP 控制连接最终对应一个 CONNECT relay stream。"

msgid "Connection Close and Error Semantics"
msgstr "连接关闭与错误语义"

msgid "For baseline TCP relay, end-of-stream propagates through the selected outer transport. Implementations need to distinguish:"
msgstr "基础 TCP relay 中，流结束会通过所选外层传输传播。实现需要区分："

msgid "clean EOF after valid response/data,"
msgstr "有效响应/数据之后的正常 EOF；"

msgid "transport reset,"
msgstr "传输层 reset；"

msgid "invalid VLESS request before dispatch,"
msgstr "分发前的无效 VLESS 请求；"

msgid "destination connection failure,"
msgstr "目标连接失败；"

msgid "timeout / idle expiration,"
msgstr "超时 / 空闲过期；"

msgid "and outer TLS/REALITY/XHTTP failure before VLESS can even be parsed."
msgstr "以及在 VLESS 甚至尚未开始解析前发生的外层 TLS/REALITY/XHTTP 失败。"

msgid "Unlike SOCKS5, VLESS does not provide a fixed reply-code taxonomy equivalent to `REP=connection refused`, `network unreachable`, or `address type unsupported`. Logs and the transport's close/reset semantics therefore carry more diagnostic weight."
msgstr "与 SOCKS5 不同，VLESS 没有提供等价于 `REP=connection refused`、`network unreachable` 或 `address type unsupported` 的固定回复码分类。因此日志以及传输层 close/reset 语义在诊断中更重要。"

msgid "For UDP-over-stream, a truncated two-byte length or EOF before the declared payload length is a malformed/incomplete packet, not a shorter valid datagram."
msgstr "对于 UDP-over-stream，两字节长度字段不完整，或在声明的 payload 长度读取完成前遇到 EOF，都表示畸形/不完整数据包，而不是一个更短但有效的 datagram。"

msgid "VLESS over TLS/RAW"
msgstr "TLS/RAW 上的 VLESS"

msgid "Without decryption, a capture typically exposes only the outer layers:"
msgstr "无法解密时，抓包通常只能看到外层："

msgid "With TLS keys or instrumentation below TLS, the first decrypted application bytes can be interpreted as the VLESS request header described above."
msgstr "如果有 TLS 密钥，或能在 TLS 下方进行 instrumentation，那么解密后的首批应用字节就可以按上文的 VLESS 请求头解释。"

msgid "VLESS over REALITY"
msgstr "REALITY 上的 VLESS"

msgid "The capture first looks like the REALITY/TLS-facing handshake. VLESS fields are inside the accepted secure session and are not visible as clear-text UUID, command, or address fields on the network."
msgstr "抓包首先看到的是 REALITY/TLS-facing 握手。VLESS 字段位于已接受的安全会话内部，网络上看不到明文 UUID、命令或地址字段。"

msgid "VLESS over XHTTP"
msgstr "XHTTP 上的 VLESS"

msgid "The packet capture sees HTTP-layer requests/responses or HTTP/2/HTTP/3 transport frames first. VLESS is payload carried _inside_ those XHTTP flows. Therefore:"
msgstr "抓包首先看到 HTTP 层请求/响应或 HTTP/2、HTTP/3 传输帧。VLESS 是承载在这些 XHTTP 流程_内部_的 payload。因此："

msgid "This layer ordering is essential when deciding where a failure occurred."
msgstr "判断故障发生在哪一层时，这种分层顺序至关重要。"

msgid "VLESS Compared with SOCKS5"
msgstr "VLESS 与 SOCKS5 对比"

msgid "VLESS baseline"
msgstr "基础 VLESS"

