msgstr "基础格式无等价项"

msgid "TCP body"
msgstr "TCP body"

msgid "raw byte stream"
msgstr "原始字节流"

msgid "raw body in ordinary no-flow mode"
msgstr "普通无 flow 模式下为原始 body"

msgid "separate UDP relay endpoint"
msgstr "独立 UDP relay endpoint"

msgid "length-framed packets over selected VLESS body transport"
msgstr "在所选 VLESS body 传输上使用长度分帧的数据包"

msgid "Destination repeated per UDP packet"
msgstr "每个 UDP 数据包是否重复目标地址"

msgid "no, destination is in request header"
msgstr "否，目标地址位于请求头"

msgid "SOCKS UDP `FRAG` equivalent"
msgstr "SOCKS UDP `FRAG` 等价项"

msgid "`FRAG` byte"
msgstr "`FRAG` 字节"

msgid "no baseline equivalent in VLESS body framing"
msgstr "VLESS 基础 body framing 中没有等价项"

msgid "not part of SOCKS5"
msgstr "不属于 SOCKS5"

msgid "optional Xray/VLESS and/or transport layers"
msgstr "可选 Xray/VLESS 和/或传输层"

msgid "The conceptual inheritance is still recognizable: authenticate/identify the client, express a command, encode a destination, then relay traffic. VLESS compresses those control phases into one request header and delegates security, multiplexing, and camouflage to surrounding Xray layers."
msgstr "概念上的继承关系仍然很清晰：认证/识别客户端、表达命令、编码目标地址，然后转发流量。VLESS 把这些控制阶段压缩进一个请求头，并把安全、多路复用和伪装交给外围 Xray 层。"

msgid "Implementation Checklist"
msgstr "实现检查清单"

msgid "A low-level VLESS implementation should verify at least these points:"
msgstr "底层 VLESS 实现至少应验证以下事项："

msgid "Read exactly one version byte and reject unsupported versions."
msgstr "精确读取一个版本字节，并拒绝不受支持的版本。"

msgid "Read exactly 16 user-ID bytes before looking up the user."
msgstr "先精确读取 16 个用户 ID 字节，再查询用户。"

msgid "Bound and completely read the one-byte-length addons block."
msgstr "对单字节长度指定的 addons 块设置边界并完整读取。"

msgid "Validate the command before interpreting destination fields."
msgstr "解释目标字段之前先验证命令。"

msgid "For TCP/UDP, read the two-byte port before the address type."
msgstr "TCP/UDP 请求中先读取两字节端口，再读取地址类型。"

msgid "For domains, enforce the one-byte length and read the complete domain."
msgstr "域名必须遵守单字节长度限制，并完整读取整个域名。"

msgid "Preserve bytes read beyond the end of the header as application payload."
msgstr "保留超出请求头末尾而提前读取到的字节，作为应用 payload。"

msgid "Emit and consume the VLESS response header before treating downlink bytes as target payload."
msgstr "在把下行字节视为目标 payload 之前，先发送并消费 VLESS 响应头。"

msgid "For UDP, reconstruct packet boundaries from the two-byte length prefix."
msgstr "UDP 必须依据两字节长度前缀重建数据包边界。"

msgid "Apply strict limits/timeouts so partial headers and declared UDP lengths cannot retain resources indefinitely."
msgstr "应用严格的限制和超时，避免不完整请求头或声明的 UDP 长度无限期占用资源。"

msgid "Keep outer transport errors distinct from VLESS request-validation errors."
msgstr "区分外层传输错误与 VLESS 请求校验错误。"

msgid "Test each transport/security combination independently; a correct VLESS parser does not imply XHTTP or REALITY interoperability."
msgstr "分别测试每一种传输/安全组合；VLESS 解析器正确并不意味着 XHTTP 或 REALITY 一定互通。"

msgid "HTTP/2 CONNECT: one tunnel per HTTP/2 stream"
msgstr "HTTP/2 CONNECT：每个 HTTP/2 Stream 承载一条隧道"

msgid "CONNECT is an HTTP semantic, not an HTTP/1.1 text-format feature. HTTP/2 keeps the proxy connection as an ordinary multiplexed HTTP/2 connection and converts only the request stream into a tunnel. This is a fundamental difference from HTTP/1.1 CONNECT, where the entire client-to-proxy TCP connection changes into tunnel mode."
msgstr "CONNECT 是 HTTP 语义，而不是 HTTP/1.1 文本格式独有的特性。HTTP/2 会让代理连接继续保持为普通的多路复用 HTTP/2 连接，只把对应的请求 Stream 转换为隧道。这与 HTTP/1.1 CONNECT 有根本区别：后者会把客户端到代理之间的整条 TCP 连接切换为隧道模式。"

msgid "The request header section has these required pseudo-header semantics:"
msgstr "请求头部段必须遵循以下伪头字段语义："

msgid "The header block is HPACK-compressed inside a `HEADERS` frame, so those strings are semantic fields rather than a fixed byte prefix. A simplified HTTP/2 frame header is:"
msgstr "头部块会经过 HPACK 压缩并放入 `HEADERS` 帧，因此这些字符串是语义字段，而不是固定字节前缀。简化后的 HTTP/2 帧头如下："

msgid "For the CONNECT request, `Type=0x01` denotes `HEADERS`. On success, the proxy returns response `HEADERS` carrying a `:status` in the 2xx range. After the initial request and response header sections, tunnel octets are carried in HTTP/2 `DATA` frames (`Type=0x00`) on that same stream:"
msgstr "对 CONNECT 请求而言，`Type=0x01` 表示 `HEADERS`。成功时，代理返回携带 2xx `:status` 的响应 `HEADERS`。初始请求和响应头部段结束后，隧道字节由同一 Stream 上的 HTTP/2 `DATA` 帧（`Type=0x00`）承载："

msgid "Multiple CONNECT tunnels can therefore coexist on one HTTP/2 connection. Their `DATA` frames can be interleaved, but the Stream Identifier keeps tunnel bytes separate. This multiplexing is an extra transport layer that standard SOCKS5 does not define."
msgstr "因此，一条 HTTP/2 连接上可以同时存在多条 CONNECT 隧道。不同隧道的 `DATA` 帧可以交错发送，但 Stream Identifier 会保持各隧道字节彼此隔离。这种多路复用属于标准 SOCKS5 未定义的额外传输层能力。"

msgid "HTTP/2 `DATA` is subject to both connection-level and stream-level HTTP/2 flow control. A CONNECT tunnel can therefore stop making progress even when its upstream TCP socket is writable if the peer has not supplied enough `WINDOW_UPDATE` credit. Conversely, one blocked stream does not require the other CONNECT streams to stop, provided connection-level credit remains."
msgstr "HTTP/2 `DATA` 同时受连接级和 Stream 级 HTTP/2 流控约束。因此，即使上游 TCP socket 仍可写，只要对端没有提供足够的 `WINDOW_UPDATE` 额度，某条 CONNECT 隧道也可能停止推进。反过来，只要连接级额度仍然充足，一条被阻塞的 Stream 并不要求其他 CONNECT Stream 一起停止。"

msgid "After CONNECT succeeds, ordinary tunnel bytes are not additional HTTP messages. RFC 9113 permits `DATA` plus stream-management frames on the connected stream; a protocol implementation must not try to parse a TLS `ClientHello` inside a `DATA` payload as another HTTP request."
msgstr "CONNECT 成功后，普通隧道字节不再是新的 HTTP 消息。RFC 9113 允许已建立隧道的 Stream 上出现 `DATA` 和 Stream 管理帧；协议实现不能把 `DATA` payload 中的 TLS `ClientHello` 再当成另一个 HTTP 请求解析。"

msgid "HTTP/2 half-close and reset mapping"
msgstr "HTTP/2 半关闭与 Reset 映射"

msgid "HTTP/2 maps the lifetime of the tunneled TCP connection onto the CONNECT stream:"
msgstr "HTTP/2 会把被隧道化 TCP 连接的生命周期映射到 CONNECT Stream："

msgid "`END_STREAM` in the client-to-proxy direction corresponds to TCP FIN toward the destination after any accompanying DATA bytes are forwarded;"
msgstr "客户端到代理方向的 `END_STREAM` 表示：先转发随帧携带的 DATA 字节，再向目标连接发送 TCP FIN；"

msgid "a destination TCP FIN causes the proxy to finish its sending direction with `END_STREAM`;"
msgstr "目标端发送 TCP FIN 时，代理会以 `END_STREAM` 结束自身向客户端的发送方向；"

msgid "a TCP reset or other TCP connection error is represented as `RST_STREAM` with `CONNECT_ERROR`;"
msgstr "TCP Reset 或其他 TCP 连接错误会表示为带 `CONNECT_ERROR` 的 `RST_STREAM`；"

msgid "a stream error detected by the proxy requires the corresponding target TCP connection to be aborted rather than silently reused."
msgstr "代理检测到 Stream 错误时，需要中止对应的目标 TCP 连接，而不能静默复用该连接。"

msgid "This is more precise than saying that a tunnel simply \"closes\" when one side finishes. HTTP/2, like TCP, can represent a half-closed direction, and the other direction can still contain bytes that need to drain."
msgstr "这比简单地说“一侧结束后隧道就关闭”更准确。HTTP/2 与 TCP 一样可以表示单方向半关闭，而另一个方向仍可能存在需要继续排空的字节。"

msgid "HTTP/3 CONNECT: the same semantics over a QUIC request stream"
msgstr "HTTP/3 CONNECT：在 QUIC 请求 Stream 上承载相同语义"

msgid "HTTP/3 retains the same CONNECT pseudo-header rules but maps each request onto a client-initiated bidirectional QUIC stream. The request begins with HTTP/3 `HEADERS`, the proxy responds with `HEADERS` containing a 2xx `:status`, and subsequent HTTP/3 `DATA` frames on that request stream carry the TCP tunnel. The request stream deliberately remains open after the request header section."
msgstr "HTTP/3 保留相同的 CONNECT 伪头字段规则，但会把每个请求映射到客户端发起的双向 QUIC Stream。请求以 HTTP/3 `HEADERS` 开始，代理用包含 2xx `:status` 的 `HEADERS` 响应，随后该请求 Stream 上的 HTTP/3 `DATA` 帧用于承载 TCP 隧道。请求头部段结束后，这条请求 Stream 会有意保持打开。"

msgid "At the HTTP/3 framing layer, both frame type and frame length are QUIC variable-length integers:"
msgstr "在 HTTP/3 分帧层，帧类型和帧长度都使用 QUIC 可变长度整数："

msgid "The HTTP/3 `HEADERS` payload is QPACK-encoded, so a passive capture cannot treat `:method=CONNECT` or `:authority` as literal wire strings. After the CONNECT exchange completes, ordinary tunnel octets reside in HTTP/3 DATA payloads, and those HTTP/3 frames themselves are carried as QUIC STREAM data. TCP segment boundaries at the target, HTTP/3 DATA frame boundaries, QUIC STREAM frame boundaries, and UDP packet boundaries are all independent."
msgstr "HTTP/3 `HEADERS` payload 使用 QPACK 编码，因此被动抓包不能把 `:method=CONNECT` 或 `:authority` 当成线路上的明文字面字符串。CONNECT 交换完成后，普通隧道字节位于 HTTP/3 DATA payload 中，而这些 HTTP/3 帧本身又作为 QUIC STREAM 数据承载。目标侧 TCP segment 边界、HTTP/3 DATA 帧边界、QUIC STREAM 帧边界以及 UDP 数据包边界彼此独立。"

msgid "HTTP/3 closes a normal tunnel direction using QUIC stream completion. If the client finishes its sending direction, the proxy maps that completion to a TCP FIN toward the target. A TCP reset or abnormal target close is represented as a stream error with `H3_CONNECT_ERROR (0x010f)`. Resetting or aborting one request stream does not inherently close unrelated CONNECT streams, but a QUIC connection-level failure destroys every tunnel multiplexed on that connection."
msgstr "HTTP/3 通过 QUIC Stream 的方向完成来关闭普通隧道的一个方向。客户端结束发送方向时，代理会把该完成状态映射为发往目标端的 TCP FIN。TCP Reset 或目标异常关闭会表示为 `H3_CONNECT_ERROR (0x010f)` Stream 错误。Reset 或中止一条请求 Stream 本身不会关闭无关的 CONNECT Stream，但 QUIC 连接级故障会终止复用在该连接上的所有隧道。"

msgid "HTTP/3 flow control is provided by QUIC rather than HTTP/2 `WINDOW_UPDATE` frames. The CONNECT request stream consumes QUIC stream and connection flow-control credit, and all CONNECT streams on the connection also share the QUIC congestion controller and path capacity. Thus \"many tunnels on one connection\" does not mean each tunnel has independent physical bandwidth."
msgstr "HTTP/3 的流控由 QUIC 提供，而不是使用 HTTP/2 `WINDOW_UPDATE` 帧。CONNECT 请求 Stream 会消耗 QUIC Stream 级与连接级流控额度，并且同一连接上的所有 CONNECT Stream 还共享 QUIC 拥塞控制器和链路容量。因此，“一条连接上有很多隧道”并不意味着每条隧道都有独立的物理带宽。"

msgid "Ordinary CONNECT versus Extended CONNECT"
msgstr "普通 CONNECT 与 Extended CONNECT"

msgid "Do not confuse basic proxy CONNECT with **Extended CONNECT**. RFC 8441 adds the `:protocol` pseudo-header after explicit capability negotiation for uses such as bootstrapping WebSocket over HTTP/2. Extended CONNECT changes the request shape: it can include `:protocol` and, in that mode, `:scheme` and `:path` are present. A normal forward proxy tunnel to `example.com:443` uses the ordinary CONNECT form described above and does not need `:protocol`."
msgstr "不要把基础代理 CONNECT 与 **Extended CONNECT** 混淆。RFC 8441 在显式能力协商之后加入 `:protocol` 伪头字段，可用于在 HTTP/2 上引导 WebSocket 等协议。Extended CONNECT 会改变请求形态：它可以包含 `:protocol`，并且在该模式下会同时出现 `:scheme` 和 `:path`。普通正向代理到 `example.com:443` 的隧道使用前述普通 CONNECT 形式，不需要 `:protocol`。"

msgid "This distinction is particularly useful when reading captures or XHTTP-related documentation: seeing CONNECT on an HTTP/2 or HTTP/3 stream does not by itself mean that the stream is a classic forward-proxy TCP tunnel."
msgstr "在阅读抓包或 XHTTP 相关文档时，这一区分尤其重要：在 HTTP/2 或 HTTP/3 Stream 上看到 CONNECT，并不自动意味着该 Stream 就是经典正向代理 TCP 隧道。"

msgid "Version-specific packet-capture anchors"
msgstr "各 HTTP 版本的抓包锚点"

msgid "The useful capture anchors differ by HTTP version:"
msgstr "不同 HTTP 版本可用的抓包锚点并不相同："

msgid "```text\nHTTP/1.1 clear text\n  TCP -> \"CONNECT host:port HTTP/1.1\\r\\n\" -> 2xx -> opaque tunnel bytes\n\nHTTP/2\n  TCP/TLS -> HTTP/2 stream N\n             HEADERS(:method CONNECT, :authority ...)\n             HEADERS(:status 2xx)\n             DATA / DATA / ... / END_STREAM or RST_STREAM\n\nHTTP/3\n  UDP -> QUIC -> request stream N\n                HEADERS(:method CONNECT, :authority ...)\n                HEADERS(:status 2xx)\n                DATA / DATA / ... / QUIC FIN or stream reset\n```"
msgstr "```text\nHTTP/1.1 明文\n  TCP -> \"CONNECT host:port HTTP/1.1\\r\\n\" -> 2xx -> 不透明隧道字节\n\nHTTP/2\n  TCP/TLS -> HTTP/2 stream N\n             HEADERS(:method CONNECT, :authority ...)\n             HEADERS(:status 2xx)\n             DATA / DATA / ... / END_STREAM 或 RST_STREAM\n\nHTTP/3\n  UDP -> QUIC -> request stream N\n                HEADERS(:method CONNECT, :authority ...)\n                HEADERS(:status 2xx)\n                DATA / DATA / ... / QUIC FIN 或 stream reset\n```"

msgid "Without the TLS/QUIC decryption material, encrypted HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 captures usually expose transport behavior rather than the target authority or tunnel contents. With decryption, a dissector should follow the request stream and its header compression context instead of searching raw packets for the ASCII word `CONNECT`."
msgstr "如果没有 TLS/QUIC 解密材料，加密 HTTP/2 与 HTTP/3 抓包通常只能暴露传输行为，而看不到目标 authority 或隧道内容。完成解密后，协议分析器应跟踪对应请求 Stream 及其头部压缩上下文，而不是在原始数据包里搜索 ASCII 字符串 `CONNECT`。"

msgid "TCP control connection"
msgstr "TCP 控制连接"

msgid "HTTP/1.1 over TCP; HTTP/2 commonly over TCP/TLS; HTTP/3 over QUIC/UDP"
msgstr "HTTP/1.1 基于 TCP；HTTP/2 通常基于 TCP/TLS；HTTP/3 基于 QUIC/UDP"

msgid "No equivalent mandatory proxy-method phase; HTTP version/transport negotiation belongs to the HTTP stack"
msgstr "没有等价的强制代理方法协商阶段；HTTP 版本/传输协商属于 HTTP 协议栈"

msgid "Textual authority `host:port` at the HTTP semantic layer"
msgstr "HTTP 语义层的文本 authority `host:port`"

msgid "Decimal port inside authority text; explicit port required for CONNECT"
msgstr "authority 文本中的十进制端口；CONNECT 要求显式端口"

msgid "HTTP non-2xx before tunnel creation; H2/H3 can additionally signal stream-level CONNECT errors after creation"
msgstr "建立隧道前以 HTTP 非 2xx 表示失败；H2/H3 建立后还可以发送 Stream 级 CONNECT 错误"

msgid "Raw TCP byte stream on the SOCKS connection"
msgstr "SOCKS 连接上的原始 TCP 字节流"

msgid "HTTP/1.1: raw bytes; H2/H3: tunnel octets inside DATA frames on one request stream"
msgstr "HTTP/1.1：原始字节；H2/H3：单条请求 Stream 的 DATA 帧内承载隧道字节"

msgid "Not defined by RFC 1928; normally one CONNECT per TCP control connection"
msgstr "RFC 1928 未定义多路复用；通常每条 TCP 控制连接对应一个 CONNECT"

msgid "H2/H3 can carry many independent CONNECT streams on one HTTP connection"
msgstr "H2/H3 可以在一条 HTTP 连接上承载多条独立 CONNECT Stream"

msgid "TCP receive window of that SOCKS connection"
msgstr "该 SOCKS 连接的 TCP 接收窗口"

msgid "H1 inherits TCP; H2 adds connection/stream HTTP flow control; H3 uses QUIC connection/stream flow control"
msgstr "H1 继承 TCP 流控；H2 增加 HTTP 连接/Stream 流控；H3 使用 QUIC 连接/Stream 流控"

msgid "Half-close"
msgstr "半关闭"

msgid "Inherited from the SOCKS TCP connection after reply"
msgstr "成功回复后继承 SOCKS TCP 连接的半关闭语义"

msgid "H1 inherits TCP; H2 maps FIN to `END_STREAM`; H3 maps direction completion to QUIC stream FIN"
msgstr "H1 继承 TCP；H2 将 FIN 映射为 `END_STREAM`；H3 将方向完成映射为 QUIC Stream FIN"

msgid "HTTP semantics; HTTP/1.1 text, H2 HPACK/framing, H3 QPACK/framing over QUIC"
msgstr "HTTP 语义；HTTP/1.1 使用文本，H2 使用 HPACK/分帧，H3 在 QUIC 上使用 QPACK/分帧"

msgid "RFC 9112, HTTP/1.1: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9112>"
msgstr "RFC 9112，HTTP/1.1：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9112>"

msgid "RFC 9113, HTTP/2: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9113>"
msgstr "RFC 9113，HTTP/2：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9113>"

msgid "RFC 9114, HTTP/3: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9114>"
msgstr "RFC 9114，HTTP/3：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9114>"

msgid "RFC 8441, Bootstrapping WebSockets with HTTP/2: <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8441>"
msgstr "RFC 8441，通过 HTTP/2 引导 WebSocket：<https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8441>"

msgid "SOCKS `REP`"
msgstr "SOCKS `REP`"

msgid "a server-side X25519 private key,"
msgstr "服务端 X25519 私钥；"

msgid "the corresponding client-side X25519 public value, called `password` in current Xray configuration (`publicKey` is the older field name),"
msgstr "对应的客户端 X25519 公共值；当前 Xray 配置中称为 `password`（旧字段名为 `publicKey`）；"

msgid "Current Xray can additionally configure an ML-DSA-65 signing key on the server and verification key on the client. This is an optional extra certificate verification layer; it does not replace the base REALITY X25519 key relation or the ClientHello authentication described below."
msgstr "当前 Xray 还可以在服务端配置 ML-DSA-65 签名密钥、在客户端配置验证密钥。这属于可选的额外证书验证层，并不会替代基础 REALITY X25519 密钥关系，也不会替代下文所述的 ClientHello 认证。"

msgid "Handshake Internals and On-Wire Authentication"
msgstr "握手内部机制与线级认证"

msgid "REALITY deliberately keeps its authentication inside a TLS-looking ClientHello instead of adding a SOCKS-like method negotiation or a VLESS-like plaintext identity header before TLS. This means the first bytes visible to a passive observer are ordinary TLS record/handshake bytes; the REALITY-specific credentials are embedded into fields of the generated ClientHello and protected with keys derived for that handshake."
msgstr "REALITY 有意把认证放在看起来像 TLS 的 ClientHello 内部，而不是在 TLS 之前加入 SOCKS 风格的方法协商或 VLESS 风格的明文身份头。因此，被动观察者首先看到的是普通 TLS record/handshake 字节；REALITY 专用凭据被嵌入生成的 ClientHello 字段，并由该次握手派生出的密钥保护。"

msgid "The current Xray-core client constructs a 32-byte ClientHello legacy Session ID. Before protection, the first 16 bytes carry REALITY metadata with this logical layout:"
msgstr "当前 Xray-core 客户端会构造一个 32 字节的 ClientHello legacy Session ID。在保护之前，前 16 字节按以下逻辑布局承载 REALITY 元数据："

msgid "The remaining 16 bytes of the 32-byte Session ID are used by the AEAD result. This is an implementation-level wire detail, not a new TLS extension: REALITY reuses the TLS ClientHello Session ID field so that the outer message still has the shape of a normal TLS handshake."
msgstr "32 字节 Session ID 的后 16 字节由 AEAD 结果占用。这是实现层面的线格式细节，而不是新的 TLS 扩展：REALITY 复用 TLS ClientHello 的 Session ID 字段，使外层消息仍保持普通 TLS 握手的形态。"

msgid "Key derivation"
msgstr "密钥派生"

msgid "The client already has the server REALITY public key. During construction of the TLS 1.3 ClientHello it also owns the private side of its ephemeral key share. Current Xray-core computes an X25519 ECDH result between that ephemeral key and the configured REALITY public key, then expands it with HKDF-SHA256 using:"
msgstr "客户端已经持有服务端 REALITY 公共值。在构造 TLS 1.3 ClientHello 时，它同时持有本次临时 key share 的私有部分。当前 Xray-core 会用该临时密钥与配置的 REALITY 公共值执行 X25519 ECDH，然后按下列参数使用 HKDF-SHA256 扩展："

msgid "```text\nIKM  = ECDH(client ephemeral private key, REALITY server public key)\nsalt = ClientHello.random[0..20]\ninfo = \"REALITY\"\n```"
msgstr "```text\nIKM  = ECDH(客户端临时私钥, REALITY 服务端公共值)\nsalt = ClientHello.random[0..20]\ninfo = \"REALITY\"\n```"

msgid "The resulting authentication key is used with an AEAD cipher. Current code uses the last 12 bytes of the ClientHello random (`random[20..32]`) as the nonce and the serialized ClientHello as associated data while sealing the first 16 bytes of REALITY Session-ID metadata. The protected 32-byte value is then written back into the fixed Session ID location of the ClientHello."
msgstr "得到的认证密钥会交给 AEAD 密码使用。当前代码以 ClientHello random 的后 12 字节（`random[20..32]`）作为 nonce，并把序列化后的 ClientHello 作为 associated data，对 REALITY Session-ID 元数据前 16 字节进行封装。最终得到的受保护 32 字节值会写回 ClientHello 中固定的 Session ID 位置。"

msgid "This explains why REALITY authentication is bound to the concrete TLS handshake: a copied Session ID is not an independently reusable password token. The ClientHello random, ephemeral key share, serialized hello, server key, timestamp, and short ID all participate directly or indirectly in validation."
msgstr "这解释了为什么 REALITY 认证绑定到具体 TLS 握手：复制得到的 Session ID 并不是可独立复用的密码 token。ClientHello random、临时 key share、序列化 hello、服务端密钥、时间戳和 short ID 都直接或间接参与验证。"

msgid "Server-side decision path"
msgstr "服务端判定路径"

msgid "Conceptually the REALITY listener has to make a decision before handing the connection to the proxy protocol:"
msgstr "从概念上看，REALITY listener 必须先完成判定，之后才能把连接交给代理协议："

msgid "`serverNames` and short IDs are therefore authentication/selection inputs at the REALITY layer. A VLESS UUID is checked later, by VLESS, after REALITY has successfully produced the protected transport. Keeping these checks separate is important when diagnosing failures."
msgstr "因此，`serverNames` 与 short ID 是 REALITY 层的认证/选择输入。VLESS UUID 会在 REALITY 成功建立受保护传输之后，再由 VLESS 层检查。诊断故障时必须把这些检查分开看待。"

msgid "Certificate result and client verification state machine"
msgstr "证书结果与客户端验证状态机"

msgid "The protected Session ID authenticates the ClientHello to the REALITY server, but the client also has to authenticate the server-side REALITY result. Current Xray does that through the certificate flight rather than by expecting an ordinary CA-issued certificate for the REALITY endpoint."
msgstr "受保护 Session ID 用于向 REALITY 服务端认证 ClientHello，但客户端也必须验证服务端侧的 REALITY 结果。当前 Xray 通过证书握手阶段完成这一点，而不是要求 REALITY 端点提供普通 CA 签发证书。"

msgid "The client can conceptually reach three certificate outcomes:"
msgstr "客户端在概念上可能得到三种证书结果："

msgid "In the current Xray client implementation, a REALITY temporary certificate is recognized through an Ed25519 public key and an HMAC-SHA512 value derived from the connection's REALITY `AuthKey`. When configured, `mldsa65Verify` adds an ML-DSA-65 verification step tied to the handshake transcript before the client sets its internal `Verified` flag. This certificate is therefore bound to the same handshake-derived authentication material as the protected ClientHello; it is not a reusable conventional server certificate."
msgstr "在当前 Xray 客户端实现中，REALITY 临时证书通过其中的 Ed25519 公钥以及由该连接 REALITY `AuthKey` 派生的 HMAC-SHA512 值来识别。配置 `mldsa65Verify` 后，客户端还会在设置内部 `Verified` 标志之前执行与握手 transcript 绑定的 ML-DSA-65 验证。因此，该证书与受保护 ClientHello 使用同一套握手派生认证材料绑定，并不是可重复使用的传统服务端证书。"

msgid "If the certificate instead validates as the genuine target site's normal X.509 certificate, the TLS certificate itself can be valid while REALITY `Verified=false`. That state means the client reached the target/fallback path (or was redirected there) rather than the authenticated proxy path. Current REALITY documentation describes this as entering the crawler/spider behavior. An invalid certificate that satisfies neither path terminates the handshake."
msgstr "如果证书验证结果反而是目标站点真实的普通 X.509 证书，那么 TLS 证书本身可能有效，但 REALITY 仍然是 `Verified=false`。这表示客户端到达了 target/fallback 路径（或被重定向到那里），而不是进入已认证代理路径。当前 REALITY 文档把该状态描述为进入 crawler/spider 行为。若证书两条验证路径都无法通过，则终止握手。"

msgid "This three-way distinction is useful during packet-level debugging: \"valid TLS certificate\" and \"valid REALITY connection\" are not equivalent states."
msgstr "这种三分状态对抓包级调试很重要：“TLS 证书有效”和“REALITY 连接有效”不是同一个状态。"

msgid "Without TLS key material, a normal capture should look approximately like:"
msgstr "没有 TLS 密钥材料时，普通抓包大致会呈现为："

msgid "A packet capture cannot identify the VLESS UUID or VLESS destination merely by seeing the REALITY ClientHello. Those values are inside the protected transport and belong to the next protocol layer."
msgstr "仅仅看到 REALITY ClientHello，抓包无法识别 VLESS UUID 或 VLESS 目标地址。这些值位于受保护传输内部，属于下一层协议。"

msgid "Do not assume one TCP segment contains one ClientHello. TLS handshake bytes may span TCP segments, and newer fingerprints can produce larger ClientHello messages. A server implementation must parse a byte stream and TLS lengths, not depend on packet boundaries or a single `read()` call."
msgstr "不要假设一个 TCP segment 就包含一个完整 ClientHello。TLS 握手字节可能跨越多个 TCP segment，更新的 fingerprint 也可能生成更大的 ClientHello。服务端实现必须依据字节流与 TLS 长度解析，不能依赖数据包边界或单次 `read()`。"

msgid "REALITY vs SOCKS5: Layer-by-Layer Comparison"
msgstr "REALITY 与 SOCKS5：逐层对比"

msgid "SOCKS5 and REALITY are intentionally different layers. The comparison is useful mainly to show which SOCKS5 responsibilities REALITY does **not** replace:"
msgstr "SOCKS5 与 REALITY 本来就处于不同层。这个对比主要用于说明 REALITY **没有**替代 SOCKS5 的哪些职责："

msgid "Stage / responsibility"
msgstr "阶段 / 职责"

msgid "Usually TCP to Xray/REALITY listener"
msgstr "通常是到 Xray/REALITY listener 的 TCP"

msgid "First protocol message"
msgstr "首个协议消息"

msgid "SOCKS method list"
msgstr "SOCKS 方法列表"

msgid "TLS/uTLS ClientHello"
msgstr "TLS/uTLS ClientHello"

msgid "Authentication placement"
msgstr "认证位置"

msgid "Separate METHOD/auth sub-protocol"
msgstr "独立 METHOD/认证子协议"

msgid "Protected metadata inside TLS-looking ClientHello"
msgstr "TLS 外观 ClientHello 内部的受保护元数据"

msgid "Credential form"
msgstr "凭据形式"

msgid "Method-specific; e.g. username/password"
msgstr "由方法定义，例如用户名/密码"

msgid "Server public/private key relation + short ID + handshake-derived authentication"
msgstr "服务端公私钥关系 + short ID + 握手派生认证"

msgid "Target proxy address"
msgstr "代理目标地址"

msgid "`CMD + ATYP + DST.ADDR + DST.PORT`"
msgstr "`CMD + ATYP + DST.ADDR + DST.PORT`"

msgid "**Not carried by REALITY**; supplied later by VLESS/Trojan/etc."
msgstr "**不由 REALITY 承载**；稍后由 VLESS/Trojan 等协议提供"

msgid "Proxy success reply"
msgstr "代理成功回复"

msgid "No SOCKS-equivalent proxy reply; REALITY establishes/rejects the security layer"
msgstr "没有 SOCKS 等价代理回复；REALITY 只负责建立或拒绝安全层"

msgid "TCP relay framing"
msgstr "TCP 转发分帧"

msgid "Raw stream after `REP=0x00`"
msgstr "`REP=0x00` 后的原始字节流"

msgid "Defined by the underlying proxy/transport after REALITY succeeds"
msgstr "REALITY 成功后由底层代理协议/传输定义"

msgid "RFC 1928 `UDP ASSOCIATE`"
msgstr "RFC 1928 `UDP ASSOCIATE`"

msgid "Not defined by REALITY"
msgstr "REALITY 不定义"

msgid "None in base SOCKS5"
msgstr "基础 SOCKS5 中没有"

msgid "TLS-shaped encrypted transport/security layer"
msgstr "具有 TLS 外形的加密传输/安全层"

msgid "Camouflage/fallback"
msgstr "伪装/fallback"

msgid "Invalid/non-REALITY traffic can be directed toward the configured target"
msgstr "无效/非 REALITY 流量可以被导向已配置 target"

msgid "For `VLESS + REALITY + RAW`, the closest functional mapping is therefore:"
msgstr "因此，对 `VLESS + REALITY + RAW` 而言，最接近的功能映射是："

msgid "This layered mapping prevents a common documentation error: describing the REALITY short ID as if it were a replacement for a VLESS UUID, or describing REALITY as if it encoded the destination address. It does neither."
msgstr "这种分层映射可以避免一个常见文档错误：把 REALITY short ID 描述成 VLESS UUID 的替代品，或者把 REALITY 描述成会编码目标地址。实际上两者都不是。"

msgid "Parser, Timing, and Boundary Conditions"
msgstr "解析、时序与边界条件"

msgid "Treat ClientHello as a length-delimited TLS handshake carried over a TCP byte stream; never assume TCP packet boundaries are message boundaries."
msgstr "应把 ClientHello 视为承载在 TCP 字节流上的长度限定 TLS 握手；绝不能把 TCP 数据包边界当作消息边界。"

msgid "Validate timestamp freshness with the implementation's accepted clock window. `maxTimeDiff` is expressed in milliseconds; large client/server clock skew can make otherwise correct key material fail when a non-zero limit is enforced."
msgstr "应按照实现接受的时钟窗口验证时间戳新鲜度。`maxTimeDiff` 单位为毫秒；启用非零限制时，较大的客户端/服务端时钟偏差可能让本来正确的密钥材料验证失败。"

msgid "The 8-byte short-ID slot is configured as hexadecimal text. Current Xray accepts at most 16 hex characters, requires an even number of characters, and pads shorter values with trailing zero bytes. An empty client short ID is only valid when the server explicitly accepts an empty entry."
msgstr "8 字节 short-ID 槽位以十六进制文本配置。当前 Xray 最多接受 16 个十六进制字符，字符数必须为偶数，较短值会在末尾补零字节。只有服务端显式接受空条目时，客户端 short ID 才可以为空。"

msgid "`minClientVer` and `maxClientVer`, when configured, add version checks to the REALITY authentication decision. They are separate from the inner VLESS protocol version byte."
msgstr "配置 `minClientVer` 和 `maxClientVer` 后，REALITY 认证判定会额外检查客户端版本。它们与内层 VLESS 协议版本字节是彼此独立的概念。"

msgid "A fingerprint must provide a TLS 1.3-capable key share. Current Xray-core rejects fingerprints that cannot supply the required ephemeral ECDH material."
msgstr "fingerprint 必须能提供支持 TLS 1.3 的 key share。当前 Xray-core 会拒绝无法提供所需临时 ECDH 材料的 fingerprint。"

msgid "Authentication failure and target fallback are not equivalent to successful proxy authentication. Seeing the target site's genuine certificate is a strong clue that the connection did not enter the authenticated REALITY path."
msgstr "认证失败并进入 target fallback 与代理认证成功不是同一件事。看到目标站点真实证书，是连接没有进入已认证 REALITY 路径的重要线索。"

msgid "A server can accept a no-SNI ClientHello by including an empty string in `serverNames`. Current Xray's client-side configuration uses a valid IP string as the `serverName` placeholder to request this mode; packet analysis should therefore not assume an SNI extension is always present."
msgstr "服务端可在 `serverNames` 中加入空字符串，从而接受无 SNI 的 ClientHello。当前 Xray 客户端配置使用一个有效 IP 字符串作为 `serverName` 占位值来请求这种模式，因此抓包分析不能假设 SNI 扩展一定存在。"

msgid "The TLS/uTLS implementation, REALITY implementation, target behavior, and peer version form one interoperability surface. Changes to ClientHello construction or the target site's TLS behavior can affect REALITY even when VLESS configuration is unchanged."
msgstr "TLS/uTLS 实现、REALITY 实现、target 行为以及对端版本共同构成一个互操作面。即使 VLESS 配置没有变化，ClientHello 构造方式或目标站 TLS 行为的变化也可能影响 REALITY。"

msgid "Post-quantum additions in current Xray"
msgstr "当前 Xray 的后量子扩展"

msgid "Current Xray can use the hybrid `X25519MLKEM768` TLS key-exchange group when the selected target supports it. This belongs to the TLS key-exchange portion of the REALITY handshake and is negotiated based on current client/target capability; it does not add a SOCKS-like command or a new proxy destination field."
msgstr "当所选 target 支持时，当前 Xray 可以使用混合 `X25519MLKEM768` TLS 密钥交换组。这属于 REALITY 握手中的 TLS 密钥交换部分，会根据客户端/target 当前能力协商；它不会增加 SOCKS 风格命令，也不会增加新的代理目标字段。"

msgid "Separately, `mldsa65Seed` on the server and `mldsa65Verify` on the client add an ML-DSA-65 signature check to the temporary REALITY certificate. Because the post-quantum signature enlarges that certificate, the official configuration guidance warns that the selected target should itself return a sufficiently large certificate so the REALITY certificate flight does not become an obvious size fingerprint."
msgstr "另外，服务端 `mldsa65Seed` 与客户端 `mldsa65Verify` 会为 REALITY 临时证书增加 ML-DSA-65 签名检查。由于后量子签名会增大该证书，官方配置说明特别提醒：所选 target 自身也应返回足够大的证书，避免 REALITY 证书握手因为尺寸差异形成明显指纹。"

msgid "These are optional hardening/interoperability features. A parser or diagnostic tool should report whether hybrid key exchange and ML-DSA verification were actually negotiated rather than assuming their presence from the word \"REALITY\" alone."
msgstr "这些都是可选的加固/互操作功能。解析器或诊断工具应报告混合密钥交换与 ML-DSA 验证是否实际启用或协商，而不能仅凭“REALITY”这个名称就假定它们一定存在。"

msgid "REALITY uses an X25519 server private key and the corresponding public value on the client. Current Xray names that client field `password`; `publicKey` is the older alias. The rename is operationally important: although the value is an X25519 public key mathematically, REALITY treats it as client-held connection credential material rather than as something to publish indiscriminately."
msgstr "REALITY 使用服务端 X25519 私钥以及客户端对应的公共值。当前 Xray 把客户端字段命名为 `password`，`publicKey` 是旧别名。这个改名在运维上很重要：虽然该值在数学上确实是 X25519 公钥，但 REALITY 把它视为客户端持有的连接凭据材料，而不是应当随意公开的信息。"

msgid "Do not place a server private key in client profiles, screenshots, issue reports, or public documentation examples. Treat the client `password` value as sensitive deployment material as well, even though it is derived from the server's public key."
msgstr "不要把服务端私钥放进客户端配置、截图、Issue 报告或公开文档示例。客户端 `password` 值即使源自服务端公钥，也应作为敏感部署材料处理。"

msgid "At the current Xray configuration boundary a short ID is 0 to 8 bytes, encoded as 0 to 16 hexadecimal characters. Its textual length must be even; shorter values are padded with zero bytes to fill the 8-byte Session-ID metadata slot. This is why a value such as `aa1234` is valid while an odd-length hexadecimal string is rejected."
msgstr "在当前 Xray 配置边界上，short ID 为 0 到 8 字节，以 0 到 16 个十六进制字符编码。文本长度必须为偶数；较短值会用零字节补足 8 字节 Session-ID 元数据槽位。因此 `aa1234` 这类值有效，而奇数长度的十六进制字符串会被拒绝。"

msgid "Current Xray documentation explicitly warns that a poorly chosen target can turn the REALITY server into an unintended forwarder for traffic that fails authentication. Current releases provide optional `limitFallbackUpload` and `limitFallbackDownload` token-bucket controls for unauthenticated fallback traffic, but the official guidance also notes that deterministic fallback rate limits can themselves become a fingerprint. They are an abuse-control tradeoff, not part of REALITY authentication."
msgstr "当前 Xray 文档明确警告：选择不当的 target 可能让 REALITY 服务端变成未预期的认证失败流量转发器。当前版本提供可选的 `limitFallbackUpload` 和 `limitFallbackDownload` 令牌桶控制来限制未认证 fallback 流量，但官方说明也指出，确定性的 fallback 限速本身可能形成指纹。这属于滥用控制上的权衡，而不是 REALITY 认证的一部分。"

msgid "Xray-core REALITY client implementation: <https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/main/transport/internet/reality/reality.go>"
msgstr "Xray-core REALITY 客户端实现：<https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/main/transport/internet/reality/reality.go>"

msgid "XTLS/REALITY server implementation and protocol notes: <https://github.com/XTLS/REALITY>"
msgstr "XTLS/REALITY 服务端实现与协议说明：<https://github.com/XTLS/REALITY>"

msgid "VLESS is a lightweight, stateless proxy protocol from the Xray ecosystem. Its baseline request carries destination metadata and user identity. Historically VLESS relied almost entirely on a separate TLS or REALITY layer for confidentiality; current Xray also implements optional **VLESS Encryption**, a protocol-layer encrypted wrapper that can protect the VLESS request and body."
msgstr "VLESS 是 Xray 生态中的轻量、无状态代理协议。它的基础请求承载目标元数据和用户身份。过去 VLESS 的机密性几乎完全依赖独立的 TLS 或 REALITY 层；当前 Xray 还实现了可选的 **VLESS Encryption**，作为协议层加密包装来保护 VLESS 请求与正文。"

msgid "The user identity is not itself encryption. Traditional deployments therefore pair VLESS with TLS or REALITY. Current Xray can instead, or additionally, use VLESS Encryption; that protects the VLESS payload but does not by itself create the ordinary HTTPS appearance supplied by TLS or REALITY."
msgstr "用户身份本身并不是加密。因此传统部署会把 VLESS 与 TLS 或 REALITY 配合使用。当前 Xray 可以改用或额外叠加 VLESS Encryption；它能保护 VLESS payload，但自身不会产生 TLS 或 REALITY 所提供的普通 HTTPS 外观。"

msgid "The client establishes the configured outer transport and, if configured, TLS/REALITY."
msgstr "客户端先建立已配置的外层传输，并在启用时完成 TLS/REALITY。"

msgid "If VLESS Encryption is enabled, client and server complete its key-exchange wrapper (or resume an accepted 0-RTT session)."
msgstr "如果启用了 VLESS Encryption，客户端与服务端随后完成其密钥交换包装（或恢复一个被接受的 0-RTT 会话）。"

msgid "The client sends the VLESS request containing user identity, command, and destination information through the resulting plain or encrypted body path."
msgstr "客户端通过得到的明文或加密正文路径，发送包含用户身份、命令和目标信息的 VLESS 请求。"

msgid "The server validates the VLESS user and requested mode."
msgstr "服务端验证 VLESS 用户与所请求的模式。"

msgid "Application traffic is relayed through the same layered path."
msgstr "应用流量继续通过同一套分层路径转发。"

msgid "VLESS Encryption: Outer Handshake and Record Layer"
msgstr "VLESS Encryption：外层握手与记录层"

msgid "VLESS Encryption is negotiated by configuration rather than by adding a new method-selection field to the baseline VLESS header. The client `encryption` and server `decryption` strings must describe compatible handshake and traffic-appearance modes. Current official configuration uses `mlkem768x25519plus` as the handshake method and exposes three appearances: `native`, `xorpub`, and `random`."
msgstr "VLESS Encryption 通过配置预先约定，而不是在基础 VLESS 头中增加新的方法选择字段。客户端 `encryption` 与服务端 `decryption` 字符串必须描述兼容的握手与流量外观模式。当前官方配置使用 `mlkem768x25519plus` 作为握手方式，并提供三种外观：`native`、`xorpub` 和 `random`。"

msgid "A typical generated pair conceptually has this shape:"
msgstr "一组典型生成配置在概念上具有以下形态："

msgid "The authentication key block can use X25519 material or ML-KEM-768 material. The ephemeral handshake itself combines ML-KEM-768 with X25519, so the configured static authentication choice and the per-connection PFS exchange are different concepts."
msgstr "认证密钥块可以使用 X25519 材料或 ML-KEM-768 材料。临时握手本身会组合 ML-KEM-768 与 X25519，因此配置中的静态认证选择和每条连接上的 PFS 交换是两个不同概念。"

msgid "1-RTT client-to-server handshake layout"
msgstr "1-RTT 客户端到服务端握手布局"

msgid "The current `proxy/vless/encryption` implementation starts with a random 16-byte IV followed by one or more **NFS relays** derived from the configured static authentication keys. For a relay using X25519, the public-key contribution is 32 bytes; for ML-KEM-768, the encapsulated ciphertext contribution is 1088 bytes. When more than one configured relay participates, 32-byte BLAKE3-derived linkage values bind the relay chain so an intermediate relay cannot simply be replaced."
msgstr "当前 `proxy/vless/encryption` 实现以随机 16 字节 IV 开始，随后是由已配置静态认证密钥派生的一个或多个 **NFS relay**。使用 X25519 的 relay 中，公钥贡献为 32 字节；使用 ML-KEM-768 时，封装密文贡献为 1088 字节。当多个已配置 relay 参与时，会使用 32 字节、由 BLAKE3 派生的链接值绑定 relay 链，使中间 relay 不能被简单替换。"

msgid "After the IV and NFS relay area, the normal 1-RTT client handshake sends:"
msgstr "在 IV 与 NFS relay 区域之后，普通 1-RTT 客户端握手继续发送："

msgid "Why `18` bytes for a two-byte length? The length itself is a big-endian `uint16`, and the AEAD adds a 16-byte authentication tag. Likewise, the 1216-byte hybrid client PFS public material becomes 1232 bytes after the tag. The client can split the configured padding into multiple writes with delays; those write boundaries are camouflage behavior and are not protocol-message boundaries for a parser."
msgstr "为什么两字节长度字段在线路上占 `18` 字节？长度本身是大端 `uint16`，AEAD 还会增加 16 字节认证 tag。同理，1216 字节的客户端混合 PFS 公共材料加 tag 后变为 1232 字节。客户端可以按配置把 padding 拆成多次写入并插入延迟；这些写入边界属于伪装行为，并不是解析器可以依赖的协议消息边界。"

msgid "The server first derives the NFS key from the relay area and uses it to open the encrypted length. For the 1-RTT path it then decrypts the 1184-byte ML-KEM-768 encapsulation key plus the 32-byte X25519 public key, creates its own ML-KEM and X25519 contributions, and derives a 64-byte PFS secret (`32 ML-KEM + 32 X25519`). That PFS secret is combined with the per-connection NFS key to form the keying material used by the later record layer."
msgstr "服务端首先从 relay 区域派生 NFS key，并用它解开加密长度。对 1-RTT 路径，随后解密 1184 字节 ML-KEM-768 encapsulation key 与 32 字节 X25519 公钥，生成自身的 ML-KEM 和 X25519 贡献，并派生 64 字节 PFS secret（`32 ML-KEM + 32 X25519`）。该 PFS secret 再与本连接 NFS key 组合，形成后续记录层使用的密钥材料。"

msgid "The 1-RTT server response begins with:"
msgstr "1-RTT 服务端响应以以下内容开始："

msgid "The first field is 1120 bytes of server PFS public/ciphertext material plus a 16-byte tag. The ticket plaintext is 16 bytes and becomes 32 bytes with its tag. The first two ticket bytes encode the accepted ticket lifetime. A zero lifetime means there is no resumable 0-RTT session."
msgstr "第一个字段由 1120 字节服务端 PFS 公共/密文材料加 16 字节 tag 构成。ticket 明文为 16 字节，加 tag 后变为 32 字节。ticket 的前两字节编码服务端接受的有效期；有效期为 0 表示不存在可恢复的 0-RTT 会话。"

msgid "0-RTT resumption and replay boundary"
msgstr "0-RTT 恢复与重放边界"

msgid "When the client is configured for `0rtt`, has an unexpired cached ticket, and the server allows resumption, it can avoid the full PFS exchange. It still creates a fresh IV and NFS key, then sends:"
msgstr "当客户端配置为 `0rtt`、持有尚未过期的缓存 ticket，且服务端允许恢复时，可以跳过完整 PFS 交换。客户端仍会生成新的 IV 与 NFS key，然后发送："

msgid "The resumed traffic key combines the cached PFS secret with the **new** NFS key, so each resumed connection still has fresh connection-specific material. The server stores NFS-key use per ticket and rejects a repeated key as a replay. If the ticket has expired, current server code sends random-looking bytes so the client abandons the cached session and retries with a new handshake rather than silently accepting old 0-RTT state."
msgstr "恢复后的流量密钥由缓存 PFS secret 与**新的** NFS key 组合，因此每条恢复连接仍拥有新的连接专用材料。服务端会按 ticket 记录 NFS key 的使用情况，并把重复 key 视为重放而拒绝。如果 ticket 已过期，当前服务端代码会发送随机外观字节，让客户端放弃缓存会话并重新进行握手，而不是静默接受旧 0-RTT 状态。"

msgid "0-RTT therefore reduces startup latency; it is not a promise that arbitrary application actions become replay-safe. A caller should keep the same security caution it would apply to any early-data mechanism."
msgstr "因此 0-RTT 只是在降低启动延迟，并不保证任意应用操作都具备重放安全性。调用方应像对待其他 early-data 机制一样保留相同的安全谨慎。"

msgid "Encrypted application-record layout"
msgstr "加密应用记录布局"

msgid "After either handshake path, the VLESS header and subsequent body are carried through `CommonConn`. Current Xray splits writes into plaintext chunks of at most 8192 bytes and wraps each chunk as:"
msgstr "无论采用哪种握手路径，VLESS 头和后续正文都会通过 `CommonConn` 承载。当前 Xray 会把写入拆成最多 8192 字节的明文块，并按以下格式包装每块："

msgid "The five-byte prefix intentionally has the shape of a TLS 1.3 application-data record (`17 03 03`), but **VLESS Encryption is not TLS**. The header is used as AEAD associated data. Receivers require a ciphertext length from 17 through 16640 bytes; malformed headers, truncated records, or failed AEAD tags terminate that encrypted stream."
msgstr "五字节前缀有意采用 TLS 1.3 application-data record（`17 03 03`）的外形，但 **VLESS Encryption 并不是 TLS**。该头部会作为 AEAD associated data。接收方要求密文长度位于 17 到 16640 字节之间；头部异常、记录截断或 AEAD tag 校验失败都会终止这条加密流。"

msgid "Record keys are derived with BLAKE3 from the handshake key material and a connection-specific context. Current code chooses AES-GCM when the endpoint has appropriate AES-GCM hardware support and otherwise uses ChaCha20-Poly1305; the server can detect the peer choice while opening the first encrypted handshake length. Nonces increment independently by direction. The implementation also has a rekey path if the 96-bit nonce counter reaches its maximum rather than allowing nonce reuse."
msgstr "记录密钥由握手密钥材料与连接专用上下文通过 BLAKE3 派生。当前代码在端点具备合适 AES-GCM 硬件支持时选择 AES-GCM，否则使用 ChaCha20-Poly1305；服务端可以在解开首个加密握手长度时识别对端选择。两个方向的 nonce 独立递增。若 96 位 nonce 计数器达到最大值，实现还会执行 rekey，而不是允许 nonce 复用。"

msgid "`native`, `xorpub`, and `random` capture appearance"
msgstr "`native`、`xorpub` 与 `random` 的抓包外观"

msgid "These options change observable encoding, not the inner VLESS command format:"
msgstr "这些选项改变的是可观察编码，而不是内层 VLESS 命令格式："

msgid "`native` leaves the key-exchange public/ciphertext material in its native representation and retains the TLS-record-like five-byte data headers;"
msgstr "`native` 保留密钥交换公共/密文材料的原生表示，并保留类似 TLS record 的五字节数据头；"

msgid "`xorpub` masks the public/ciphertext portions of the NFS relay using a BLAKE3-derived AES-CTR stream, reducing their native public-key appearance;"
msgstr "`xorpub` 使用 BLAKE3 派生的 AES-CTR 流掩码 NFS relay 中的公共/密文部分，从而降低其原生公钥外观；"

msgid "`random` additionally masks the five-byte record headers in each direction, so the post-handshake stream no longer exposes the repeated `17 03 03` record-header pattern."
msgstr "`random` 还会额外掩码两个方向的五字节记录头，因此握手后的数据流不再暴露重复的 `17 03 03` 记录头模式。"

msgid "If VLESS Encryption itself is carried inside real TLS or REALITY, an ordinary on-path capture sees the outer TLS/REALITY layer first. The inner appearance mode only becomes directly observable after removing that outer layer."
msgstr "如果 VLESS Encryption 本身承载在真实 TLS 或 REALITY 内部，普通链路抓包首先看到的是外层 TLS/REALITY。只有移除该外层之后，内层 appearance 模式才会直接可见。"

msgid "Encryption state machine and failure scope"
msgstr "加密状态机与错误作用域"

msgid "This introduces an error layer that baseline SOCKS5 does not have. A failed ML-KEM/X25519 exchange or AEAD tag means the server has not yet reached the VLESS UUID/command parser; changing a destination address or SOCKS-style command cannot repair such a failure."
msgstr "这引入了基础 SOCKS5 不具备的一层错误。ML-KEM/X25519 交换失败或 AEAD tag 失败意味着服务端甚至尚未到达 VLESS UUID/命令解析器；修改目标地址或类似 SOCKS 的命令无法修复这种故障。"

msgid "For baseline TCP relay, end-of-stream propagates through the selected outer transport. With VLESS Encryption enabled, EOF/reset first crosses the encrypted record wrapper and only then the baseline VLESS body. Implementations need to distinguish:"
msgstr "对基础 TCP 转发，流结束会沿所选外层传输传播。启用 VLESS Encryption 后，EOF/reset 会先穿过加密记录包装，再到基础 VLESS 正文。实现需要区分："

msgid "VLESS Encryption handshake failure,"
msgstr "VLESS Encryption 握手失败；"

msgid "expired or replayed 0-RTT ticket,"
msgstr "过期或被重放的 0-RTT ticket；"

msgid "malformed encrypted record header or failed AEAD tag,"
msgstr "畸形加密记录头或 AEAD tag 校验失败；"

msgid "With TLS keys or instrumentation below TLS, the next layer is either the baseline VLESS request header or, when enabled, the VLESS Encryption handshake. After a VLESS Encryption 1-RTT handshake, `native`/`xorpub` mode commonly exposes five-byte inner record headers shaped as `17 03 03 <BE16 length>`; `random` masks those headers as well. These are inner VLESS Encryption records, not a second real TLS session."
msgstr "拥有 TLS 密钥或能在 TLS 之下进行插桩时，下一层要么是基础 VLESS 请求头，要么在启用时是 VLESS Encryption 握手。完成 VLESS Encryption 1-RTT 握手后，`native`/`xorpub` 模式通常会显露形如 `17 03 03 <BE16 length>` 的五字节内层记录头；`random` 还会掩码这些头部。这些是内层 VLESS Encryption 记录，而不是第二层真实 TLS 会话。"

msgid "VLESS / current Xray"
msgstr "VLESS / 当前 Xray"

msgid "Baseline none; optional VLESS Encryption; TLS/REALITY can be an additional outer layer"
msgstr "基础模式无；可选 VLESS Encryption；TLS/REALITY 还可作为额外外层"

msgid "Encryption negotiation"
msgstr "加密协商"

msgid "none in RFC 1928/1929"
msgstr "RFC 1928/1929 中没有"

msgid "preconfigured `encryption` / `decryption`; no on-wire method list"
msgstr "预配置 `encryption` / `decryption`；线路上没有方法列表"

msgid "Encryption handshake"
msgstr "加密握手"

msgid "none"
msgstr "无"

msgid "optional NFS authentication + ML-KEM-768/X25519 hybrid PFS, or ticket resumption"
msgstr "可选 NFS 认证 + ML-KEM-768/X25519 混合 PFS，或 ticket 恢复"

msgid "Early data"
msgstr "Early data"

msgid "SOCKS request follows method/auth completion"
msgstr "SOCKS 请求在方法/认证完成后发送"

msgid "VLESS Encryption can resume with ticket-backed 0-RTT"
msgstr "VLESS Encryption 可以使用 ticket 支持的 0-RTT 恢复"

msgid "Encrypted record framing"
msgstr "加密记录分帧"

msgid "none beyond TCP"
msgstr "除 TCP 外没有额外记录层"

msgid "optional `17 03 03 + uint16 length + AEAD(ciphertext)` style records; `random` masks header appearance"
msgstr "可选的 `17 03 03 + uint16 length + AEAD(ciphertext)` 风格记录；`random` 会掩码头部外观"

msgid "Failure before proxy command"
msgstr "代理命令之前的失败"

msgid "method/auth failure"
msgstr "方法/认证失败"

msgid "outer transport or VLESS Encryption handshake/AEAD failure can happen before UUID/command parsing"
msgstr "外层传输或 VLESS Encryption 握手/AEAD 失败可能发生在 UUID/命令解析之前"

msgid "The conceptual inheritance is still recognizable: authenticate/identify the client, express a command, encode a destination, then relay traffic. Baseline VLESS compresses those control phases into one request header. Current VLESS Encryption adds a separate configured cryptographic wrapper **before** that header, while TLS/REALITY, XHTTP, and multiplexing can still add further outer layers. None of those encryption stages replaces the VLESS destination command."
msgstr "概念上的继承关系仍然清晰：认证/识别客户端、表达命令、编码目标，然后转发流量。基础 VLESS 把这些控制阶段压缩进一个请求头。当前 VLESS Encryption 又在该头**之前**增加一个独立、由配置确定的密码学包装；TLS/REALITY、XHTTP 和多路复用还可以继续增加外层。任何加密阶段都不会替代 VLESS 目标命令。"

msgid "If VLESS Encryption is enabled, bound/read the IV, relay area, encrypted lengths, PFS material, ticket, and padding exactly; reject failed AEAD tags."
msgstr "如果启用 VLESS Encryption，应对 IV、relay 区域、加密长度、PFS 材料、ticket 与 padding 设置边界并精确读取；AEAD tag 校验失败必须拒绝。"

msgid "Keep 0-RTT ticket expiry and replay rejection distinct from UUID or destination rejection."
msgstr "应把 0-RTT ticket 过期/重放拒绝与 UUID 或目标拒绝明确区分。"

msgid "Parse encrypted application records incrementally: exactly 5 header bytes, then exactly the declared ciphertext length; never use transport read boundaries as record boundaries."
msgstr "应增量解析加密应用记录：先精确读取 5 字节头，再精确读取声明的密文长度；绝不能把传输层读取边界当作记录边界。"

msgid "Test `native`, `xorpub`, and `random` independently if the selected core exposes them; they change outer encoding, not the baseline VLESS header."
msgstr "如果所选核心提供 `native`、`xorpub` 和 `random`，应分别测试；它们改变的是外层编码，而不是基础 VLESS 头。"

msgid "VLESS Encryption"
msgstr "VLESS Encryption"

msgid "Current Xray treats VLESS Encryption as optional **protocol-layer security**. It can make `streamSettings.security: \"none\"` acceptable on a public-address connection from the confidentiality/integrity perspective, but the official transport guidance explicitly distinguishes that from censorship camouflage: VLESS Encryption does not make the connection look like ordinary HTTPS in the way TLS or REALITY can."
msgstr "当前 Xray 把 VLESS Encryption 视为可选的**协议层安全机制**。从机密性/完整性角度，它可以让公网地址连接使用 `streamSettings.security: \"none\"`；但官方传输说明明确把这与抗审查伪装区分开：VLESS Encryption 不会像 TLS 或 REALITY 那样让连接具有普通 HTTPS 外观。"

msgid "Use `xray vlessenc` to generate matching client `encryption` and server `decryption` values unless there is a specific reason to construct the detailed blocks manually. A mismatch in handshake method, appearance, or authentication material fails before the baseline VLESS request can be decoded."
msgstr "除非有明确理由手工构造详细配置块，否则应使用 `xray vlessenc` 生成匹配的客户端 `encryption` 与服务端 `decryption` 值。握手方式、appearance 或认证材料不匹配会在基础 VLESS 请求被解码之前就失败。"

msgid "Current Xray also allows Vision with VLESS Encryption without the older transport restrictions. If the underlying path cannot use direct raw copying, Vision can still penetrate the VLESS Encryption layer to avoid redundant crypto-copy overhead; on compatible raw TCP paths it can additionally attempt the normal direct/splice optimization. This is an optimization layer above the wire-format correctness described earlier, not a new VLESS command."
msgstr "当前 Xray 还允许 Vision 与 VLESS Encryption 配合使用，而不受旧有传输限制。如果底层路径无法使用直接 raw copy，Vision 仍可穿透 VLESS Encryption 层以避免重复的加密复制开销；在兼容的原始 TCP 路径上，还可以进一步尝试常规 direct/splice 优化。这是建立在线格式正确性之上的优化层，并不是新的 VLESS 命令。"

msgid "When documenting Chimera compatibility, treat Vision and VLESS Encryption support separately from basic VLESS request parsing."
msgstr "记录 Chimera 兼容性时，应把 Vision 与 VLESS Encryption 支持和基础 VLESS 请求解析能力分开说明。"

msgid "Xray-core VLESS Encryption client implementation: <https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/main/proxy/vless/encryption/client.go>"
msgstr "Xray-core VLESS Encryption 客户端实现：<https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/main/proxy/vless/encryption/client.go>"

msgid "Xray-core VLESS Encryption server implementation: <https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/main/proxy/vless/encryption/server.go>"
msgstr "Xray-core VLESS Encryption 服务端实现：<https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/main/proxy/vless/encryption/server.go>"

msgid "Xray-core VLESS Encryption record implementation: <https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/main/proxy/vless/encryption/common.go>"
msgstr "Xray-core VLESS Encryption 记录层实现：<https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/main/proxy/vless/encryption/common.go>"
